window.FWN_MESMERIZING_GHOST_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MESMERIZING_GHOST_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4401,"title":"Chapter 4401: Survival Is Difficult","paragraphs":["Chapter 4401: Survival Is Difficult","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Here, have a fruit,” he handed them each a spirit fruit.","The two little guys watched as he took out a few fruits from the dusty ring, and couldn’t help but widen their eyes in wonder. Muchen looked at the ring on his finger and asked, ” Big Brother, is there a fruit in mine too?”","Hao’er glanced at his interspatial ring. Perhaps because the spirit energy in him was sealed, his interspatial ring was also grey and dull, without the slightest luster. The difference was that his still had a trace of the spirit energy, while Muchen’s could not sense the presence of any spirit energy at all.","“Your spirit energy should be sealed as well. As long as you open the sealed spirit energy, you can also take things out of the interspatial ring,” Hao’er explained.","“What about me? What about me?” Yue’er also hurriedly asked, “Why don’t I have any?”","“Yours is here,”","he said, pointing to an inconspicuous little bracelet on her wrist. “Everything you own is kept in here. Remember, you must not lose a single thing. Your parents gave it to us. And don’t tell anyone about the interspatial ring or the interspatial bracelet.”","That morning, Hao’er told them a lot of things and taught them a lot of things. It wasn’t until they heard their stomachs rumble that Hao’er said, “We’re in this situation, so let’s stay here for now! After I practice for a few days and improve my strength a bit, I’ll take you guys out again.”","“Mmm-hmm,” the two little ones nodded in agreement.","“Big Brother, the wolf brought the dead chicken last night,” said Yue’er, pointing at the stiff chicken at the cave entrance. She whispered, “Yue’er wants to eat meat, but Yue’er doesn’t know how to cook it.” With that, she hung her head down and played with her little fingers, tugging at the corner of her clothes.","Hao’er thought for a moment and said with determination, “I’ll try.”","Upon hearing this, the two little ones’ eyes lit up. ” Big Brother can cook?”","“I’ve seen Mother do it, and I’ve also eaten the roast chicken she made, it was delicious,” Hao’er said with a smile, and immediately led them outside.","As soon as they stepped outside, even though the wolves were hidden in the dark, Hao’er noticed them at once. He looked at the dead pheasant in the cave and then at the wolves hiding, and after thinking for a moment, he said, “Catch me two more pheasants.”","Fearing that the wolves did not understand him, he walked up to the hole and waved the dead pheasant: “This one.”","The two little guys couldn’t help but look at each other when they heard his words. Just as they were wondering, they heard a rustling sound coming from the forest. Then, a few wolves darted away. It wasn’t long before they returned with two freshly killed pheasants in their mouths.","“Big Brother, how come those wolves listened to you?” Yue’er asked curiously.","Hao’er smiled and said, ” My contract beast is a Silver Wolf. They must have sensed the Wolf King’s aura on me. Alright, let’s go pick some branches.”","He led the two little ones to pick up some branches around them. When the wolves saw them picking up branches, they also helped them by bringing some over.","Hao’er cleaned the two pheasants at the water source he discovered yesterday, skinned them directly, and then carried them back to roast them over the fire. However, since he didn’t do this kind of thing very often, both pheasants were burnt black.","Looking at the burnt pheasants and then at his younger siblings sitting next to him, blinking at him and waiting to eat the meat, Hao’er felt a little heat on his face and was a little embarrassed: “It seems to be burnt. Why don’t we roast another one?”"]},{"number":4402,"title":"Chapter 4402: No Response","paragraphs":["Chapter 4402: No Response","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Can we eat the meat inside? We’ll just eat the meat inside,” Muchen asked, pointing at the two charred chickens.","Upon hearing this, Hao’er looked at them and used a dagger to cut off the burnt exterior, and then cut up the meat inside for them to eat: ” Try it.”","Chen’er took it, and first handed it to Yue’er before taking a piece for himself.","“Mmm, delicious,” Yue’er said happily, eating it in small bites, changing hands as she went, blowing on it with her little mouth.","“Mmm, delicious,” Muchen nodded in agreement.","Seeing this, Hao’er cut off a piece and ate it. However, as soon as he put it in his mouth, he tasted the burnt flavour and the charred texture of the meat, which was very hard. Coupled with the lack of seasoning, there was nothing but the burnt flavour, which made it hard to eat.","He watched Muchen and Muyue eating with relish, and his heart ached. His eyes welled up with tears, which he swallowed back as he lowered his head, biting into the burnt meat in his mouth, so that they would not notice.","Even if his memory had not fully awakened, he knew that they were born into noble families and lived a life of luxury. Now, however, he was making his younger siblings hungry by feeding them burnt pheasant.","“Stop eating. There’s still some pastries in the space, and a small piece of dried meat. Eat that!” He reached out and took the meat from their hands, and threw it into the extinguished fire.","The two little ones looked at him, and seeing his reddened eyes, they couldn’t help but ask worriedly, ” Big Brother, what’s wrong with you?”","“Eat this, but don’t eat this one, throw it away.” He threw the two burnt pheasants away and stuffed the pastry wrapped in paper into their arms, along with a small piece of dried meat.","The two little ones looked at the things in their arms and hesitated. Yue’er’s young voice said softly, ” But we can’t get out, should we save these until we’re very hungry?”","“It’s alright, just eat it! We’ll figure it out after we eat,” he said, signalling for them to eat.","Seeing this, the two little ones looked at each other. Chen’er then divided the small piece of jerky into three pieces and handed one to Hao’er: “Big Brother, you eat too.” He then took some pastries and gave them to him.","“I don’t want the jerky, I’ll just have some pastries,” Hao’er said, handing the jerky to Yue’er: “For Yue’er.”","“Yue’er doesn’t want it, Big Brother can have it,” Yue’er shook her little head and pushed it back.","“Big Brother, you eat it! We’ll share it,” Chen’er said, looking at him.","Hao’er shook his head and said, “This piece of jerky is not just any jerky, it’s spirit beast meat, and eating it will be good for your health.” He divided his piece of jerky into two and handed it to the two of them: “You eat it and see if it can stimulate the spirit energy in your bodies, and I’ll get you some medicinal pills to eat later.”","The two little guys glanced at each other and, seeing that he was unwilling to eat it, took it. They asked again, “Big Brother, if we have spirit energy, can we go back to find Father and Mother?”","Hearing them mention their parents, Hao’er’s mind flashed back to a scene. He came back to his senses and said, “You both have contract beasts like me, only that your spirit energy is sealed and your contract beasts cannot come out. If you can restore your spirit energy and let your contract beasts come out, perhaps we can think of a way to go back sooner.”","“Can Big Brother’s contract beast come out?” Yue’er asked curiously.","Hao’er shook his head: “It’s probably injured, or maybe my cultivation base is too weak. I called for it, but there was no response.”"]},{"number":4403,"title":"Chapter 4403: This Day Will Eventually Come","paragraphs":["Chapter 4403: This Day Will Eventually Come","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Seeing the two little faces grow dim, he hurriedly reassured them, “But Mother gave me a lot of medicinal pills, so maybe some of them can come in handy.” With that, he quickly took out some small bottles from his space and rummaged through them.","The two little ones saw so many nice-looking little bottles and also came forward to look. Muchen picked one up and saw that the words on the bottle said “hemostatic powder” . He then picked up another one to look at and discovered that there were two words underneath all the nice-looking little bottles.","“Ghost Doctor?” Muchen read out softly. He recognised these two characters, and when he read them out, he felt an inexplicable sense of familiarity.","“Big Brother, there are the words “Ghost Doctor” written on the bottom of this bottle. Who is this Ghost Doctor? Could it be Mother?” Muchen asked, and a vague feeling welled up in his mind, but as he thought about it, his head began to hurt again.","“Arghhhhh!” He put down the bottle and let out a cry as he wrapped his hands around his head.","“Brother!” Hao’er hurriedly came up to hug him, ” Don’t think about it, you can’t break that seal right now, don’t think about it.”","Muchen gradually calmed down, a layer of cold sweat dripped from his forehead, and his gaze fell on the bottle: “But I feel that the Ghost Doctor on this bottle, and these medicines, are related to Mother.”","“Mother refined these medicines and gave them to me. The Ghost Doctor should be referring to Mother,” Hao’er said, staring at the bottle. “I just don’t know what kind of place we’re in right now, but I know that our home is in the Phoenix Empire.”","The moment Muchen read out the name “Ghost Doctor” , the figure in red appeared in his mind once again. One scene after another flashed past, with names after names, but their names were missing.","“Big Brother, when are we leaving here? Let’s go find a way out! If we find a way home, can we go home by ourselves?” Yue’er looked at him with her big, beautiful eyes, her little face full of excitement.","Hao’er nodded and said, “Alright, but we have to wait until I’ve finished cultivating. If we go out now, I’m afraid I won’t be able to protect you from danger.”","Hearing his words, the two of them didn’t say anything else, but instead helped him look for something edible.","“Can we eat this medicinal pill? What is it for?”","“And what is it for again? Can Big Brother eat it?”","The two little guys asked while holding the medicinal pills, even though they could read the characters, they had no idea what they were for.","On the other side, in the Xuanyuan Empire, in the Palace.","Xuanyuan Mo Ze watched Feng Jiu poring over books all day, trying to find a way to break the ancient blood formation, and he sighed as he walked over to her side and took the book away from her.","“Stop reading. You haven’t rested in days. This isn’t going to work.”","Feng Jiu paused, and said, “My three children are suffering in some place, I don’t know what kind of suffering. How can I just leave it be? How can I not find a way to solve this?”","“In fact, I had a feeling this day would come a long time ago,”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze said, sitting down next to her: “The Taoist Priest once said that the two children would face many trials and tribulations and it was uncertain whether they would live through itand grow up. Although you found the ancient sacred beast for them and lit up their fate stars, if they were by our side, how could they possibly experience those so-called tribulations?”"]},{"number":4404,"title":"Chapter 4404: Plans","paragraphs":["Chapter 4404: Plans","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Feng Jiu remained silent and said nothing. The stars that governed the lives of the two children had been set in motion when she helped them contract with the ancient divine beasts, allowing them to share their lives with the ancient divine beasts. However, she also knew that even if she managed to get the two children a contract beast to contract with, it would not be the end of the matter.","Just like her, even though she contracted the ancient divine beast Fire Phoenix, it has been full of perils along the way, and for them to grow up, they must also experience those dangers and difficulties.","Even if they are determined to protect the two children by their side and shield them from danger and perils, what is meant to be will eventually come, it’s just that she didn’t expect this day to come so soon.","Xuanyuan Mo Ze took her hand and said, “Don’t worry too much. We should be grateful that they have their contract beasts with them, and that Hao’er disappeared with them. Maybe the three children are together.”","“Will they be together?” Feng Jiu looked at him, a little uncertain.","He squeezed her hand and said, “Don’t worry! They have a lot of blessings, and they will definitely turn bad into good. Besides, I’ve been thinking for the past two days that the reason the Devil Lord’s ancient blood curse broke was because the children were bound to our bloodline. So I’m thinking that since Hao’er doesn’t have our bloodline, the power of the ancient blood curse will be greatly weakened.”","Seeing her face tighten, he looked at her and added, “But this is just my guess. Right now, we don’t know which world they are in, so I was thinking that instead of waiting here, we might as well go out and look for them. Even if they are in one of the three thousand worlds, as long as we are determined, we will definitely hear from them one day.”","“Mm! Let’s go out and look for them, world by world!” She stood up and said, “I’ll pack and get ready now.” With that, she turned and walked towards her room.","Xuanyuan Mo Ze did not stop her, but just watched her figure as she rushed into the room before withdrawing his gaze. Half of what he said was to comfort her, and the other half was his guess. Now, where were the three children? No one knew. In recent days, they had tried many methods to no avail.","The jade token they had used to communicate with the three children had not responded at all. In the past few days, they had not heard a single word from the children, but Feng Jiu had been wasting away day by day. He knew that this could not continue.","Instead of letting her stay here waiting, rummaging through books all day, it would be better to take her around to look for them. At least in this way, every day she can hold onto a glimmer of hope and expectation.","“Hell’s Lord,” Du Fan walked in and bowed to him.","“You’ve come at the right time. I have something to tell you,”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze said, looking at him and continuing, “It’s been a few days since the incident with the three children, and Feng Manor still doesn’t know. You go back there yourself and talk to them. As for the Black Tortoise Monarch, Ah Jiu and I will go there ourselves. Also, Ah Jiu and I plan to go out and look for the children. You don’t have to follow us. After you’ve dealt with things on all sides, you can also go around looking for news.”","Hearing this, Du Fan was momentarily taken aback. “Hell’s Lord only plans to set off with my Master? You won’t bring anyone else with you?”","“Now, with our strength, who can harm us?” Xuanyuan Mo Ze said slowly, looking at him and adding, “This time, we will go out just the two of us, and you don’t need to follow. If you have news of the children, you can also send word to let us know.”"]},{"number":4405,"title":"Chapter 4405: Joy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4405: Joy","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Alright, I understand,” Du Fan saw that his mind was made up, so he didn’t say anything more. He bowed and then left.","On the other side, the three children were still in the mountains. They had been here for several days and were gradually getting used to the environment.","It is worth mentioning that in these few days, Hao’er has been practising his barbecue skills. Although he still cannot replicate the taste of the food his Mother used to cook for him, his skills have improved a lot compared to the first time.","They didn’t have to go hunting because the Wolf King would bring them prey. Worried that he couldn’t protect the two little ones, Hao’er spent the past few days teaching Chen’er and Yue’er martial arts in addition to practising himself. However, they had been unable to regain their spirit energy, so he could only teach them some basic techniques.","“Big Brother, I seem to have learned this before, I know how to do it,” Chen’er looked at the set of boxing techniques he was demonstrating, feeling very familiar with it, and immediately began to imitate him, landing each punch just right.","“Father must have taught you, he taught me this boxing technique,” Hao’er said, a smile appearing on his face.","“Yue’er seems to know how to do it too,” Yue’er said, tilting her little head, and also demonstrated a set of boxing techniques.","“Alright, you guys practise on your own. I’ll go over there under the tree and practise. Don’t go too far away, and if anything happens, just call out to me,” Hao’er instructed them, leaving them to practise on their own while he went under the tree, sat cross-legged and closed his eyes to practise.","The two little ones also practised seriously, because these days their Big Brother had told them that their Father and Mother were not by their side, and if they encountered bad people, they would have to find a way to protect themselves. Therefore, they had to practise hard and not be lazy.","In the mountains and forests, the climate was relatively humid. Although the sun was shining, the air was very damp. The two children have been practicing for a long morning, and their clothes are wet with sweat. They feel very uncomfortable, and because they have not washed, it feels like something is biting their bodies.","“Brother, Yue’er feels itchy here,” Yue’er said, twisting her small body slightly, trying to scratch her back but unable to reach it.","“Here?” Chen’er asked, helping her scratch the itch.","“No, a little more to the left, a little more, yes, that’s it.” The little person’s beautiful big eyes curved into a crescent moon as she beamed.","“That feels so good, Brother, scratch some more.” Yue’er giggled.","Seeing this, Chen said, “Let me take you for a bath! It’ll stop itching.”","“A bath? But the water there is so little, it’s not enough for a bath,” Yue’er said, looking at her Brother.","“Then let’s rub some lotion on it, or, let’s ask Big Brother and go find a bigger source of water. We haven’t bathed in a few days,” said Muchen, looking at his clothes, which had lost their original colour, and couldn’t help but frown.","“But Big Brother is cultivating,” Yue’er said softly, looking at Hao’er, who was sitting cross-legged with his eyes closed in meditation. After a moment’s thought, she said, “Why don’t we go by ourselves?”","Muchen was tempted, but in the end, he shook his head: “Big Brother will worry if we go by ourselves. Big Brother said we have to tell him where we are going, otherwise he won’t be able to find us.”","“Then let’s go get Big Brother,” said Yue’er, trotting up to him. “Big Brother, Yue’er wants to take a bath.”","Hao’er opened his eyes, let out a soft breath, and felt the breath in his body gradually condense. He could hardly hide his joy."]},{"number":4406,"title":"Chapter 4406: Take Care","paragraphs":["Chapter 4406: Take Care","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Alright, let’s go find it! Once we find it, we’ll take a bath and get out of here.” He stood up, looked around, called out, “Wolf King, come here,” and waved his hand.","The Wolf King got up from the grass when it heard his voice, and when it saw him waving at it, it paused for a moment before cautiously walking over.","“Get down.” Hao’er patted its hindquarters, and the Wolf King got down.","“Come, sit on its back, and we’ll ride it to find it,” Hao’er said, hugging Chen’er first to sit in front, then hugging Yue’er to sit on, and sitting himself in the back.","“Brother, grab its fur, don’t fall off, and keep your legs wrapped around its body,” Hao’er taught him from behind.","“Alright,” Muchen replied, and listened as he leaned slightly forward, his hands tightly grasping the Wolf King’s fur, and his calves tightly clamping its body.","In response, the Wolf King glanced back at them, didn’t move, and just waited for them to sit properly.","Yue’er held Chen’er in front of her, while Hao’er at the back stretched out his hands as far as he could to protect them, so that they wouldn’t fall over during the run.","“Go, go to the front,” Hao’er said, clinging to the Wolf King’s waist like he was riding a horse. As soon as he said that, the Wolf King sprinted off like the wind, followed by seven or eight wolves.","“Giggle, giggle, giggle... So much fun, so much fun...” Yue’er giggled happily, completely unafraid.","Chen’er’s eyes were also shining as they looked ahead. The Wolf King was running very fast, and the wind was blowing strongly in their faces. They watched as the trees around them quickly flashed past, and they just felt very happy.","It was also fortunate that it was in the middle of the mountains and old forests with very few people, otherwise, if they had seen three children riding a wolf and running through the mountains, for ordinary mortals, they would have probably been scared half to death.","After wandering in the mountains for a while, they found a larger mountain spring, so the three children prepared to wash their dirty bodies here.","“Big Brother, what if Yue’er has finished bathing and doesn’t have any clean clothes to wear?” The little person blinked at him, and she noticed that Big Brother always had a solution to everything.","“It’s alright, you go ahead and wash. When you’re done, wear Big Brother’s clothes. Later, I’ll wash and dry them for you,” Hao’er said. When Chen’er couldn’t undo his belt, Hao’er went up to him and said, “Let me do it.”","Muchen was overjoyed when the belt, which he had been struggling to undo for a long time, was finally undone. He said, “Thank you, Big Brother.”","“Hurry up and go wash, but don’t stay in for too long. This mountain spring water is so cold, you’ll get sick if you stay in for too long.” Hao’er looked at the sun above and was relieved that it was midday and the temperature was relatively warm.","“Mm hmm,” the two little ones responded, and Muchen took off his clothes first, a little shyly covering between his legs as he got into the water.","Yue’er tugged at her knotted hair and shouted, “Big Brother, my hair’s knotted.”","Hao’er was putting Chen’er’s clothes away when he heard Yue’er. Seeing her standing there with her outer clothes off, wearing only a small undershirt, pulling at her hair, he said, “Big Brother will wash your hair first. Come here.”","Yue’er obediently walked over, and he picked her up. He laid her body flat on his lap, and her head slightly down, so that she could dip it in the spring water.","“Let’s wash your face first, it’ll be a little cold,” Hao’er said, and used a small handkerchief to carefully wipe her little face clean, so that she could get used to the spring water before washing her hair.","After a good scrubbing, they finally managed to wash the two little ones clean. Hao’er was afraid that they would catch a cold, so he quickly took out his own clothes from his space and wrapped them up in them."]},{"number":4407,"title":"Chapter 4407: Spirit Energy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4407: Spirit Energy","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","After washing the two little ones’ clothes, he used the spirit energy in the palm of his hand to help them dry their clothes.","Watching him dry their clothes, the two little ones couldn’t help but widen their eyes: “That’s amazing!”","Upon hearing this, Hao’er revealed a smile: “My strength has only recovered a little, if it were fully recovered, it would be even more powerful.” With that, he helped them put on their dry clothes.","However, the problem arose again. Chen’er was fine, as her hair was simply tied up, but he had no idea how to tie Yue’er’s hair.","Chen’er watched his Big Brother tie Yue’er’s hair for a long time without success. Finally, when he saw him tie Yue’er’s hair into two crooked little horns, he himself couldn’t help but let out a breath of relief.","It’s a bit strange, but at least it’s done.","“Hee hee, Yue’er hasn’t had her hair tied in little horns before, Brother, does it look good?” The little person excitedly touched the two little horns on her head and looked at her Brother and asked.","Chen’er glanced at it and nodded, saying, “It looks good,” but it is a bit strange.","“Here, have another medicinal pill,” Hao’er took out another medicinal pill for them and stuffed it into their mouths.","“Big Brother, it’s no use if we eat this every day!” Yue’er said, but she swallowed the medicinal pill anyway.","“Whether it’s useful or not, it’s better to take it. When will you be able to condense the aura of spirit energy?” After giving them the medicinal pills, Hao’er filled some water and was about to take them away when he saw Muchen sitting there, covering his stomach and looking weird.","He was startled and hurried over: “Brother? What’s wrong? Is your stomach not feeling well?”","Muchen covered his stomach and felt a warm energy surging inside, but it seemed that the energy was not in his stomach. However, he inexplicably felt familiar.","“Big Brother, I seem to sense the spirit energy,” he said, and the strangeness on his delicate little face gradually dissipated, leaving only peace.","“Really?” Hao’er was overjoyed and said hurriedly, “Let me see!” He reached out and felt his hand pulse. When the spirit energy was released, sure enough, he felt the spirit energy surging and flowing through his body.","“That’s great! That’s great!” Hao’er’s face was full of excitement.","“My stomach is also warm, and it feels like something is walking around in there,” Yue’er said with big eyes, feeling a little strange because she felt that the energy was familiar.","“Quick! Take another medicinal pill!” Hao’er immediately took the Qi Gathering Pills out of the space again and gave each of them another one to eat.","None of the three little ones expected that their spirit energy would recover so quickly. It was just that their bodies once again produced spirit energy, but the seal was not broken.","If you had to say, you could probably only say that it was the innate spirit bodies of the two children combined with the effect of the medicinal pill that did it.","They had originally planned to find a way out today, but since Muchen and Muyue sensed the spirit energy again, the trip was delayed. On this day, they did not leave, but under Hao’er’s tutelage, they once again practiced the most basic cultivation techniques...","After several days, when the three children finally walked out of the mountains, they stopped and looked back at the Wolf King who had sent them out. After thinking for a moment, Hao’er took out a medicinal pill and beckoned to the Wolf King, calling, “Come here.”"]},{"number":4408,"title":"Chapter 4408: Careful","paragraphs":["Chapter 4408: Careful","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The Wolf King looked at him before walking up to him and giving a low woof, before lying down in front of him.","Hao’er patted the Wolf King on the head and said, “Thank you these past few days. Here, take this medicinal pill.” He shoved the medicinal pill into the Wolf King’s mouth. It wasn’t some rare medicinal pill, but it was one that his Mother had refined, and it was considered payment for the Wolf King guarding them these past few days and giving them prey to hunt.","“Ow!” The Wolf King swallowed the medicinal pill, let out an excited yelp, and rubbed his head against the palm of his hand.","Hao’er withdrew his hand, and then led the two little ones beside him along the mountain path.","The Wolf King watched from behind until they were out of sight, and then let out three yelps, leaped into the air, and returned to the depths of the mountains...","The three children walked along the mountain path until noon. The scorching sun above their heads made them sweat from time to time, so they came to rest under a tree by the side of the road.","“Sister, drink some water,” said Hao’er, taking some out of his space and offering it to her to drink first.","After Yue’er had finished, she handed it back to him, saying, ” Big Brother, drink too.”","“Drink some water, little Brother. Drink more,” Hao’er handed him the water. After he had drunk some, he drank some himself, and then took out the dried meat and shared it with them.","After a rest, the three of them walked again. However, after walking for a while, Hao’er noticed that Yue’er’s walk had become a little unsteady, so he stopped and asked, ” Little sister, what’s wrong with your foot?”","Yue’er hesitated for a moment before whispering, “My feet hurt.”","“Where does it hurt? Let me take a look,” Hao’er said, taking her hand and leading her to sit down by the roadside. He helped her take off her boots and socks and looked at her feet. His face tightened.","He could see that her tender little feet had developed three or four blisters, each the size of a finger, and her toes were red. She didn’t say a word. He couldn’t help but feel distressed. He petted her head and said, “Yue’er, be a good girl. Big Brother will help you pick the blisters. A little medicine will make them stop hurting.”","Muchen, who was watching from the side, had his mouth pursed tightly, with nervousness and worry in his eyes. When he saw his Big Brother take something out to help Yue’er pop the blisters, he walked up close, took Yue’er’s little head into his arms, and said, “It doesn’t hurt. If you don’t look, it doesn’t hurt.”","Yue’er leaned into Muchen’s arms, her small hands clutching his shirt, while her feet were perched on her Big Brother’s lap. She couldn’t see, but she could feel the sharp pain as it hit, and she let out a small hiss.","“It’ll be fine in a little while,” Hao’er said, rinsing her with water and cleaning her up before applying medicine and carefully tying a small strip of cloth around it to prevent it from rubbing against the broken skin.","“It’s done,” Hao’er said, adding, “Don’t put on your boots yet. Big Brother will carry you.”","“Huh?” Yue’er blinked, her delicate little face full of dumbfoundedness, and she said blankly, “But Yue’er is heavy.”","Hao’er couldn’t help but laugh at her little appearance, saying, “It’s not heavy. Big Brother can carry you. Come.” He turned his back and squatted down, with his hands behind his back. He said to Muchen, “Brother, hold your sister’s boots, don’t lose them.”","“Okay,” Muchen replied, and after helping Yue’er climb onto his back, he walked along with the boots in his hand.","Yue’er, who was lying on his back, beamed from ear to ear, her small hands tightly wrapped around his. Her soft voice carried a happy smile, “Big Brother, Yue’er feels so comfortable like this.”"]},{"number":4409,"title":"Chapter 4409: No Problem","paragraphs":["Chapter 4409: No Problem","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The little girl smiled with twinkling eyes and obediently climbed onto his back. Along the way, she chatted away like a happy little bird, following the two of them. After walking for a long time, she asked, “Big Brother, are you tired? Yue’er can come down and walk by herself.”","“No, I’m not tired. I can still carry you,” Hao’er said, shaking his head.","“Then Yue’er can help Big Brother wipe off all the sweat~” Seeing that perspiration was dripping from his forehead, she used her sleeve to wipe it away.","Feeling the small person’s clumsy hands wiping his forehead, Hao’er’s eyes flashed with warmth as he said, “If you’re hungry or thirsty, just let Big Brother know.”","“Mmm hmm, we got it!” The two nodded in agreement.","They rested and walked along the way, stopping and starting. As it grew dark, they saw a small village.","“There’s a small village up ahead!” Yue’er excitedly pointed ahead.","Hao’er and Chen’er also smiled. They had been walking all day, following the mountain path, and it wasn’t until now that they saw any signs of human habitation.","“Let’s go and find out, and ask people what this place is,” Hao’er said, carrying Yue’er on his back and leading Chen’er around a corner and up a small mountain path towards the small village.","It was just about dusk, and in this small, remote mountain village, dozens of households were cooking dinner. Smoke rose from the chimneys, and the aroma of the food filled the air.","When they arrived in the village, the three children, who had been eating barbecued meat for a few days, couldn’t help but light up when they smelled the delicious food wafting from each household.","“It smells so good!” Yue’er sniffed with her little nose, her face full of longing as she inhaled the aroma of the food.","“Big Brother, let’s sit here for a while,” Muchen said, pointing to a nearby stone.","“Alright,” Hao’er said, setting her down. He said to the two, “Wait here for a moment, I’ll go and ask ahead.” After instructing the two not to run off, he walked towards the houses in front.","“Huh? Where did these children come from?” A woman in her thirties walked out, splashing the water she was carrying in her hands in front of the door, and saw the three children at the village entrance.","This place is remote, and usually very few people come here. The dozen or so households in the village all know each other well and live close together. At this moment, upon hearing the woman’s words, someone in the neighbouring house poked their head out to look.","“Really, there are children? Where did they come from? Why haven’t I seen any adults?” Another woman in her forties chirped in, stepping out and looking left, right, all around. Seeing that there were no adults, just the three children, she couldn’t help but feel strange too.","Hao’er had not had much contact with people before, and coupled with his cold personality, he looked indifferent for his young age. However, he was good-looking and had an outstanding air about him, so it was clear at first glance that he was no ordinary child.","Gradually, the villagers who gathered around included women, men, and the elderly. In the end, an old man with a wooden walking stick in his hand stroked his beard and looked at Hao’er, asking, “Where are you from, my boy? Where are the adults?”","Hao’er’s gaze swept over the crowd, finally landing on the old man. He bowed formally and said, “Grandfather, my Brother and sister and I got separated from our family. Can we rest here for the night?”","“Separated?”","The old man was slightly surprised. Looking at the child, who was less than ten years old, he was surprised by his good manners. Every move he made was even better than those of the Young Masters of those noble families he had seen before. At that moment, he said, ” Of course, that’s no problem.”"]},{"number":4410,"title":"Chapter 4410: Never Heard Of It","paragraphs":["Chapter 4410: Never Heard Of It","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The old man turned around and looked at a woman next to him and said, “Old woman, don’t we still have an empty room in our house? Pack it up and let the three of them rest!”","“Alright,” An old woman in her fifties or sixties smiled and answered, her face full of kindness.","“You can come to my house to rest! I’m the village chief, and my house is right back there,” the old man said, pointing to the house in the back, and laughed, “I also have two grandchildren about your age at home.”","“Thank you, Grandfather Chief,” Hao’er said, and as soon as his voice fell, two young voices came from the side.","“Thank you, Grandfather Chief.”","Muchen helped Muyue over, and his boots were on, although he still limped a bit as he walked.","“Ha ha ha, good children, good children, let’s go! Come to my house, they’re cooking dinner right now, let’s eat together!” He looked at the three children and felt pity in his heart.","These children were about the same age as his grandchildren, but it was really sad that they were living on the streets.","The people in the remote mountain village were simple and honest, and they felt pity for the three children who were wandering alone. They also felt envy when they saw how delicate the three children were and how their behaviour was different from that of ordinary children.","They really wondered what kind of people their parents were to have given birth to such well-behaved and sensible children. Looking at the three children and comparing them to their own brats, the parents could only shake their heads helplessly and smile wryly.","They already thought their own children were well-behaved, but when compared to the other children, they really couldn’t compete.","They were having dinner at the Old Village Chief’s house, and when they saw the three children each eat a big bowl of rice and a bowl of soup, the Old Village Chief and his wife glanced at each other and thought to themselves that these three children must be really hungry.","“Eat slowly, there’s more if you need it,” said the Old Village Chief, and he gave them some more vegetables and meat.","“Thank you, Grandfather Chief, Yue’er is full.” Yue’er finished eating the rice and vegetables in her bowl, touched her full stomach, and beamed.","“Heh heh heh, it’s good that you’re full. You shouldn’t eat too much at night, or it won’t digest well,” the Old Village Chief said with a smile, looking at the well-behaved little person and couldn’t help but stroke her head, saying kindly, “In a little while, you should go take a bath, then go to bed and get some rest.”","“Mm hmm~” Yue’er replied with a smile.","“Don’t take a bath right after eating. Go a little while later. The water is already being boiled, so you can take a good bath a little while later,” the old woman said, and brought them small stools to sit and rest for a while.","“Where is your home? This village is still far from the town! You will have to walk for a long time to get to the town on your own,” the Old Village Chief said, looking at the three of them.","Upon hearing this, Chen’er and Yue’er did not say anything, but looked at their Big Brother at the same time.","Hao’er thought for a moment, then said, “Grandfather Village Chief, have you heard of the Phoenix Empire?”","Upon hearing this, the Village Chief stroked his beard, frowned, and pondered: “Phoenix Empire?” He shook his head: ” I haven’t heard of it. Where is it? Is it far from our current Vault Kingdom?”","Hearing about the Vault Kingdom, which he had never heard of, Hao’er’s lowered gaze flickered slightly. After a moment of silence, he asked again, “Then, Grandfather Village Chief, have you heard of the Ghost Doctor?”","The Old Village Chief still shook his head, “I have not heard of it.” Seeing the three children’s gloomy expressions, he continued, ” However, you can go to the imperial capital in the future and ask around. That is the imperial capital of the Vault Kingdom, and there are many doctors with very powerful medical skills there.”","—"]},{"number":4411,"title":"Chapter 4411: No Immortals","paragraphs":["Chapter 4411: No Immortals","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The Old Village Chief looked at the three of them and said, “What do you want to ask all this for? If you want to find someone or somewhere, just wait until you get home and let your parents go find them.”","Hao’er’s eyes flashed as he said, ” I heard from my Mother before that there were immortals who cultivated immortality in the Phoenix Empire, and that the Ghost Doctor is a very powerful person, so I’m very curious.”","“Immortals? Hahahaha.” The old man laughed, stroked his beard and shook his head as he looked at the three of them and said, “You are just children. Where in the world are there any immortals? That’s all just legend.”","The three children were taken aback. Their hearts were pounding and they felt a little uneasy. Yue’er said, “But there really are immortals! My mother said so!” She was adamant that there were immortals, and her beautiful eyes looked at him nervously.","“Ha ha ha, then your mother must have been lying to you. Immortals? That’s a legend. I’ve lived most of my life, and I’ve been to many places when I was young, but I’ve never heard of the existence of immortals. They’re all stories, all legends, and they’re all lies.” The Old Village Chief smiled and waved his hand.","“Grandfather Chief means to say that there are no immortals in the Vault Kingdom?” Hao’er looked at him and secretly clenched his small hands.","“Ha ha ha, that’s of course. If there were immortals, there would be no birth, aging, sickness, or death.” The village chief laughed and said, “You children don’t understand. If there were immortals in the world, no one would want to die, everyone would want to become an immortal. Do you think that would be a good world?”","He stroked his beard and laughed, saying, “I’ve lived to this age, what immortals? They’ve never appeared at all. I’ve only heard those people make things up, saying that it’s some sort of legend that’s been passed down. In fact, is there really any immortals in this world? There aren’t any.”","The three children didn’t say anything, just looked at each other, feeling a little bad inside. There are no immortals in this place? Then can their Father and Mother find them? And how are they going to go back?","“Alright, alright! You guys, go take a bath and get some rest, and just stay here for a few days! In a few days, the village will transport some firewood to the town to sell, and you can go together in the donkey cart, so you won’t have to walk.” The Old Village Chief smiled and stood up. Listening to what the three children said about immortals, he just found it funny.","If there were immortals in this world, then everyone would want to become immortal. However, immortals are just legends, and no one has ever seen them...","As soon as the Old Village Chief left, two young boys aged seven or eight with tiger-like faces came up to them and looked at them curiously. “Are there really immortals? We’ve never heard Grandfather tell stories about immortals. What do they look like? Have you ever seen one?”","Hao’er and the other two looked at each other, stood up, and said, “We’re going to take a bath and go to bed.”","That night, the three children lay on a large bed. None of them could sleep, so they kept their eyes open and looked at the dark ceiling. Yue’er tossed and turned, and couldn’t help but sit up and say in a soft voice, ” Big Brother, Brother, why did Grandfather Chief say there are no immortals? Can we still go back to find Father and Mother? Can we still go home?”","Muchen also sat up and said, “There are obviously immortals, but they’ve never seen any.”","Hao’er sat up and said, ” Maybe we’ve arrived in the mortal world. There are no immortals in the mortal world, so they don’t know.”"]},{"number":4412,"title":"Chapter 4412: Not Like Us","paragraphs":["Chapter 4412: Not Like Us","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Because Yue’er’s blisters on her feet had not yet healed, the Old Village Chief had said that they would have a donkey cart to take them to the town in a few days. Hence, the three children stayed on for a few more days.","The people in the village were simple and honest, and as they saw that the three children were smart and delicate-looking, they treated them well and gave the children some of whatever food they had at home.","That day, the two grandchildren of the village chief came to Hao’er’s house with a few eggs in their hands: “Yue’er, we’ve brought you some food.”","Chen’er opened the door, his eyes falling on the eggs in their hands. Yue’er peeked around from behind him, her eyes smiling when she saw the two boys.","“Here, these are the eggs that Grandma just cooked. We brought you some.” The two children handed them the eggs in their hands and asked, “Do you want to go out and play with us?”","Muchen and Yue’er took them, said thank you, and shook their heads in unison: “No.”","Hearing this, the two children were a little surprised and said, ” You don’t go out every day, just staying in the room like this is not good. Children should go out and play more.”","“Hee hee, no, Yue’er and Brother want to study, so we’re not going to play.” The little doll smiled with twinkling eyes and said to the two, “Big Brother, Little Brother, you go play, we’re going back in.”","“Alright then!” The two children saw that they weren’t going out to play, so they didn’t say anything more, gave them the eggs and left.","Seeing them leave, Muchen and Muyue glanced at each other, then closed the door and went back to their room. After setting the eggs aside, they sat cross-legged on the bed to practice, just like their Big Brother.","Their Big Brother had said that even if there were no immortals here, they still had to practice every day to improve their strength and protect themselves.","Tomorrow, the people in the village would go to the town, and they would follow them to find their way home.","Thinking about what their Brother had told them, that if their spirit energy became stronger, they might be able to break the seal on their chests one day, they dared not slack off and obediently continued to practise.","Outside, the Old Village Chief and his wife were sitting in front of the door, picking vegetables and chatting idly.","“Old man, you see how the three children never go out of the house. What do you think they’re doing in there? They’re so young, how can they possibly stay in their room?”","The Old Village Chief took a drag on his water pipe and glanced back at the backyard. “These three children, they’re not like ordinary children. They’re so well-behaved and sensible that it makes you feel sad for them.”","“Exactly. How could three such sensible children get separated from their family? And it happened in such a remote place as ours. It just sounds so strange.”","“Ha ha ha,” the Old Village Chief chuckled, “Who knows what’s going on? But, I guess the three kids are only telling half the truth, not the whole truth. But, these days I’ve been thinking, what exactly is this Phoenix Empire? I really haven’t heard of such a place.”","“So, are you really letting the three of them go to town tomorrow? They’re so young, it’s easy for them to get into trouble out there,” the old woman was a little worried.","“We can’t keep them here forever, can we? They have to go sometime. They’re not like us.” The Old Village Chief took a drag on his waterpipe and let out a gentle puff of smoke.","—"]},{"number":4413,"title":"Chapter 4413: Bandits","paragraphs":["Chapter 4413: Bandits","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“It’s really the adults in their family who are to blame. Their children are out there alone, and they haven’t even sent anyone out to look for them? Gosh, they sure are carefree!” The old woman said, picking up the selected vegetables and saying, ” I’m going to cook. There’s soup inside, just the thing to nourish the bodies of a few children.”","The next day, before dawn, several men were busy at the village entrance, piling bundles of firewood onto a donkey cart. Hao’er and the other two were watching from nearby, and one of the men laughed and said, “Village Chief, why do you want to go to the city with us? If there’s something you want to buy, just let us know, and we can get it for you. You don’t need to go back and forth like this.”","“Alas, it’s just that my old leg problem has flared up again these past few days. I’ll go to the city and have a look, otherwise I won’t be able to sleep at night because of the aches and pains.” The old village chief said, and to the old woman beside him, “Okay, go back, go back! You’ll be back in the evening.”","“You guys be careful on the road, and come back early,” the old woman instructed, and she stuffed the ready-made cakes into Hao’er’s hands for them to eat on the road.","“Come, come, sit up there.” The man carried Yue’er onto the donkey cart. When he tried to carry Chen’er, Chen’er said, “I can get up there by myself.” With that, he climbed up on his own.","After seeing him go up, Hao’er followed suit and sat up there, while the old village chief sat in the front with the man driving the donkey cart.","“Everyone sit tight, we’re off!” The man shouted, swung the target in his hand, and drove the donkey cart along the mountain path.","After watching the donkey cart leave, the old woman returned to the house. The old man couldn’t sleep no matter how much he tried, so he went to tidy up the house where the three children had been staying for a few days. However, he didn’t expect to see a golden coin glittering on the table.","“This... this is?”","The old woman was slightly startled and picked it up to take a closer look. She couldn’t help but be slightly surprised. Why was there a gold coin? This gold coin was worth a hundred silver coins, which was a lot of money for ordinary people like them.","On the road, Hao’er, who was sitting in the back, was meditating cross-legged. The old village chief and the man sitting in front of them knew that they were sitting in the back and didn’t worry about anything else, just occasionally talking and chatting with them.","Yue’er and Muchen, who were sitting in the back, were eating biscuits when they heard voices coming from the front, speaking in a low voice.","“Village chief, I heard them say that these days the road has been a bit unsettled, and a few people passing through died some time ago.”","“Are there bandits again? Logically, our area is a poor and remote place, so there shouldn’t be any bandits.”","“I heard that they are murderers who fled here for refuge. The terrain in this area is complicated, and it is not easy for the officials to catch them. As a result, they have become a scourge to the ordinary people.”","The Brother and sister ate the biscuits while they whispered in front of them. They didn’t know how long it had been, but suddenly the donkey cart came to a sudden stop, followed by the clanging sound of swords clashing.","Looking at the dozen people who had suddenly appeared in front of them and surrounded them, the old village chief and the man turned pale and their bodies trembled a little. “Bandits!”","“Hahahaha! I was worried that no one would come to my door these few days! What are you still doing? Get off the cart! Empty out all your silver!” The man leading the group laughed loudly with his arms folded as he looked up, and told someone to go over and drag the old village chief and the man off the cart.","The curtain was lifted, and the three children sitting by the firewood in the back were watching them. In response, the bandit who lifted the curtain shouted, ” Boss, there are still three kids here!”"]},{"number":4414,"title":"Chapter 4414: Taught A Lesson","paragraphs":["Chapter 4414: Taught A Lesson","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","As soon as he heard this, the old village chief panicked and hurriedly said, “My lord, my lords, those are my three grandchildren. Please, my lords, spare them.”","“Get out of the way!” The bandit in charge kicked the old village chief to the ground with one foot and signalled, “Bring down the three brats!”","However, on the donkey cart, when the two bandits reached out their hands to pull Yue’er off the cart, Muchen, who was next to Yue’er, picked up a nearby branch and hit the reaching hands.","“Shoo!”","“Ssshh!”","The bandit yelped in pain and retracted his hand. When he saw a young kid holding a branch and whipping him, he immediately glared murderously and said, “Kid, you’re looking for death!” With his other hand, he fiercely swung his knife towards Muchen.","“Clang!”","At that moment, Hao’er stepped forward, drew the dagger on his leg and blocked the knife that was about to be swung at his Brother. A surge of dark energy in his hand sent the opponent’s knife flying away, while the dagger in his hand slashed towards his neck.","“Whoosh!”","“Sss!”","The speed was so fast that the bandit didn’t even have time to react, and he just gasped in shock. His whole body went limp, and he stared with wide eyes as he fell backwards in horror.","“Bang!”","His body fell to the ground, and the blood from his neck seeped out and stained the ground. The crowd outside was stunned.","However, Hao’er clutched the dagger tightly, his hands trembling slightly. His small face was covered in a cold expression, and his eyes stared at the dead mountain bandit on the ground with determination and coldness. He spoke clearly, word by word, to his younger siblings, who were wide-eyed and dumbfounded beside him.","“Mother said that for people who want to kill you, you should never show mercy. You have to kill them before they can kill you!” He took a deep breath, looked at Muchen and Muyue, and asked, “Do you remember?”","“Yes,” the two little ones said, slowly coming to their senses. There was a hint of fear in their eyes, but more so was their determination.","The old village chief and the man looked in shock at the bandit on the ground, watching him convulse until he stopped breathing. It was only a matter of moments, and they couldn’t help but hold their breath as they looked at the three children who had walked out from behind the curtain.","The bandit leader, seeing his subordinate killed, thought that there must be some powerful person hiding behind the curtain of the donkey cart. However, there were only three children coming out from behind the curtain.","The three children, dressed in fine clothes, were no more than eight or nine years old, the youngest looked no more than three years old, but they were very delicate and outstanding. One could tell at a glance that they were not the old man’s grandchildren.","However, at this moment, the older child was holding a dagger in his hand, and he was looking at him with a stern little face. The look in his eyes made him inexplicably feel a little chill in his heart, but after it subsided, he felt a little ashamed and annoyed.","He actually let a child of eight or nine years old shock him? Damn it!","“What are you still doing? Arrest them!” The man in charge shouted, waving his knife and telling the men under him to come forward.","“Take care of yourselves,” Hao’er said, gripping the dagger in his hand. The next moment, Shadow One swept forward.","Even though his cultivation had not yet recovered, with his body techniques and training, his instinctive attack was enough to stop those low-level bandits.","Hao’er did not spare any of them, killing all the dozen bandits with one strike. The bandit in charge, seeing the dead bodies all over the ground, turned pale with fear and tried to run.","However, the next moment, all the old village chief and the man saw was Hao’er’s toes point, and just like that, he...flew!"]},{"number":4415,"title":"Chapter 4415 Afraid","paragraphs":["Chapter 4415 Afraid","“Flying, flying?” The old village chief and the man were suddenly dumbfounded. All they could see was that there seemed to be a visible air current condensing at his feet. Then, with a nudge of his toes, he soared more than ten metres into the air. Just as he was about to act, holding the dagger in his hand, the bandit suddenly turned around, raised his hand, and a sleeve arrow swooshed out.","“Swoosh!” Hao’er quickly avoided it. His body’s instinctive reaction had already averted the danger when it was detected. At the same time, his hand attacked and struck forward, slapping out a palm strike. The eight or nine year old child knocked the mountain bandit several metres away.","“Puff!” The mountain bandit spat out a mouthful of blood and fell to the ground, looking at the child who was walking step by step in horror: “Who, who the hell are you!” Hao’er didn’t say a word, but took a step, leaned forward, and slashed his throat!","The old village chief and the man watched this scene, their legs weak, and they sat down directly, their bodies trembling. They didn’t know if they were scared by the sight of a dozen dead bandits, or by Hao’er’s ruthlessness, or if they were scared to death by seeing something they weren’t supposed to see, and their legs were weak.","No one knew that Hao’er’s hands were shaking, and after he killed the last bandit, he didn’t get up for a long time. Until, the two little guys trotted over to his side.","“Big Brother, are you okay?” The soft, plummy voice carried an unmistakable concern, and the two identical little faces looked at him with worry.","Hearing their voices, Hao’er took a deep breath, turned around, and said, ” I’m fine.” “Grandfather Chief and the others seem to be scared,” Yue’er, looking all cute, tugged on Hao’er’s corner of his shirt, indicating for him to look at the two men slumped on the ground.","“Grandfather Chief, Uncle,” Hao’er walked over and looked at them.","The two men looked at him with complex expressions on their faces: “Hao’er, Hao’er, you...” “Grandfather Chief, if I don’t kill them, they will kill us,” Hao’er’s small face was tense and cold as he said, “My younger siblings are still young and cannot protect themselves, so I have to protect them. Besides, my Mother said that we should never show mercy to those who want to kill us, so they all have to die.” The village chief and the big man also knew that those mountain bandits were ruthless killers, but when they saw those ruthless killers being killed by the child in front of them, who was less than ten years old, they still found it a bit unbelievable.","Are the children of the powerful families out there really that formidable now? And also, it seemed that they had clearly seen him fly earlier...","“Grandfather Village Chief, Uncle, my Big Brother is a good person, they are the bad guys,” Yue’er walked up and said to the two men, who were sitting on the ground, with her hands around one of Hao’er’s hands. ” My Big Brother is really a good person, don’t be afraid of him,” The young voice, soft and mellow, entered their ears, which made the old village chief and the big man feel guilty. At that moment, the old village chief hurriedly said, “We are not afraid of him, it’s just that we have never seen so many people die, we can’t recover from it all at once.” Saying this, the old village chief stood up with the help of his walking stick and said, “We need to get rid of all these bodies.” So, he told the man next to him to get up and help.","The man collected all the valuables from the bandits and pushed them all down the mountain. Then he handed all the valuables he had collected to Hao’er, saying, “These, these are the money and treasures we found on those bandits.”"]},{"number":4416,"title":"Chapter 4416 Arriving in the city","paragraphs":["Chapter 4416 Arriving in the city","Hao’er thought for a moment, then took the money and possessions wrapped in the small bundle and handed them out to the others: “Grandfather village chief, uncle, this is for you.” “This, this is not alright, no.” They hurriedly waved their hands: “We haven’t done anything, how can we take these things, no, no, you keep them!” “Take it!” Hao’er slipped it into their hands and said, “Let’s go!” Seeing this, the big man looked at the village chief and then at the money in his hands, and he was a bit embarrassed.","“Just take it!” The old village chief thought about it for a while, and then told him to keep it, adding, “You are young, so remember that you should never show off your wealth, so that no one will target you in the future.” “Yes, we know,” Hao’er nodded in response.","They got into the donkey cart and continued towards the town. Along the way, the old village chief and the big man had things they wanted to ask, but every time the words came to their lips, they held back.","There were things they shouldn’t know, and it was better if they didn’t ask. Knowing too much was not a good thing.","The donkey cart moved slowly, not fast, but as time passed little by little, and as it neared noon, they arrived in the town.","“Look, this is the town. It’s a big town, and many nearby villages come here for the market.” The old village chief looked back at the three of them and asked, “What are your plans once you get to the town?” The two younger children naturally looked at Hao’er. They were still young, couldn’t make up their minds, and naturally wouldn’t make any decisions. They just looked at their older Brother to see what he decided.","“We’ll see when the time comes!” Hao’er said. In fact, he hadn’t made any plans yet, and would have to wait and see what happened.","Once they entered the city and came to a corner inside, the old village chief asked, “Is this a good place to get off?” “Yes, let’s get off here!” Hao’er said, getting off the donkey cart and carrying his younger siblings down. Then he respectfully bowed to the two men, “Thank you, Grandfather Village Chief and Uncle.” The two men hurriedly sidled away: “I dare not.” Although they knew their identities well and that they were just a few children, they still felt their hearts skip a beat when they thought about the scene on the road, and they did not dare to accept their courtesy.","“Grandfather Village Chief, Uncle, we’ll be going then,” Yue’er’s soft voice carried a hint of a smile, and her delicate and cute little face overflowed with a pleasing smile, which was really cute.","“Okay, okay, you must be careful, take care of yourselves.” The old village chief could only give them this advice, because even if they wanted to help them, there was nothing they could do.","So Hao’er led Muchen and Muyue away, watching them as they walked down the street, looking left and right in curiosity. If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they would never have believed that such young children could have killed those dozen bandits.","“Village Chief, who were they really?” the big man couldn’t help but ask.","“No matter who they were, they were definitely no ordinary people,” the old village chief sighed.","On the street, Yue’er looked happily at the things on the stalls. When she saw some of the knick-knacks in particular, she couldn’t bring herself to move and stood on tiptoe to look at them.","“Brother, Brother, look at these little people, they’re so cute!” Her soft voice was full of wonder and excitement as she looked at the little clay figurines on display.","“Haha, these are clay figurines, and these are painted clay figurines. They can be moulded into your likeness. Little girl, would you like to buy one?” The vendor asked with a smile."]},{"number":4417,"title":"Chapter 4417: Sights Set On","paragraphs":["Chapter 4417: Sights Set On","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The little person’s eyes brightened slightly upon hearing this, and she couldn’t help but look up at her two Brothers.","Seeing this, Hao’er revealed a smile of affectionate endearment, reached out and touched her little head, and said, “If Yue’er wants it, then let’s buy it!” As he spoke, he saw Chen’er next to him also staring at the clay figurines, so he said to the peddler, “Make them look like them, and give them each one.”","“Okay, just a moment,” the peddler said with delight, and immediately started to mould the clay figurines after their appearances using various coloured clay.","Before long, a little clay figurine wearing a pink dress with two small buns on top of its head was ready. The peddler handed it over with a smile, saying, ” Here, little girl, this is yours.”","Looking at the lifelike little clay figure, Yue’er smiled happily, “It really looks like me! It’s a little me!” She looked up at Hao’er and asked, “Big Brother, don’t you want it?”","Hao’er shook his head, “Big Brother doesn’t want it.”","After a while, the peddler handed the other clay figure to Chen’er and said, “Here, this one is yours.”","Chen’er took it. Although his little face looked like that of a young adult, it was hard to hide his joy. He held it carefully and looked at it closely, and found that it really looked like him.","Hao’er paid the money and then took them away, saying, “Big Brother will take you to eat something! After you eat, if you want to go for a walk, Big Brother will accompany you again.”","“Yue’er wants a chicken leg,” Yue’er said happily, holding Hao’er’s hand.","“Okay,” Hao’er said, looking at Muchen next to them and asking, “Where’s Chen’er?”","“I’m fine with anything,” the little one said, showing that he wasn’t picky eaters.","The three children, dressed in extraordinary and exquisite clothes, were very eye-catching as they walked down the street, but they themselves didn’t know it. They walked and wandered until they arrived at an upscale restaurant.","At the corner of the street, a few people leaning against the wall and eating melon seeds glanced at each other, revealed an evil smile, and then continued to stare outside the restaurant.","“Those three children really are exceptionally good-looking, and I saw that they weren’t followed by any adults or escorts,” one of them said.","“These three kids don’t look like they’re from ordinary families. Judging from the quality of their clothes, I’d say they’re probably from wealthy families. Do we really want to pick these people? Besides, the oldest one looks almost ten years old! He’s too old to be kidnapped.” The other man hesitated.","“Hey, these three kids are obviously from elsewhere. There are no adults around, and they look so delicate and pretty. If we abduct them, we can definitely sell them for a good price,” said the man in charge, his eyes flickering as he made his calculations: ” Forget the eldest one, she’s too old and sensible to be resold. But the two younger ones, with their delicate looks, will definitely be snapped up.”","“But if they really are the children of some wealthy family, wouldn’t it be difficult to trace them...” The other man was still a bit worried.","“Hmph!”","The man glanced at him and said, “In our line of work, who cares about being traced? You have to take risks to earn this kind of money. What can you accomplish by being timid?”","After being lectured, the man couldn’t help but lower his head and asked in a low voice, “So how are we going to do it?”","“I’ll figure it out.” The man in charge grinned, his small eyes darting about."]},{"number":4418,"title":"Chapter 4418: Pay Attention","paragraphs":["Chapter 4418: Pay Attention","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Meanwhile, the three children in the restaurant had no idea that they had already been targeted. At this time, the three of them were sitting in the restaurant. The waiter looked at them and then asked with a smile, “May I ask what you would like to eat, young masters and young ladies?”","Hao’er thought for a moment and then said, “Bring us a few of your more delicious dishes, and then a stewed chicken soup, and three bowls of rice.” He then asked, ” Do you have any pastries?”","Hearing this, the waiter was slightly surprised. Hearing that they wanted three bowls of rice, and seeing that there were only three of them and no adults, he suppressed his surprise and quickly said, “Yes, yes, yes. Our shop’s osmanthus cake and lotus seed cake are the most delicious. Why don’t you have one of each?”","“Okay, that’s it!” Hao’er said.","“Okay, please wait a moment.” The waiter was about to turn and leave, but then stopped and asked, “I wonder if you have any adults with you?”","“What’s wrong?” Hao’er’s face turned cold, and his eyes showed some displeasure.","The waiter was a runner, so he was good at reading people’s expressions. Seeing that his face had turned cold, he quickly laughed and said, ” Young Master, don’t be mistaken, it’s just that you don’t have any adults with you, and you’ve ordered all these dishes, so I was wondering if you have any money to pay the bill?”","Upon hearing this, Hao’er gave him a look and took a money bag from his clothing and placed it on the table: “You think I don’t have the money to pay the bill?”","Seeing the heavy money bag, the waiter immediately smiled and said, “Please wait a moment, the food will be here soon.” It wasn’t that he had to ask this question, but it was the rule of the restaurant, after all, they were afraid of people eating without paying as well.","Before long, the food arrived one after the other. Smelling the delicious food, the three children’s appetites were whetted. The two younger ones were relatively short, and they could hardly reach the food on the table even when sitting in their chairs. So Hao’er asked the waiter to bring two small stools so that they could sit on top of the chairs.","“Here, have some more,” Hao’er helped them to ladle up the food, saying, “Eat slowly, don’t eat too fast.” She then helped them to ladle up the soup before eating slowly herself.","“Big Brother, the food here is delicious,” Yue’er beamed, pointing to a dish of ribs in the middle and saying, “I want to eat that.”","“Okay, Big Brother will help you pick it up. If it’s delicious, have some more,” Hao’er couldn’t help but smile adoringly as he watched her cheeks puff up like a little squirrel as she ate.","“Chen’er, what do you want to eat? Big Brother will help you pick it up,” he asked, looking at Muchen.","“No need, I can do it myself,” Muchen said, picking up his own food and eating.","The three children were dining on the second floor of this high-end restaurant without any adults accompanying them, naturally attracting the attention and curiosity of many people, especially after seeing the outstanding looks of the three children, they were even more surprised.","Such peerless looks are not possessed by ordinary people, and the clothes the three were wearing were also made from rare and high-quality materials. However, the three looked very unfamiliar, so they should not be local.","The elegant man across the table was drinking and chatting with a few friends. When he saw the three children, he also took a closer look, his eyes full of undisguised admiration and curiosity.","His friends at the table saw him playing with his wine glass, occasionally listening to the three children behind him and glancing at them from time to time, smiling on his face as he took a closer look. They couldn’t help but tease, “Brother Pan, did you think of your children when you saw those three children?”"]},{"number":4419,"title":"Chapter 4419: Pan Ning","paragraphs":["Chapter 4419: Pan Ning","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“It’s just that it’s rare to see such an understanding child, so I can’t help but look at him a few times.” The elegant man said with a smile, and added, “All in all, it’s been a while since I came out, and it’s about time to go back.” As he spoke, he smiled, averted his gaze, and took a sip of wine.","“Pan, you came to Yicheng with difficulty, and you’ve only been here for two days. It’s not too late to stay a few more days before you leave. After all, if you leave this time, I don’t know when you’ll come again.” His friend at the table said, while pouring him a drink.","Over here, the few people at the table were chatting while drinking. The man surnamed Pan accompanied them in their idle chat, occasionally focusing his attention on the three children over there.","The reason was simply that the three children had outstanding temperament, exquisite and outstanding appearances, and an air of nobility that could not be ignored. He really couldn’t figure out how such children could come from such a small place.","No, not to mention that there are few such children in the city, even the aristocratic children of those great families and nobles in the imperial capital do not have the same bearing as them. In fact, to be disrespectful, even the princes in the palace are probably not as good as these three.","It is precisely for this reason that he has rarely paid more attention to the three of them. However, this attention has turned into curiosity.","These three children are not accompanied by any adults, and there are obviously no escorts or secret guards protecting them. This is strange.","What kind of family would let three such delicate and outstanding children out without protection? After all, the world is still not very peaceful. Children like them, who have no self-protection skills and who are also so eye-catching, are really not safe alone.","“You guys drink, I’ll be right back,” he said with a smile to his friends, and then, holding a wine pot in one hand and a wine glass in the other, he went to the table where the three children were.","At this time, the three children had already finished eating and were sitting down to rest, when they saw an elegant man in a white robe walk over and sit down at their table.","The three children looked at him with six pairs of eyes, wondering what this man was doing suddenly sitting down.","After sitting down, Pan Ning looked at the three children and saw that they were all staring at him. He couldn’t help but smile, took a sip of wine, and asked, “You three ran away from home by yourselves to play?”","Hao’er pursed her lips, looked at him, and said coldly, “What’s it to you?”","Upon hearing this, Pan Ning raised an eyebrow and couldn’t help but smile, ” You have a lot of spirit for such a young age. I can see that you come from a distinguished background.”","Hearing this, Yue’er blinked at him, her soft voice full of curiosity and surprise. “Uncle, you’re amazing, you can tell we come from a good family.” Once her soft voice had finished, her beautiful eyes twinkled slyly as she asked with a smile, “But do you know where we’re from?”","Hearing the soft words of the little person, Pan Ning froze for a moment, and then smiled happily, “The little girl is really interesting.” He held out his hand and tried to lightly tap the little person’s nose, but was blocked by the little boy next to him, who looked exactly the same.","“Don’t touch my sister!” Chen’er pinched his small face and said coldly, while slapping away the hand he had extended.","Pan Ning was stunned, and a smile appeared in his eyes and mouth. It seemed that he was very happy teasing the child. He smiled at the little guy with a cold expression on his face and teased him, saying, “Then you’d better watch out, or I’ll secretly take your sister away.”"]},{"number":4420,"title":"Chapter 4420: Captured","paragraphs":["Chapter 4420: Captured","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Upon hearing this, Muchen didn’t know if he was joking, so he immediately stared at him coldly and defensively.","Hao’er also stared coldly at the man, and in a childish voice, despite the coldness, asked, “Who are you? What are you doing here?”","Pan Ning smiled, and instead of teasing them any more, poured himself a glass of wine and took a sip before saying, “Don’t worry, I’m not a bad person. I was just curious to see you three kids without any adults around, so I came over to take a look.”","He looked at Hao’er and said, ” You snuck away, didn’t you? Don’t you know that’s very dangerous? Where are your parents? Or where do you live? I can have someone send a message for you and have them come get you back.”","His children are four or five years old. If he saw his own child sneak out on their own, he would probably be frantic with worry. The parents of these children are also very careless.","“I’m in the Phoenix Empire. Can you help us deliver a letter?” Yue’er’s eyes lit up as she asked with a smile.","“Phoenix Empire?” Pan Ning was slightly surprised and couldn’t help but glance at the three of them: “As far as I know, there is no such thing as the Phoenix Empire on this continent. You’re not mistaken, are you?”","Hao’er already knew that they were probably not from the same continent as their parents. After all, there were no immortals on this continent, just mortals, so naturally they wouldn’t know where the Phoenix Empire was.","“Waiter, the bill!” Hao’er shouted, and after the waiter had taken care of the bill, he picked up his younger Brother and sister from their chairs and led them downstairs, one in each hand.","“Goodbye, uncle,” Yue’er said with a smile, waving back at him.","Seeing the little girl’s cute little appearance, Pan Ning smiled and waved his hand back. After watching them leave, he continued back to the table to drink with a few friends.","Hao’er accompanied Muchen and Muyue as they shopped around the city, buying a lot of things. While walking and stopping, Hao’er couldn’t help but look behind him, always feeling like someone was following them.","“Big Brother, what’s wrong?” Muchen asked, not understanding. He had seen him turn around several times along the way.","“It seems like someone is following us,” Hao’er said, his stern little face tensing.","Hearing this, Yue’er couldn’t help but look behind them as well, but apart from the people on the street, she didn’t see anything strange or suspicious either.","“It’s getting late, let’s go back to the inn and rest,” Hao’er said, and because he was worried about safety, he didn’t dare let them linger outside for too long, so he immediately led them back to the inn.","After they had left, the few men who had followed them all the way spat on the ground and cursed, “That little brat is smart!” They had tried many times to make their move but never got the chance, as if they knew they were being watched in the dark.","“Big Brother, it looks like they’re heading for the inn. What do we do?” another man asked. They didn’t expect just three children, but their vigilance was that strong.","“Come here, I’ll tell you what we’ll do...” The man in charge spoke in a low voice. After he finished speaking, he led the others away in two groups.","Hao’er took the two younger children by the hand and walked all the way to the inn. However, suddenly a group of beggars came from nowhere and started pushing their way towards them, scattering the three of them in no time.","“Yue’er! Chen’er!”","“Big Brother! Big Brother! Get away, don’t push me!”","“Yue’er!” Hao’er’s eyes reddened with anger. He was pushed away by a group of beggars, but saw two people take advantage of the chaos to pick up his sister and run down an alley."]},{"number":4421,"title":"Chapter 4421: Missing","paragraphs":["Chapter 4421: Missing","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Big Brother! Big Brother! Big Brother!”","Yue’er was picked up from behind, and one hand was held over her mouth. She was held and ran into an alley. She struggled hard, but she couldn’t get away. Until, she smelled a strange smell, and then, a sack was put over her and tied her up.","The strange smell made her somehow know what it was, the medicine smell. She heard the people outside say something about using sleeping pills, so she didn’t dare to speak, just covering her mouth, her eyes red, wanting to cry but not daring to.","She didn’t know why she hadn’t fainted after being drugged, as the people who had captured her had said. But she knew that if they knew she hadn’t fainted, they would definitely know what to do to her.","She was scared, but then she thought of what her Big Brother had said: she mustn’t be scared, and she must find a way to save herself if she’s in danger. So she closed her eyes and tried to remember what her Big Brother had told them.","The man who had captured Yue’er ran into a courtyard, then put her on the ground and laughed, “Well? Big Brother, wasn’t my plan a good one? Look, I’ve got the little brat!”","“Big Brother, I’ll contact someone right away and sell the person to someone else tonight!” The other man said, grinning from ear to ear. He was thinking about the shiny silver coins and his steps suddenly became lighter.","On the other side, Hao’er watched the beggars crowding over, his little face frosty with anger. Watching his sister being taken away, his eyes turned bloodshot, and he yelled angrily, ” Get out of the way!”","The sound contained an aura of spirit energy. At that shout, the beggars let out a scream and crouched down, hugging their heads. Another man, who had used a sack to wrap Muchen up and run away, felt pain in all seven of his orifices at the shout. It felt as if blood was oozing from his body. He reached up to feel, and sure enough, his nose and ears were bleeding.","He looked back in horror and saw the bloodshot rage in the eyes of the young boy of less than ten years old. The murderous intent surging in his eyes scared him so much that he shuddered. He immediately dared not stay for long and quickly ran into the alley on the other side carrying the struggling little man in the sack.","“Give me back my Brother!”","Hao’er shouted angrily, pointed his toes and quickly chased after the beggar who was crouching with his head in his hands.","When the people on the street saw this scene, they were also stunned for a moment, and some couldn’t believe it and gasped in disbelief: “What, is that snatching a child in the street?”","“Hurry! Report to the authorities quickly! This is outrageous!” A woman angrily pushed the man next to her and told him to quickly report to the authorities.","Some other people frowned and didn’t want to meddle in other people’s business. After all, who knew if there was someone behind it? What if there was retaliation?","Some even looked at the beggars crouching on the ground with their heads in their hands. They saw that they kept raising their heads one after the other, but each one had bloody eyes and noses, which was very terrifying.","The commotion here quickly attracted the attention of the officers and soldiers, who, after questioning the people around them, quickly joined in the pursuit.","On the other side, Hao’er watched as the two separated alleyways, his little fists clenching tightly. He chased after them all the way, but he was no match for the other person’s familiarity with the alleys in the area. As he chased after them, the person carrying his younger Brother ran off to who knows where.","“Chen’er, Yue’er, where are you?” Unable to see the figures of his younger Brother and sister, he couldn’t hold back the tears that had been building up in his eyes for a long time.","He wanted to tell his Father and Mother that his younger siblings were missing, but there was no one else around to help him."]},{"number":4422,"title":"Chapter 4422: Meeting Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 4422: Meeting Again","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","It gradually got dark. Hao’er was still looking for her parents, while the soldiers, for some reason, retreated after searching for a while.","In a remote courtyard, Muchen’s hands and feet were tied up, a cloth stuffed in his mouth so that he couldn’t speak. In the open sack next to him, Yue’er lay quietly, afraid to move a muscle.","She knew that her Brother had also been captured and that these bad guys wanted to sell them.","“Big Brother, the two kids have been captured, and the soldiers searching outside have also withdrawn. Should we send them out of the city now?” A man asked, looking at their big Brother.","“Have the people over there made contact?” The man asked, looking at them.","“Yes, they’re waiting in the usual place. I’m not sure if we should send the kids in the cellar with them this time, or wait a few days before sending the others away.”","“Send the two kids away first. Their small hands and faces are too conspicuous. If we wait too long, we’ll only be inviting trouble. Get ready right away, and send them away now.”","“Good!” At that moment, they quickly made arrangements and took advantage of the night to secretly send them out of the city...","On the other side, Penning, who had been drinking with a few friends and was slightly drunk, was waving goodbye to a few friends when a low-key but luxurious carriage slowly pulled up and stopped in front of him.","Just as he was about to get into the carriage, he caught a glimpse of a small figure walking in the night. Upon raising an eyebrow, he saw that it was none other than one of the three children he had dined with at the restaurant earlier that day.","“Huh?”","he suddenly said, his brows furrowing slightly as he gathered the smile from his face and looked at the child. The two little ones he had been protecting were gone, and he would not let them out of his sight to the extent that he cherished them.","“Go bring him over,” he said as he sat in the carriage, not entering the carriage, but leaning against the outside.","“Yes.” In the shadows, an assassin quickly stepped forward and came to Hao’er’s side. Before he could say anything, the child, who had been bowing his head, suddenly raised his head, his eyes full of ferocity, which startled the assassin.","“My Patriarch asks you to come over,” the assassin said, and then, seeing the child’s guarded expression, he added, “He’s over there. You met him at noon.”","Hao’er followed his hand and saw the elegant man leaning against the carriage, waving at him.","After hesitating for a moment, Hao’er walked over.","“Did something happen? Where are your younger siblings?” Pan Ning asked directly.","Upon hearing this, Hao’er gritted his teeth and said, “They’re gone.”","Upon hearing this, Pan Ning frowned and said to the dark guard, “Go check the whereabouts of those two children.”","“Yes.” Once the voice had faded, he disappeared.","Seeing this, Hao’er looked at him and asked, “Who are you? Can you help me find them?”","Pan Ning smiled indifferently and said, “My name is Pan Ning, a native of the imperial capital and the eldest son of the Pan family, but you wouldn’t know that if I told you.” He waved his hand and patted the seat next to him, saying, “Come up and sit for a while! Tell me, how did you manage to make them disappear?”","Hao’er paused for a moment, walked up to him, and asked again, “Can you find them?”","Pan Ning smiled and said, ” With my connections, naturally there is no problem, as long as they are still in this city, of course.”","Hearing this, Hao’er walked up to him, sat down next to him, and told him what had happened in the evening."]},{"number":4423,"title":"Chapter 4423: Coldness","paragraphs":["Chapter 4423: Coldness","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Listening to him finish what happened, Pan Ning shook his head and sighed softly, “I’ve reminded you guys a long time ago, you three kids are too eye-catching out there, you’ll easily be targeted.”","Saying this, he looked at the cold face of the child beside him and said, “With your faces, not to mention that human traffickers will stare at you, even some people with dirty hearts will stare at you. So just for the three of you being outside, how much danger is there?”","Hao’er pursed his lips and did not speak. He only wanted to know where his siblings were now.","Seeing him sitting there with a self-condemning face and lowered head and pursed lips, Pan Ning smiled, “Don’t worry, if they went missing in the evening, you will definitely be able to get them back.”","The people under him were efficient and in less than half an hour, the dark guards had found out who had been caught. He put his hands next to Pan Ning’s ear and informed him of the people behind the scenes. After hearing his words, Pan Ning’s face turned extremely cold..","However, before he opened his mouth to speak, he saw the child sitting next to him suddenly leapt and headed out into the night. When he saw that stance, he could not help but be shocked.","“This child actually knows this stance?’ He muttered, and when he slowed down, he saw that Hao’er had already entered the alley, and at that moment, his face changed and he said, “Quickly follow him! This kid probably heard what you just said!”","He also quickly got off the carriage and swept off into the night with the dark guards.","He was right, Hao’er had heard what the dark guard had said to Pan Ning, he was an Immortal cultivator, and he was sitting next to Pan Ning, even if the dark guard’s voice was lowered, he could still hear it.","He knew the place from the secret guard, so he quickly went to the alley.","That secret guard said the alley courtyard, today he had passed by there several times, but did not know that his younger brother and sister were locked inside. The moment he thought of this, a glint of ruthlessness flashed by his eyes. Hmph! They actually had the audacity to catch his younger brother and sister, he will not let go of those people!","He found that courtyard, he vaguely heard the sound of drinking inside, he directly lifted his foot and kicked open the courtyard door and stepped in.","“What kind of person dares to come here to create a ruckus!” The moment the people heard the commotion and came out to take a look, saw that it was the boy in the day and snorted: “Yo! This kid is so capable! He actually managed to find his way here!”","“Where are my younger siblings?’ Hao’er asked with a cold face, looking at those people, the very ones who had captured Muchen and Muyue today, he couldn’t help but feel hatred rushing into his heart, his fists clenched tightly.","Seeing that he was the only one, they didn’t hide it, and laughed loudly, “Those two little dolls? Oh, of course they’ve been sold by us! Look, the silver is in our hands.” Between words, they also patted the money bag on their waist.","Hearing this, Hao’er’s eyes reddened: “Sold? You guys actually dared to sell my siblings! Where did you sell them?”","“Hahahahahaha, what can you do to us if we don’t tell you? Little kid, hurry up and get lost! Otherwise, hmph!” The person in charge snorted coldly, if it wasn’t for the fact that this little brat was a bit too old, this wouldn’t have kept him here.","“Damn it! You all deserve to die!”","Hao’er’s voice became icy cold, his clenched fists loosened, his hand moved, the dagger tied to his leg was in his hand, and in the next moment, he leaned forward and attacked towards the man in charge.","A few men who did not see how he struck, when they slowed down, they saw that the person in charge was already kneeling on the ground and leaning back, and a sharp dagger was also less than an inch away from his neck.","“Speak! Where did you sell them!”"]},{"number":4424,"title":"Chapter 4424: Must Not Be Spread","paragraphs":["Chapter 4424: Must Not Be Spread","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Ah! Don’t, don’t kill me ...!”","His neck was pressed against the sharp blade, only to feel the skin cut and ooze out blood, the pain caused him to cry out in shock, his body stiffened and did not dare to move around a bit, lest the sharp one that was pressed against his neck would slit his throat.","“Speak! Where did you sell them to!” Hao’er roared once more, as the murderous intent in his eyes grew heavier.","“I, I, I resold them, have, have transported them overnight to the imperial capital ... arghhhh!” Just as his voice fell, the dagger in Hao’er’s hand slashed, blood splattered out at the same time, and the man fell down with a miserable scream.","“Arghhhhh!”","Seeing this scene, the other people were so shocked that their eyes widened and they scattered into several directions to escape, but how could Hao’er, who had been aroused by the killing intent in his heart, allow them to escape?","Looking at the scattered fleeing people, with a cold face, he inserted his dagger into the ground, and the next moment, his hand moved, a long sword glowing with light appeared in front of him, and as his hands coalesced, one split into two, and two split into four, and attacked in the four directions respectively.","“All of you deserve to die!”","The cold voice carried an appalling killing intent, only to see, the flying sword flew out with a swoosh, attacking towards those four people at a speed that couldn’t cover their ears.","“Swoosh!”","“Ah!”","The longsword’s harsh sound cut through midair, swooshing out from behind and attacking where those people’s hearts were, sharp and mournful screams emanating from their mouths, ringing out in the night and spreading ...","When Pan Ning and the dark guards arrived at this courtyard, they were immediately stunned by the scene in the courtyard. That courtyard had been washed in blood, there were corpses sprawled around, and there were a few people who were desperately trying to flee. However, a flying sword soon flew through them as it pierced their hearts and they died with their eyes wide open. What was even more shocking was that those flying swords that killed those people, one by one, disappeared, only one remained.","And this last sword was the one that killed the man who ran towards them in this direction, the original sword. After passing through the man’s body, the blade of the sword which was imbued with a powerful aura was so intense that they could not move a single inch. With such dense murderous intent pressing down upon them, they could only stare wide-eyed at the sword that felt as if it had just stopped inches away from their forehead.","At this moment, Pan Ning who had never been in such an embarrassed situation before, who was facing a sword which seemed like it had a life of it’s own, clearly felt a horrifying pressure. This aura was so oppressive that cold sweat started trickling down his temples but his body could not move.","Immortal!","In his mind, inexplicably surfaced these two words, only the legendary immortal, who wields a heaven defying sword, only the legendary immortal, have this kind of ability ...","Only, what he could not expect was that this immortal, was actually a child less than ten years old!","Hao’er, who had killed his eyes because he heard that his siblings had been sold, pursed his lips when he saw that the two of them were shaken there by his pressure, turned his hand around, and shouted, “Come back!” The longsword returned to his side with a swoosh, and was then put into space by him.","Watching the longsword disappear into thin air, Pan Ning’s heart pounded as he suppressed the shock in his heart and hurriedly asked, “That, have you, have you found the whereabouts of your younger siblings? Are they here?”","Hao’er looked at him, a cold look on his small face, “What you have just seen, it is best not to spread it.”","“No, don’t worry, I’m not a talkative person.” Pan Ning hurriedly said, and quickly instructed the secret guard next to him."]},{"number":4425,"title":"Chapter 4425: How To Escape","paragraphs":["Chapter 4425: How To Escape","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Even the strictly trained secret guard, at this time has been stunned, when he heard the words of the Master, and saw the cold gaze of that child sweep over, his heart was jumping wildly, and immediately stood up straight: “Young Master don’t worry, this subordinate will keep the secret to the death!”","After seeing this child kill those people, as well as the magical longsword, he no longer dared to treat him like an ordinary child, even if he was stupid, he knew that this child was definitely not an ordinary person!","Hao’er retracted his gaze and looked at Pan Ning, saying, “My brother and sister were resold by them and are being sent to the Imperial Capital.”","Hearing this, Pan Ning knew what he meant, and immediately said, “If they are heading to the Imperial Capital, I know which road they will take, let’s go after them now!”","Hao’er nodded his head a little, and when he turned around, his footsteps lurched and he looked towards that courtyard, saying, “There are still children inside.”","“You stay, save those children and settle them down, and, here, deal with it cleanly.” Pan Ning looked towards the dark guard and handed it over.","“Yes.” The dark guards responded, and watched them leave before they quickly went inside to look and rescue the children who were locked in the cellar.","The night was deep, at the same time, on the mountain road out of the city, a carriage was running, the driver was a man as well as a slightly fat middle-aged man, while inside the carriage, tied up were the two Muchen and Muyue.","Perhaps thinking that it was just two children, they didn’t take much precautions, after all, those two children looked less than three years old, so what could they do at such a young age?","At this moment, inside the carriage, the two children who originally had their eyes closed, quietly opened their eyes. Those people had used drugs on them, only, those drugs didn’t seem to have much effect on their bodies, but they also pretended to sleep through it, until now.","“Brother, let’s quietly escape!” Yue’er whispered in his ear.","Muchen nodded, and the two of them rolled their eyes, thinking of ideas. Half a minute later, Muchen came to her ear and whispered, Muyue listened carefully while nodding her head.","“Whimper, Mother, Mother.” Muyue suddenly whimpered and cried, and at this time, Muchen anxiously shouted, “Sister, Sister what’s wrong with you?”","The slightly chubby middle-aged man driving the carriage outside heard the commotion behind him and frowned, lifting the curtained carriage and asking, “What’s going on with you two?” In his heart, he wondered how he woke up so quickly after he was clearly drugged.","“My stomach hurts.” Yue’er pursed her little mouth and said with a crying voice.","“You guys are the only ones with a lot of trouble!” The slightly fat middle-aged man glared at them unhappily before shouting, “Pull over for a moment and let the two brats go down to relieve themselves.”","“Come here, I’ll help you untie the rope.” The middle-aged man droned under his breath.","Yue’er obediently went over, looking at the untied rope, she pursed her little mouth again and said with tears, “It’s too dark outside, I don’t dare to go by myself, brother accompany me.”","“Go go go, this settles the both of you at the same time so we will not stop again later.” In the middle of the night, the middle-aged man felt that this child was so small, and didn’t dare to escape, what’s more, they were watching them! So, he also untied the rope for the little boy.","Muchen and Muyue got off the carriage, walked to the side and squatted by the grass, seeing that those two were staring just a few metres away, they muttered, “Brother, how are we going to run? Running now will definitely get us caught back by them.”"]},{"number":4426,"title":"Chapter 4426: One Punch","paragraphs":["Chapter 4426: One Punch","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“We can’t run now, wait until they let their guard down.” The two of them squatted at the grass for a while, and then obediently walked back again.","When they got on the carriage and saw that the middle-aged man was trying to tie them up with a rope again, Yue’er spoke, “Uncle, can you not tie them up, my hands hurt.” She rubbed her small hands, and because of her tender skin, there were already a few bruises.","The middle-aged man thought that these two brats would be sold at a high price, and saw that the two were also really small, even if they weren’t tied up they wouldn’t be able to escape, so he grunted and said, “Be good and stay inside, or else! Hmph!”","The two children were pushed in, leaning against sitting inside the carriage, with the carriage running up again, the two were also worried that their Big Brother would be worried if he couldn’t find them.","Just, after all, they were just a few years old, even if they were smart, they were facing two adults. Even if they had daggers in their space, they did not dare to do anything.","“Brother, look.” Yue’er took out a pill from her space, smiling like a little fox, “This is what Big Brother gave me, we can use it.”","Looking at the pill, Muchen’s gaze flickered slightly, thinking of the fact that within the medicine their Big Brother had given them, there seemed to be one that could make people unconscious.","Thus, his eyes lit up and he took the pill in Yue’er’s hand and lowered his voice, “Sit down, let me do it.” Saying this, he took out the fist-sized night pearl from the space, crushed the pill and smeared it on it, following which he took it out.","“Uncle, this bead is for you guys, can you let us go?” Muchen said, holding the night pearl in both hands and handing it to the middle of the two men.","In the night, a sudden dazzling light filled the air, causing the driving man and the slightly chubby middle-aged man to be stunned, immediately stopping the carriage and turning around to see the child holding a glowing bead and handing it to them to look at.","“Hiss! This, this is the Night Pearl?” The slightly chubby middle-aged man huffed out a breath of cold air, and somewhat incredulously came forward, “How could there be such a large Night Pearl? Is this really a Night Pearl?”","The driving man is also the first time to see such a treasure, and could not help but come forward to look at it. The more he looked at it, the more he felt that the beads glow like the bright moon, it was simply breathtaking.","“I’m seeing such kind of treasure for the first time, how much is it worth?” Greed appeared in the man’s eyes, wanting to reach out and touch it, but the middle-aged man slapped his hand away.","“This is a treasure of great value! You can’t touch it indiscriminately!” The middle-aged man said, taking the night pearl with both hands and staring at Muchen suspiciously, “How did you get such a bead? Where did you take it from?” When these two brats took over their hands, their clothes were intact and there was nothing of value, so where did they take this treasure out from?","Hearing this, Muchen’s gaze shrank, he pursed his lips and didn’t speak just looked at them while slapping the powder off his hands.","Looking at his hands patting the powder, the middle-aged man was about to say something, but then he saw the man suddenly fall down, he was shocked, and when he violently turned back to look at the child, he didn’t expect to be met by the child swinging a fist.","“Bang!”","Muchen’s tightly clenched little hand condensed a thin trace of spirit energy breath, and a heavy punch was thrown out, directly knocking the person out.","It was also true that if it was an ordinary small punch, it would not have much power since, but, if it was imbued with a trace of spirit energy, it would not be something that an ordinary person could withstand."]},{"number":4427,"title":"Chapter 4427: Going Back","paragraphs":["Chapter 4427: Going Back","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Arghhhh!”","That slightly fat man cried out in pain, the whole person fell backwards, rolled down and fell off the carriage, the night pearl in his hand also rolled down on the side of the road, just when he wanted to stand up, he only felt dizzy and then fainted.","The two children jumped down from the carriage, Yue’er quickly went to pick up the night pearl to wipe off the things stained on it and held it in her arms, and when she looked up, she saw her brother take out a dagger.","She was startled and asked, “Brother, what are you going to do?”","“Kill them.” Muchen said, his gaze fixed on the two people on the ground. If he took the night pearl out, these two people would have to die, although, he hadn’t killed anyone before, but, he had watched his Big Brother do it, only, when he held the dagger, he looked at the people on the ground, but somehow he didn’t dare to lay his hands on them.","“Brother.”","Yue’er hurriedly came to his side, hugged his hand, and said, “Brother, let’s not kill them, we have medicine, feed them the medicine and they will die on their own.”","Upon hearing this, Muchen’s hand holding the dagger slowly let go, as if he was relieved, and looked at Yue’er, “Is there poison?”","“There is.” Yue’er smiled and narrowed a pair of eyes, took out a small medicine bottle from space, poured out two small pills from it and stuffed them into the mouths of the two people on the ground, and then uneasily took out water and poured it down for them.","“Alright.”","Yue’er said, squatting next to him with a pair of eyes wide open and watching. Because the medicine was something he pestered her Big Brother to give her, Big Brother only said that it was poison and that eating it would kill people, so she wanted to see what it would be like for someone who ate the poison and died?","Seeing his soft and cuddly sister squatting next to those two people looking at how they were poisoned to death, the corner of Muchen’s mouth twitched, and he only felt that this sister of his was also really big-hearted.","“Big Brother, their noses and eyes are bleeding.” Yue’er said in surprise and hastily backed away, while patting her small chest, saying, “So scary, so scary.”","Muchen glanced at them and silently averted his gaze. This big night, she was holding a night pearl in her arms, and shining the light on those two corpses, looking at the way they bled from seven holes under the light, it was indeed quite scary.","“Brother, let’s go back to find Big Brother! Big Brother can’t find us, he must be anxious and crying.” Yue’er said, hugging the night pearl with one hand and holding his hand with the other.","“Mm, let’s go back to find Big Brother.” Muchen nodded his head, he also knew that Big Brother must have cried anxiously when they disappeared. At that moment, holding his sister, they walked back the way they came.","They had the night pearl illuminating the road, and the faint moonlight from the full moon in the sky, and the two of them could be their companions, and they didn’t feel scared as they walked along the way, or maybe, the two of them were too young, and didn’t know what fear was, and while they were walking, they were also chatting about everything under the sky.","“Brother, when can we become powerful? If we become powerful, those bad guys won’t dare to catch us.”","“We’ll become powerful if we cultivate hard.” Muchen said.","“Then isn’t it true that when we grow up, we’ll become powerful?” Yue’er’s soft childish voice rang out in the night.","“Mmm.”","“Then when will we find our way home? Will Father and Mother come to find us? What if Father and Mother don’t know we’re here?”","“We will definitely go home, and Father and Mother must be looking for us.”","In the night, the two tiny figures were walking, holding their little hands while talking until, after an unknown amount of time, the sound of horses’ hooves was heard coming this way ..."]},{"number":4428,"title":"Chapter 4428: Meeting","paragraphs":["Chapter 4428: Meeting","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Because he couldn’t see what kind of person it was, at that moment, Muchen put away the Night Pearl and pulled his sister to hide in a bush. In this deep night, he was also afraid of encountering bad people and getting caught again.","Pan Ning rode his horse with Hao’er and knew that he was anxious, so he comforted: ” Don’t worry, the road to the Imperial Capital is straight except for the waterway, escorting two children, they shouldn’t use the waterway, so they will only take this road, and this road in the diversion is not close, I guess they haven’t gone to the diversion yet, and they will catch up with them.”","Hao’er’s hand was tightly grasping the horse’s rope, his eyes looking ahead with worry, just hoping that he could see his sibling’s figure. Only, from the time the horses galloped past the place where the two little ones were hiding from afar, even they didn’t notice that there was someone in that grass.","Still, Muchen and Muyue saw their Big Brother sitting in front of the horse and hurriedly came out shouting, “Big Brother, Big Brother, we are here! Big Brother!”","The horse galloped out dozens of metres, and when he vaguely heard the voice coming from behind him, Hao’er’s expression changed and he turned back fiercely to see the two little ones waving their little hands under the moonlight and shouting at him.","“My siblings are there! Hurry back!” Hao’er said in surprise, pulling the horse’s rope tighter.","Pan Ning also heard the sound behind him, and at that moment turned his horse towards them with a puff, and it was only when he arrived in front of them that the horse stopped, and the child sitting in front of him had leapt off.","“Chen’er, Yue’er, how are you guys? Are you hurt?” Hao’er asked nervously, checking them carefully as he spoke.","“Big Brother, we are not injured.” The two little ones said in unison.","Hao’er saw that both of them were dirty, but their eyes were shining brightly as they looked at him, he couldn’t help but hold them tightly into his arms, “I’m sorry, it’s Big Brother’s fault, it’s Big Brother who didn’t protect you guys well.”","Muchen clumsily patted his back and said, “Big Brother, we’re fine, don’t worry about it.”","“Mmmmm, we’re fine oh, Big Brother don’t worry.” Yue’er also followed her brother’s example and patted her Big Brother’s back.","Pan Ning looked at these three children, his lifted heart finally letting go, he exhaled lightly, looking at those two small ones, there was surprise in his eyes.","Such small children, in the end how did they escape? And encountered such a thing, actually can still be so calm to comfort their brother, also really understand things.","“How did you guys escape? And where are the people who captured you?” Pan Ning dismounted and inquired.","The two little ones glanced at him, and when they saw that it was him, Muchen didn’t say anything, while Yue’er called out with a smile, “Uncle.”","Looking at the little girl’s sweet smile, Pan Ning also revealed a smile, “Hmm.”","“Uncle, the bad guys are all dead oh~” She said with a smile, “So we escaped~” As for how they died, she didn’t say.","Hearing this, Pan Ning was slightly surprised and wanted to ask, but saw that the three children had come together to talk again, so he let it go.","Knowing that their Big Brother was not an unusual person, presumably, these two little ones were not unusual either.","“It’s still night now, let’s go back to the city first!” Pan Ning said, looking at the three of them.","“Mmm.” Hao’er answered and stroked the two little ones’ heads.","“Come, you guys get on the horse.” He carried all three children onto the horse’s back before leading the horse back."]},{"number":4429,"title":"Chapter 4429: Confused","paragraphs":["Chapter 4429: Confused","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When they arrived in the city, it was already the middle of the night, and they followed Pan Ning to the inn and then took a bath before going to rest.","Pan Ning had wanted to ask them what they were planning to do next, but seeing as it was so late and the three of them were children, he didn’t ask too much, thinking that he would ask them what they were planning to do tomorrow.","The next day, around the middle of the hour, Pan Ning saw the three children come out of their room and walk down.","“Come over and eat something!” Pan Ning shouted at them.","Hao’er paused for a moment, then led the two younger ones towards him, asking for a seat at the table.","Pan Ning scooped a bowl of congee for each of them and said, “Eat some congee first, this is made from chicken broth, it tastes pretty good.”","“Thank you, Uncle.” Yue’er thanked him sweetly.","Pan Ning smiled, and called for some more pastries to come up, accompanying them to eat another bowl of congee before letting the people remove the things on the table, and only then asked, “What are your plans?”","The two younger ones looked towards their Big Brother, in fact, what they were preparing for was to go to the Imperial Capital to have a look around, maybe in a place like the Imperial Capital, there might be people who knew about Immortal Cultivation.","Instead of asking the three of them, it would be better to say that Pan Ning’s question was also asking Hao’er, after all, he was the one who could make up his mind among the three.","“We plan to go to the Imperial Capital.” Hao’er spoke.","Upon hearing this, Pan Ning smiled and said, “Since that’s the case, why don’t you join me on the road! There’s at least someone who can look out for you guys on the road.” He smiled and looked at the three of them, saying, “My home is in the Imperial Capital, I’m familiar with the place, if you guys follow me, at least things like yesterday won’t happen again.”","“Moreover, you guys can also stay at my home when you arrive at the Imperial Capital, at least it will be a lot safer than staying outside.” Pan Ning smiled and said, “I also have a son at home, who is four or five years old and can still keep you company.”","Hao’er frowned and asked, “Why do you want to help us?”","Being asked this question, Pan Ning was stunned, and then smiled in the sun, he looked at Hao’er and said, “Just lifting my hand to get some good karma, don’t worry, I don’t have any other intentions towards you guys.”","The two younger ones looked at Pan Ning and then at their Big Brother, although they did not say anything, one had a pair of bony eyes, while one converged his eyes, not knowing what he was thinking about.","“Fine, we’ll go with you.” In the end, Hao’er still answered.","Upon hearing this, Pan Ning smiled and said, “I still have some things to take care of today, so tomorrow! We’ll set off tomorrow, so you guys can have a good rest, or if there’s anything you want to buy, I’ll have the guards accompany you.”","“Hmm.” Hao’er responded, taking his younger siblings up to the upstairs compartment first, while Pan Ning also went out the door not long after.","In the compartment, Muchen looked at him and asked, “Big Brother, do we really have to go with him?”","“Well, following him will be better.” Hao’er said, his mind moved and took out that transmission jade token from the space, he tried to contact his Mother, however, he still saw that the transmission jade token could not work half the time.","“Take yours out and try.” Hao’er signalled.","So, Muchen and Muyue took out the transmission jade token and tried it, but there was still no response.","“It might have been cut off.”","Hao’er muttered, holding the unresponsive transmission jade token, his heart was also a little confused. He didn’t know how exactly he could contact Father and Mother."]},{"number":4430,"title":"Chapter 4430: Going to the Door","paragraphs":["Chapter 4430: Going to the Door","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","On the other hand, Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu arrived at the palace in the part of the world where Black Tortoise Monarch was located. The two of them were sitting in the palace, drinking tea and waiting for Black Tortoise Monarch’s arrival.","Hearing that Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu had come, the Black Tortoise Monarch was surprised and hurriedly came with his Madam and his child, and before he entered the palace, the sound of laughter rang out first.","“Hahahahahahaha, hearing that Monarch Green Dragon and Ghost Doctor have come, it really surprised me!” He walked in with big strides, and while arching his hand towards them, he said, “This is the first time for the two of you to come, so you must stay here in this Monarch’s place for a few more days, so as to allow this Monarch to do his best as a landlord.”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu got up and returned the salute, while looking towards Madam Xuanyuan and the child she was holding in her hands who followed in from behind.","“Hahaha, this monarch’s madam you guys have seen before, this monarch’s youngest son, I heard that you guys came over, it’s just right that this monarch then let the madam bring the youngest child along with her.” Black Tortoise Monarch smiled and spoke.","“Greetings to Monarch Green Dragon, Ghost Doctor.” The beautiful woman held the child in her arms and slightly bent her knees in a salute.","“Madam doesn’t need to be polite.” Feng Jiu said, her gaze falling on the child in her arms. This must be Hao’er’s younger brother.","“Come, come, sit down.” The Black Tortoise Monarch said, inviting them to sit down and smiled, “I heard that the two of you finally got rid of the Devil Lord some time ago, and even the World Annihilation Black Lotus has finally been resolved, so it’s really a joyous occasion!”","Hearing these words of congratulations, Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu couldn’t help but look at each other, and the two of them revealed a bitter smile.","Seeing that the two of them looked different, Black Tortoise Monarch was slightly surprised and asked, “What’s wrong? Looking at the two of you, how come you don’t seem to be very happy?”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze let out a light sigh and said, “Our couple came over today because we have a matter to explain to Black Tortoise Monarch.”","Seeing his grave expression, Black Tortoise Monarch couldn’t help but feel his heart lift as he asked, “I wonder what it is that Green Dragon Monarch is talking about?”","“Some time ago, not long after we returned home, the devilry cultivators came out to wreak havoc, and in the end, even the Devil Lord appeared, and when he engaged us in a battle, I think Black Tortoise Monarch already knew about it.” Xuanyuan Mo Ze spoke in a deep voice, his gaze falling on his body.","Black Tortoise Monarch nodded, “I have known about this matter for a long time.” That day, the commotion was that big, and all parties were startled, only, exactly how that battle went, was something that no one knew.","“That battle this monarch was seriously injured, there were countless deaths and injuries, and in the end, although the Devil Lord died, and the World Annihilation Black Lotus disappeared along with him, but, there is one thing that none of the outside world knows.” Xuanyuan Mo Ze spoke slowly, thinking of that scene on that day with a heavy heart.","Black Tortoise Monarch and Lady looked at each other and didn’t say anything, just by looking at their expressions, they also vaguely knew that this matter was only not a good thing.","“In order to take revenge on us, Devil Lord used his heart’s blood to activate the Blood Curse Ancient Formation, teleporting the three children away through the Blood Curse Ancient Formation, and at the same time severing the connection between us and theirs, and to this day, we still don’t know where their whereabouts are.” Feng Jiu took over Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s words and opened her mouth, her gaze looking at Black Tortoise Monarch couple and said, “Not only our pair of children have disappeared, even Hao’er, has disappeared along with them.”","“What?!”","The Black Tortoise Monarch couple let out a cry of shock, and they stood up violently, “Are you saying that Hao’er’s whereabouts are unknown today?”","“Mm.” Feng Jiu responded and narrowed her eyes.","“How could this be ...” The Black Tortoise Madam murmured, holding the child in her arms in a daze."]},{"number":4431,"title":"Chapter 4431: Guesses","paragraphs":["Chapter 4431: Guesses","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Although that child has not been close to them since he came back, but, no matter what, he was still their child, they shared the same blood. It was her child that she had given birth to, yet now, they just said that he disappeared?","“Sigh, why is our child’s life so bitter!”","She hugged the child in her arms and sobbed softly, thinking of the hardships he experienced in his early years. Only did he get better over the past few years, but now he is gone again. Her child was not even ten years old, and now he has disappeared. If something happens, how could he cope without anyone taking care of him? Thinking of this, tears involuntarily fell.","“Wooooo ... Mother, wooo hooooo ...” The child in her arms saw his Mother crying and followed suit.","For a while, the atmosphere in the hall was depressing and sad.","“I”m sorry, it’s my fault, if I hadn’t let him follow us, this wouldn’t have happened.” Feng Jiu said guiltily.","“Alas!”","The Black Tortoise Monarch sighed and said, “Ghost Doctor, you don’t need to say these words, all these years, you have treated Hao’er as if he was your own, we also know that, when something like this happens, no one can feel good about it. What’s more, the two of you have lost your own children who are still so young, that’s what makes people worry.”","Black Tortoise Monarch sighed lightly, looking at Feng Jiu who looked down despite her red dress, he also knew in his heart that it was estimated that she was not doing well during this period of time, his son was already eight or nine years old, but the pair of children of the two of them were not even three years old. Just the thought if them being stranded out there all alone without anyone to take care of them, if they really encountered something, he was afraid that they didn’t even have the power to protect themselves.","He did not say anything more, and just said: You do not have to feel guilty, for such a thing to happen, it was not by choice. Right now, the most important thing is to expand our manpower to look for them as quickly as possible.”","The Black Tortoise Mistress originally had some resentment in her heart, but when she heard her husband’s words, she thought that Feng Jiu and their pair of children who were even less than three years old had also disappeared. Learning this, she couldn’t blame her, and all that was left was sympathy.","“Right, it’s better to hurry up and send some people out to look for them, three children are out on their own, how can us a parents not be worried?” The Black Tortoise Mistress wiped her tears and said.","Xuanyuan Mo Ze held Feng Jiu’s hand and said to them, “We have already sent people to secretly look around, not revealing it to the public is also because we are worried that once the news spreads, they will be in danger.” After all, they have a lot of enemies, even if a Devil Lord died, but there are still a lot of people who want to deal with them, it’s just that those people don’t have the strength to fight with them head on.","“Then, is there nothing you can do but to find them without any clues?” The Black Tortoise Monarch asked in apprehension.","Xuanyuan Mo Ze shook his head, and said in a deep voice: “That Devil Lord’s intentions are very malicious, the blood curse ancient array used is specifically aimed at the bloodline, I”m only afraid that, under the power of the blood curse, they won’t be able to remember everything about us, moreover, it’s only feared that their spirit energy breath will also be sealed, because the transmission jade token hasn’t been able to get any news about them, and their contracted beasts are probably not yet awakened either.”","At those words, Black Tortoise Monarch was stunned and asked, “How do you guys know that their contracted beasts haven’t awakened?”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze glanced at Feng Jiu who was restraining her eyes, before he said to Black Tortoise Monarch, “The contracted beast in my daughter’s body is the Ancient Nine Tails Spirit Fox, which has the ability to transform space, if it were to awaken, it would have brought them back, and right now there is no movement, thus judging and learning that their contracted beasts have not awakened.”","It was because of this that they were even more worried."]},{"number":4432,"title":"Chapter 4432: Leaving","paragraphs":["Chapter 4432: Leaving","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Listening to his words, the Black Tortoise Monarch nodded, “I see, since that’s the case, I’ll also send some people to secretly inquire about their whereabouts, and if there’s any news of them, I’ll definitely let you know at the first opportunity.”","“Many thanks.” Xuanyuan Mo Ze arched his hand.","“Since you are here, stay on for some more days!” Saying that, remembering that he only saw the two of them and did not see anyone following, his face was slightly surprised as he asked, “Only the two of you came together this time? Your subordinates didn’t come?”","“No, we arranged for them to go searching and didn’t let them follow us.” Xuanyuan Mo Ze said, glancing at Feng Jiu by his side, saying, ‘This time, only the two of us came out.”","Seeing this, Black Tortoise Monarch nodded and said, “Then I’ll have someone prepare a resting place for you guys, you”ve come all the way here, so you can rest here with us first!”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu stood up and said, “No, this time, we mainly came to talk to you about Hao’er’s situation, so we won’t stay long.”","Seeing that they insisted on leaving, Black Tortoise Monarch didn’t force them any further and said, “Alright then, I’ll see you two off!” With that, he made a gesture of invitation and walked out with them.","He personally sent them away before returning, and when he saw his wife standing at the entrance of the hall with her child in her arms in a daze, he walked over and asked gently, “Why haven’t you gone back yet?”","“Husband, do you think our son can still come back?” She couldn’t help but ask, worry evident in her eyes.","“Sigh, who knows! Nowadays, we don’t even know where his whereabouts are, so how do we know if he can still come back?” Black Tortoise Monarch let out a light sigh, and his mood was also a bit gloomy.","“If he had obediently stayed here and didn’t run off to that Peach Blossom Ridge, I guess he wouldn’t have encountered Feng Jiu and the others, not to mention that nothing like this would have happened.” She couldn’t help but complain, “You say, in case if he can’t come back, then ...”","Seeing her heart complaining, Black Tortoise Monarch shook his head, sighed softly and said, “Madam, back then, if Feng Jiu did not save our child, and brought him around to teach him carefully, there would not be today’s him, although our son is only eight or nine years old, but what he learnt since he was young was different from other people, don’t worry about it! Even if he is out alone, he will definitely be safe and sound, but their pair of children are still less than three years old, which should be fine if they are with Hao’er, if not, I’m afraid that ...”","Upon hearing this, Lady Xuanwu then said, “I know, that’s why I didn’t blame them just now, after all, no one wants to see something like this happen.” Saying that, she patted her son in her arms and said, “The child is going to sleep, I’ll take him to rest first.”","Looking at his confused wife who left with the child in her arms, the Black Tortoise Monarch’s heart sighed. In fact, they as parents also knew that they were more partial to favouring their younger son than their elder son.","One reason was because the eldest son had grown up beside Feng Jiu and the others since he was young, and was more intimate with them, plus his nature was cold, even after coming back to live beside them for a few years, he still remained aloof from them, so naturally, they were more biased towards the youngest son.","Now that their eldest son has an accident, when they as parents heard about it, their hearts were still filled with worry, with only one hope, that he could return safely as soon as possible!","Leaving the Black Tortoise Palace, Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu came to an inn, looking at her with little spirit, Xuanyuan Mo Ze opened his mouth and said: “Let’s stay here for one night first! I think this place can be ruled out, let’s pick another place to look.”"]},{"number":4433,"title":"Chapter 4433: Attack on the Spirit Consciousness","paragraphs":["Chapter 4433: Attack on the Spirit Consciousness","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Well, just stay here for the night!” Feng Jiu rubbed her tired brows and suddenly paused, as if she had thought of something. Her eyes suddenly lit up with hope as she said, “I’ve thought of a way to find out where they are!”","Upon hearing this, Xuanyuan Mo Ze was slightly taken aback and asked, “What way?”","Feng Jiu revealed a smile and said, “Mo Chen’s master, Old Man Tianji.”","Upon hearing her say this, Xuanyuan Mo Ze knew what she meant and asked, “You mean, we go find Old Man Tianji and ask him to point us in the direction of the children?”","“That’s right!”","Feng Jiu nodded and said, “Instead of aimlessly searching in a sea of people, it would be better if we went to Old Man Tianji. Even if he can’t directly calculate exactly where the three children are, he can at least point us in a direction, which should make finding them twice as effective.”","Finally, Feng Jiu added, “When Mo Chen went down the mountain to find Feng Xing, he was also guided by his master. In that case, why don’t we give it a try?”","“In that case, let’s go tomorrow!” Xuanyuan Mo Ze said, putting his arm around her as they entered the inn.","They sat down by a window seat on the first floor. He said, “But today, you have to eat well. You haven’t been eating much lately, and you don’t look very energetic.”","“Alright, I will,” Feng Jiu said, and thinking that she was close to getting a clue about the children, her mood gradually improved.","So Xuanyuan Mo Ze ordered a bowl of ginseng chicken soup as well as a few other dishes that she liked: “First drink the soup, then eat, and after you’ve finished eating, let’s go for a walk to digest our food before coming back to rest.”","“Alright,” Feng Jiu said, and after drinking the bowl of soup, she started eating.","After the two finished eating at the inn, they paid for their room and their meal and went for a stroll in the bustling market outside.","The Black Tortoise Palace was located in the middle of the Black Tortoise Continent, deep in the clouds, and is generally inaccessible to the common people. It is relatively safe there. After they left, they casually came to the town below. Now that they have seen the prosperity of the city, the two of them feel that this region was quite good under the governance of the Black Tortoise Monarch.","At least it seems that the people here are living well.","“I heard Du Fan say earlier that the Black Tortoise Continent was well governed, and now it seems that this is indeed the case,” Feng Jiu said, walking slowly while holding onto Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s arm.","“There are disputes in every place. Looking at it this way, you can only see the surface. However, compared to some places, this city is considered prosperous,” Xuanyuan Mo Ze said slowly.","The two of them walked and chatted, long used to the astonished looks of the people around them, so they didn’t really pay much attention to the stares of those people how had their eyes fixated on them.","However, among those stares, there were a few predatory glances that fell on Feng Jiu.","As soon as those stares landed on her, not to mention her, even Xuanyuan Mo Ze noticed them at once. With their strength, those people’s stares simply couldn’t hide from their keen senses.","Feng Jiu ignored it, while Xuanyuan Mo Ze gave a brief glance. It was the gaze of a few men in brocade clothes on the second floor of a restaurant nearby. He just gave them a cold glance and then withdrew his eyes. However, the men who were staring at Feng Jiu suddenly let out a scream and put their hands over their heads.","“Hissssss!”","“Arghhhhh!”","For a moment, they held their heads in pain and cried out. It was an attack on their spirit consciousness and just one glance had caused them to suffer so much pain."]},{"number":4434,"title":"Chapter 4434: I’ll do it for you","paragraphs":["Chapter 4434: I’ll do it for you","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“No good! It’s a spiritual attack!” A middle-aged man’s face changed as he quickly helped a man in brocade clothes who had fallen to the ground.","“Young Master!”","“Young Master!”","“Hurry, help the Young Master back!”","The second floor of the restaurant was in chaos. People gathered around in low voices, only knowing that the young masters of several families in the city had been carried back together, but not knowing what had happened.","Feng Jiu didn’t even bother to look at the scene in the restaurant. She walked arm in arm with Xuanyuan Mo Ze as the two strolled around the city leisurely. In the evening, the two prepared to go to the inn, but then they saw hundreds of people surrounding them from the front and back.","“Elder, these are the two people!”","“Yes, Patriarch, it’s them. It was this man who injured the Young Master’s spirit consciousness!”","Several families surrounded Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu. At the thought of their sons being injured and unable to recover their strength for a short period of time, they could not help but feel anger well up in their hearts.","“Who are you? Why did you hurt my son!” A Patriarch shouted angrily, his pressure surging out as he glared at the two people in front of him, who looked indifferent.","There was no denying that these two people were extremely good-looking. Even he, who had met all kinds of people, could not help but praise them in his heart. However, they should never have hurt his son, and he could not tolerate it!","“Who are you? Tell us your names!” Another elder shouted angrily.","“How dare you hurt the Young Masters of our families? I don’t think you want to live anymore!”","“Who sent you? Wounding the Young Masters of our clans, what exactly are your intentions!”","Shouts of questioning sounded one after the other, and the people around them could not help but step back. On the large street, only the hundreds of people brought by these clans remained.","“Want to know who we are?” Feng Jiu swept her gaze across the crowd and a faint smile appeared on her lips: “If I tell you, I’m afraid you’ll be too scared to do anything.”","“What an arrogant and ignorant woman!” An elder shouted, saying, “Our families are respected in this city, and if you want to act recklessly, you should at least find out if our families are easy to provoke!”","“Why waste time talking to them? This woman has a demoness’ face that will bring disaster to the country and harm the people. She is a scourge even if she stays alive, so it’s better to kill her now!” Another middle-aged man said, staring at Feng Jiu with murder in his eyes.","“Good! Kill them!” Another man agreed.","A thin-bodied elder stared at Feng Jiu, a trace of inexplicable dark light flashing in his eyes. He said, “Killing her is too kind. How about killing the man beside her? As for the woman, let me take her back to test some medicine on her!”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu listened to what they were saying. Some said to kill her, some said to take the man beside her back to test drugs, and some even said that she was a scourge. Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s face gradually turned cold, and a murderous intent flashed in his deep black pupils. However, those people still didn’t know.","Feng Jiu, on the other hand, gave a faint smile. She sneered inwardly at their comments, and her cold gaze swept over the faces of those people, before she said to Xuanyuan Mo Ze beside her, “You’re right. No matter where you are, there will always be disputes, especially those things that can’t be seen in the light of the day.”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze lowered his eyes and looked at her, smiling with lips curled up. A soft look crossed his dark pupils, and his voice softened a little as he asked, “How do you want to deal with them? Do you want your husband to do it for you?”"]},{"number":4435,"title":"Chapter 4435: Don’t believe it","paragraphs":["Chapter 4435: Don’t believe it","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Feng Jiu smiled and said, “To deal with such people, there’s no need for you to deal with them personally. But do you believe that even if we tell them our names, they won’t believe us?”","Upon hearing this, Xuanyuan Mo Ze froze for a moment and he looked at her, his lips slightly raised, without saying a word.","She smiled, her eyes shining. Her gaze fell on the men leading the way, and she raised her chin in their manner, imperious, as she asked, “Do you know who we are?”","Hearing this, the men were momentarily taken aback and couldn’t help but glance at each other. One of them narrowed his eyes and asked, “Who are you?”","“I am Ghost Doctor Feng Jiu, and he is my husband, Xuanyuan Mo Ze.”","Sure enough, as soon as her voice fell, there was a moment of silence, and then a loud burst of mocking laughter erupted: “Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!”","“She actually said she was Ghost Doctor Feng Jiu? Hahahaha, that’s ridiculous, ridiculous!”","“How dare she impersonate Ghost Doctor Feng Jiu? And she said the man next to her was Xuanyuan Mo Ze? Does she know that Xuanyuan Mo Ze is the Green Dragon Monarch and that Ghost Doctor Feng Jiu is even more revered as the Phoenix Sovereign? They are always unpredictable, and even when they go out, they will bring their subordinates with them. Look at them, just these two people, not even a single follower by their side, and they have the nerve to impersonate Ghost Doctor Feng Jiu and the Green Dragon Monarch?”","“What nerve!”","“What a laugh!”","“I think they just don’t want to die!”","Looking at their reactions, Feng Jiu seemed to have anticipated them, and the smile on her lips deepened. She said to Xuanyuan Mo Ze beside her, “See? What did I tell you? Even if I say it, these people won’t believe me. I really am telling the truth.”","“It seems that your mood is better after all.”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze said slowly, and the coldness on his face also dissipated a little. Thinking about the decision to go find Old Man Tianji made her feel that even if she could not specify a region in the celestial realm, it would still save a lot of time, and she might be able to find her children in no time. Therefore, her mood gradually returned.","Moreover, the appearance of these people seemed to have restored her old self, the person who used to make trouble for others. In that case, let her have some fun!","“I haven’t moved my hands and feet for a long time. Since they’ve come to me, they’re just the perfect practice!”","Feng Jiu took a step forward, moved her wrists a little, and her gaze fell on the people leading the way. She spoke slowly, “It seems that the Patriarchs in this city are not very good. In that case, I don’t mind getting rid of a few of them.”","“What audacity!”","The face of one of the Patriarchs turned pale. Provoked in this way, he was enraged and his aura of spirit energy surged. He took a step forward: “I want to see what skills you really have!”","At this time, due to the concealment of Feng Jiu and Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s strength, they had no idea of their actual strength. It wasn’t until Feng Jiu made her move...","“Crack!”","The sound of a bone snapping resounded, stunning the onlookers. They had expected the Patriarch to send her flying with a palm strike, but instead, the woman in red sidestepped, clasped the Patriarch’s wrist with one hand, and twisted it downward, instantly snapping the bone.","“Arghhhh!”","The cry of pain was accompanied by an incredulous shock. The Patriarch tried to pull back his hand, but his knee was kicked hard, and he immediately fell to his knees.","“Patriarch!”","“Patriarch!”","The people around him were shocked. The more than twenty escorts brought by the family tried to go forward, but the red-clad woman flicked her sleeve, and a force struck out, sending everyone flying."]},{"number":4436,"title":"Chapter 4436: Alarmed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4436: Alarmed","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","As they watched this scene, the people around them widened their eyes. At this moment, no one dared to approach.","Feng Jiu gave those people a faint glance, and with a movement of her hand, she wasted the cultivation of the Patriarch who was kneeling in front of her. In an instant, a miserable scream sounded, startling the people around them and causing them to gasp in shock.","“How dare she!","The elders of the other families looked at the woman in red with disbelief. The woman’s strength was clearly not strong, but the combat power she displayed was astonishing. Even the Patriarch was instantly disabled by her, which was... extremely terrifying!","The Patriarchs of the other families wanted to back away when they saw this, but as soon as they took a step, an indifferent voice resounded.","“Do you think you can get away with this?”","The indifferent voice carried with it a sense of pressure, which made them freeze in their tracks. They stopped taking the first steps back, unable to retreat.","It was a pressure that reached their very souls, like Mount Tai weighing down on them. They could only feel the air become oppressive, making it difficult to breathe. Under the pressure, their legs grew weak and they fell to their knees with a thud.","“Arghhhh!”","“Ghost Doctor, spare our lives!”","“Yes, it was us who were blind and were not able to recognise... Ghost Doctor, spare our lives...”","If they didn’t believe the identity of the Ghost Doctor as self-reported by the woman in red earlier, at this moment, they had no doubt at all, because apart from the legendary Ghost Doctor Feng Jiu, who else would dare to be so arrogant and who else would be so powerful?","However, no matter how hard they begged for mercy, the woman in red just looked at them quietly, her cold gaze making them afraid to look directly at her. They just couldn’t bring themselves to let go of their cultivation and protect their lives.","An old man who had hurried here after hearing the news saw Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu and his eyes narrowed. “Green Dragon Monarch, Ghost Doctor!”","He hurriedly took a step forward and bowed, “Greetings, Green Dragon Monarch, Ghost Doctor.” Cold sweat oozed from his forehead, and his face turned pale as a result.","“And who are you?” Feng Jiu swept himOld Xiu, Old Xiu is a member of the Wu family. I know that the people have caused trouble, so I came to take a look. I didn’t expect to have offended the Ghost Doctor. Please forgive me,” the old man said hurriedly, half-bending over, not daring to stand up straight.","On hearing this, Feng Jiu gave a small smile and said, “In that case, just take away their cultivation! I will not pursue this matter any further.”","On hearing this, the old man hurriedly said, “Yes, thank you, Ghost Doctor, for your generosity.” Immediately, he turned around and looked at the Patriarchs of the various families, and with a calm voice, he shouted, “You blind things! Today, the Ghost Doctor is being generous, so get over here now!”","However, those few people did not dare to approach. At this time, they knelt on the ground one after the other, and they did not even have the strength to stand up. Their faces were ashen, their lips trembled slightly, and they could not even say a word to beg for mercy.","Seeing this, the old man snorted, his figure moved, and he personally took action to destroy the cultivation of the few people in charge. When he turned back to go and apologize to the Green Dragon Monarch and the Ghost Doctor, he saw that the two of them had disappeared without a trace...","Seeing this, his heart finally let go, and he let out a heavy breath. God knows how much he was afraid that they would pursue the matter and bring harm to the entire clan. Now that they had left, he collapsed to the ground and could not get up for a long time."]},{"number":4437,"title":"Chapter 4437: There’s more than meets the eye","paragraphs":["Chapter 4437: There’s more than meets the eye","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","A few days later, Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu finally arrived at the top of Sky Mountain. Once again, they were greeted by the same pure white scenery. As they walked slowly towards the place they remembered, they saw, at the top of the mountain, an old man in white clothes and white hair, seemingly merging with the snow-capped mountains. If one didn’t look closely, one would never know that there was a person sitting there.","Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu stopped a metre in front of him. As they saw him sitting cross-legged with his eyes closed, they didn’t want to disturb him and just stood there quietly, waiting.","Time passed slowly, the breeze caressed them, and a chill crept into their bodies. They didn’t know how long it was, but then flakes of snow began to drift down from the summit above them. The snowflakes fell like goose feathers. Gradually, their heads and the clothes on their bodies became covered in snow. Still, the two of them just stood there, not moving, not speaking, just staring at the white sky, not knowing what they were thinking.","The old man sitting with his back to them also seemed unaware that the two behind him were quietly watching, until, after a long time, he let out a soft sigh: “I am a man from another world, I cannot help you, you should go!”","Upon hearing this, the two men’s expressions twitched slightly. Xuanyuan Mo Ze did not speak, but Feng Jiu did ask, “Do you know why we are here?”","“As the saying goes, nothing comes for nothing. Although I am a man of the outside world, I can see the big picture of the world clearly, and I can vaguely guess the purpose of your trip.”","He spoke slowly, stood up, and gently brushed off the snowflakes on his body. Looking at the two people in front of him, he asked, “You have been standing here for so long, looking at this vast white expanse. What are your thoughts?”","Feng Jiu’s gaze fell on his face, and she said slowly, “It is cold at the top.”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze, however, still did not speak, just watching the snowflakes drift all around.","“Yes, it is cold at the top. Nowadays, you are the Sovereign Rulers of heaven and earth, incredibly noble and powerful. But I want to ask you, can you make it so that it doesn’t snow?” He stroked his beard, looked at the snowflakes in the sky, and asked them with a smile.","Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu were silent, lowering their eyes as they watched the snowflakes fall to the ground, covering it and melting with the existing snow.","“This is the way of heaven, and this is also heaven’s will. Even if your cultivation has reached the pinnacle, there are still many things that are beyond your power to change.” He stroked his beard, looked at the sky, and said, ‘there are nine heavens, and where we are now is not above the ninth heaven. Your power, even if it is strong, cannot defy heaven.”","Hearing his words, Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu inexplicably felt their hearts skip a beat, and they were a little confused.","Feng Jiu paused for a moment. She didn’t ask him what he meant, nor did she ask the reason for this idea. She vaguely felt that what Old Man Tianji said had another deeper meaning, but at this time, she didn’t want to know.","So, she asked, “Senior, has Mo Chen returned?”","Upon hearing this, Old Man Tianji smiled slightly and said, “He’s back.”","“Is he alright? Can we meet him?” Feng Jiu asked.","Old Man Tianji shook his head: ‘the entanglement between him and your destinies is over. There is no point in seeing him again, not to mention that even if you wanted to see him, you couldn’t at this time.”","He looked at Feng Jiu and Xuanyuan Mo Ze and said, “Although he has condensed an immortal body, it is not yet complete.”"]},{"number":4438,"title":"Chapter 4438: The stars of destiny shines","paragraphs":["Chapter 4438: The stars of destiny shines","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Upon hearing this, Feng Jiu apologetically said, “It’s all because of us that he’s in such a state.”","Old Man Tianji shook his head again and laughed, “No, it is the will of heaven that it should be so. It is his destiny to go through this death ordeal. What’s more, this life-and-death ordeal is also a great blessing for him. An immortal body is not something that can be cultivated by just anyone after they first become immortal. This is also his blessing.”","“Senior,” Xuanyuan Mo Ze said, looking at Old Man Tianji and asking, “You can see the will of heaven. Please tell us, where are our children right now? Are they in danger? Where should we go to find them and bring them back?”","Old Man Tianji smiled and shook his head again. “As I said earlier, there are some things that you cannot stop. It is the will of heaven, the result of heaven’s decree. Even if you find them with your own strength, what can you do? They still have to go through the tribulations they are destined to, and they still have to suffer the suffering they are destined to. As the saying goes, if it is a blessing, it is not a disaster; if it is a disaster, you cannot avoid it. Why do you insist on forcing it?”","Hearing this, the two of them could not help but fall silent. Did he mean that they didn’t have to search? How could that be? Those were their children, and they were still so young. How could they possibly hold back from searching?","Feng Jiu paused for a moment, looked at him, and asked, “Senior, the World Annihilation Black Lotus disappeared with the death of the Devil Lord. Has it also been destroyed between heaven and earth?”","Old Man Tianji stroked his beard and smiled, asking, “With the disappearance of the World Annihilation Black Lotus, have you seen its seeds?”","Feng Jiu’s heart skipped a beat, and she had a bad feeling: “What do you mean?”","“That was an ancient object. Even if the Black Lotus flower was destroyed, it would eventually return to become the lotus seed. How could an ancient object be destroyed so easily? Just because you haven’t seen the lotus seed doesn’t mean that the World Annihilation Black Lotus no longer exists in this world.” Old Man Tianji spoke slowly, looking at their suddenly changed faces and smiling. He said, “But you don’t have to worry. It takes more than a day for the lotus seed to bloom into a lotus flower, not to mention that the Black Lotus was destroyed under such circumstances. Perhaps it will take hundreds or even thousands of years before the Black Lotus appears again. It’s just that...”","His voice trailed off, and he looked at the two of them and said, “The way of heaven is ever-changing. Who can be sure? All one can say is that, in the end, everything is predetermined.”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu discovered that they had come with hope and anticipation, but after listening to his words, they felt their hearts grow heavier.","This Old Man Tianji’s words were full of meaning, but he didn’t say it all, which really made them feel on tenterhooks, but at a loss.","“Senior, heaven’s will is not unchangeable, and heaven’s ways are not without variables. Right now, we just want to know where our child is, and whether he is in danger?” A deep voice came from Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s mouth as he asked again, his penetrating gaze fixed on Old Man Tianji, determined to get some answers.","Seeing this, Old Man Tianji smiled, folded his arms, and looked into the distance, saying, “Every night, I observe the stars, watching the movements of the stars that determine the fate of the world. They, originally, were not destined and had no stars and were not supposed to be born. But when they were born, there were strange phenomena in the sky, and they were congratulated and blessed by the monarchs of all directions. Not long ago, two stars of destiny lit up the starry sky, dazzling and very visible.”","He looked at the two of them and said, “I think you have also gone through a lot of trouble for them. Even now, even though their fate stars are low and surrounded by dark clouds, they are protected by the lucky star. Even if they encounter danger, they will be able to turn it into safety.”"]},{"number":4439,"title":"Chapter 4439: It’s Not Time Yet","paragraphs":["Chapter 4439: It’s Not Time Yet","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Upon hearing this, Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu looked at each other and secretly let out a sigh of relief. No matter what, turning a bad situation into a good one was a good thing.","“Only, if you want to find them, it’s also difficult.” Old Man Tianji looked at the two of them and said, “The Ancient Blood Curse is not a small matter, the bloodline of the closest relatives, not a day’s strength can break through it, moreover, this should have been their tribulation, even if you want to guard against it, you won’t be able to do so.”","“But, they are so small, could it be that we stand by and do nothing?” Feng Jiu couldn’t help but speak.","Old Man Tianji laughed and said, “No, you guys have deep affinities, this parting, you won’t be separated for too long, what’s more, you guys were able to find your way here to this Old Man, so naturally, this Old Man had to point out a path for you as well.”","Upon hearing this, Feng Jiu was delighted and said, “Please do, Senior.”","“Then let’s take your blood as a guide!” Old Man Tianji said, signalling the two to extend their hands.","Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu saw this, immediately stretched out their hands and saw his hand flicked. They only felt a tingle at their fingertips as a drop of blood seeped out when his hands touched their blood to form an array. Soon, an ancient array was formed beneath their feet and the next moment, the array flashed and transformed into a drop of blood and flew towards the sky. It stayed for an instant after that drop of blood flew down and soon disappeared.","Old Man Tianji quietly watched until the drop of blood disappeared, then he looked at the two of them and said, “See? Even using the blood as a guide, it still can’t give you the exact location, it can only give you a narrower scope to look for.”","He paused for a moment before he said, “Your children, at this time, are in the south-east direction of the Lower Realm, follow this clue to find them!”","Upon hearing this, the two of them immediately arched their hands and saluted, “Many thanks for the guidance, Senior!”","Old Man Tianji looked at the two of them, seeing an unconcealable look of delight on their faces, after a pause, he asked, “Your current strength is at the peak of the Divine King, right?”","The two of them were slightly surprised and looked at him, not knowing what he meant by this.","Old Man Tianji laughed and said, “Above Divine King is Supreme, Old Man is looking forward to when your cultivation ascends to the peak of Supreme.”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu looked at each other, and always felt that everything he said today had some deep meaning, and this deep meaning was also worth exploring. Thus, Xuanyuan Mo Ze looked at him and said bluntly, “Senior’s words today, it seems that there is always something in his words, how about if he could say it more explicitly?”","Old Man Tianji shook his head, “The time has not yet come, Old Man Tianji cannot divulge heaven’s will.”","Seeing this, they didn’t ask any more questions, but instead arched their hands and said solemnly, “In that case, we’ll take our leave first, and when we find a few children returning in another day, we’ll bring them here to thank Senior.”","“Go!” Old Man Tianji said, looking at the two of them, saying, “You need to keep in mind, just let nature take its course, everything will have its own destiny.”","“Farewell.” The two once again arched their hands before they condensed their spirit energy and rose, travelling in the air, in the blink of an eye, disappeared in the sky ...","Watching them leave, Old Man Tianji stroked his beard and murmured, “When the phoenix star appears, an extraordinary soul enters the world. She came from afar, through the heavens and skies, to be the Sovereign of the world. Feng Jiu, you won’t stop here ...”","At this time, Xuanyuan Mo Ze’s and Feng Jiu left, then directly returned to the Feng Manor, intending to talk to their family, and then plan a place to look.","After all, since things happened, they have not personally returned to the Feng Manor to explain, their loved ones at home were also fraught with worry.","With a flash of light, the two appeared in the backyard of the Feng Manor, and Feng Sanyuan, who was pacing around in the courtyard with worry, was startled."]},{"number":4440,"title":"Chapter 4440: Important Official","paragraphs":["Chapter 4440: Important Official","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Grandfather.” Feng Jiu called out and walked towards him.","“It’s you two? Why did you come back without saying anything?” Feng Sanyuan fixed his mind, seeing that it was the two of them he asked sharply, “Is there news of the three children?”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu looked at each other and said, “We came over this time to discuss the situation, there are already some clues, just, we haven’t found them yet.”","“Where did you come from this time?” Feng Sanyuan asked, his gaze falling on them.","“Father, they just came back, it’s better to let them rest before saying anything!” Feng Xiao walked over from the back and said to Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu, “Your Grandfather is also worried about the few children, but since you guys are here, let’s rest before we talk! I see that you guys are all covered in dust, you must be exhausted.”","The whereabouts of the children were unknown, if one were to talk about worry, the two of them were the most worried. They’ve been searching for so many days, and they’ve also looked more haggard than before.","Hearing this, Feng Sanyuan also came back to his senses, seeing that the two were indeed all dusty, fatigue evident on their faces, he hurriedly said, “Right, right, if you’re tired, take a rest first!”","Feng Jiu smiled faintly and said, “We are fine, in fact, we went to Old Man Tianji to ask him for guidance, although we haven’t found a few children yet, however, there are more or less some clues.”","In order to avoid them from worrying, Feng Jiu said again, “According to Old Man Tianji, the several children will turn out to be lucky even if they are out there, Grandfather and Father shouldn’t worry too much, we will go to look for them, and if we find them, we will bring them back.”","She briefly told them about the matter and was arranged by them to go and rest first. Back in the familiar compound, when only two people were left, Feng Jiu looked at Xuanyuan Mo Ze and said, “You say, what exactly did Old Man Tianji mean by those words?”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze shook his head and said in a deep voice, “I can’t guess what he means either, but since he doesn’t say it explicitly, let’s pretend we don’t know! Right now, we should still find our children first, and other things will be revealed later.”","She reached out and wrapped her arms around his waist, leaning her head on his shoulder, and spoke softly, “Hopefully, as he said, everything will turn out well for the children!”","“It will.” Xuanyuan Mo Ze put his arm around her and looked towards the sky.","On the other side, Hao’er, Chen’er and Yue’er followed Pan Ning to the Imperial Capital, looking at the prosperity of the Imperial Capital and the guards at the city gates, the three children looked at the window of the carriage, their gazes flickering.","This is the Imperial Capital, just don’t know, can we find a person who cultivates immortality here in the Imperial Capital?","Pan Ning looked at the three of them and smiled, “I’ll take you to the manor first, you’re tired from running all the way, rest well today, tomorrow if you want to go out and come have some fun, I’ll have someone accompany you out.”","“Do you have many people at home?” Hao’er asked, looking at him, saying, “Will it cause you trouble if we go like this?”","Hearing this, Pan Ning smiled and said, “Speaking of which, you all haven’t asked me, and I haven’t told you yet. In fact, my Pan family is also an official family in this city, my grandfather was once a Grand Tutor, only that he is now old and retired from idling around at home, my father and brother are important officials of the current dynasty. While I, on the other hand, have an idle position. There’s many people at home but to say the least, you guys can rest assured that adding you three will not affect us whatsoever.”"]},{"number":4441,"title":"Chapter 4441: Repeated Warnings","paragraphs":["Chapter 4441: Repeated Warnings","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The two younger ones were a little confused when they heard this, so they looked at their Big Brother.","Hao’er heard him say this, so he didn’t say anything else. He thought that since he was not familiar with the place, he would first stay at his manor first to see if their family was alright before he would decided whether to stay or not. Even if they left later, he could take out one or two of the things in his space to thank them.","If the family was too complicated, then he will take his younger siblings out to find their own place to live, and then ask for information and spend thier time to cultivate. After all, the space was not to be revealed so easily, moreover, each and every item in there was very precious, especially for mortals, not to mention, they were specially prepared for him by his Mother.","Pan Ning did not know that despite being so young, after hearing his words, he had already thought so far. He only saw him sitting quietly and did not say anything, so he also smiled, lifting the curtain to look at the bustling streets outside. Being back to a familiar place, he also began to feel happier.","That brat of his, he has been gone for so many days, he started to worry whether he was naughty again?","On the way, Pan Ning introduced the place and area to the three of them, as well as some of the rules and regulations of this city. After that, he looked at the three children and said, “At the foot of this Imperial Capital of the empire, there is one thing that you must bear in mind.”","The three looked at him, waiting for his next words.","“The Imperial Capital is inhabited by mostly dignitaries, and being at the foot of the Imperial Capital, the patrols and guards are strict. If any lives are lost, they will all be severely investigated and severely dealt with, and this is something that you must bear in mind.” As he said this, he looked at the three children with a solemn expression.","No one knew better than him how different these seemingly harmless three children were, not to mention the older one, let’s say the two twins who were less than three years old, could escape from that trafficker’s hands and knew how to exterminate them, so they knew how different they were, not to mention the Hao’er who had killed more than ten people without moving.","Although he was young, he was also shocked by the strength he possessed. He was worried that he was still young and hot headed and if he lived in this Imperial Capital,he might take people’s life as nothing. What if because of a few words and he did not take the lives of others seriously? That could be troublesome.","“Uncle Ning, you’re saying that you can’t just kill anyone, right?” Yue’er asked with a smile, her soft and childish voice carrying a sweet smile, innocent and cute.","“Right.”","Pan Ning nodded, “No matter what happens, remember to never get anyone killed, the consequences will be very serious if they do.”","“Mm hmm, Yue’er knows, we’re good children, we won’t just get anyone killed~” She smiled and curved a pair of beautiful eyes as she spoke softly.","Hearing these words, the corners of Pan Ning’s mouth twitched, somewhat crying and laughing. These three children were no ordinary children, and he actually didn’t know whether it was right or wrong to bring them back home? And would they cause any trouble for their Pan family?","However, looking at how young they were, if he let them go, he didn’t know what they would get up to again, so it was better to bring them with him for some peace of mind.","“On the outside, I will say that you are distant relatives of our Pan family. You will first follow my grandfather to study and read well, as for the things you want to enquire about, I will also do my best to help you to enquire about them, and before that, remember, don’t let other people know about it, or else you will surely get into trouble, got it?” He once again reminded them."]},{"number":4442,"title":"Chapter 4442: Entering the Pan Manor","paragraphs":["Chapter 4442: Entering the Pan Manor","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Hmm.” The three of them nodded seriously, in fact, without him saying it, they understood.","The carriage walked leisurely until, after turning into a more secluded alleyway and walking for a while it went quiet, before they even got off the carriage, they heard a small child’s voice ring out with excitement.","“Father is back! Father is back!”","The three children in the carriage quietly lifted open the curtain to look out, and saw that it was a four or five year old boy running up to them, followed by a beautiful woman, as well as several subordinates.","Pan Ning got off the carriage first, and saw his son pounce over, so he picked him up, “Son, come, let Father see if you’ve put on weight again?” He laughed as he picked his son up and pinched him on his fleshy little face, smiling as he looked at the woman walking behind him and softly said, “Madam, I’m back.”","“Husband.” The beautiful woman smiled and went forward, coming to his side and busily calling out, “Qing’er, quickly come down, your Father is tired from the journey, how can you let him carry you again!”","“Oh.” The child answered and came down from his arms, one hand held by his Mother, one hand holding his Father, excitedly saying, “Father, Father, let’s quickly go into the manor, I want to see the gift Father bought for me.”","“Wait for a moment.” Pan Ning smiled, stroked his son’s head, then looked towards the unmoving carriage, walked forward, picked open the curtain and smiled, “Come down quickly!”","The beautiful woman holding her son surprised to look at the carriage, see, a little boy first walked out, himself leaped off the carriage, and then turned back to reach inside and carried down a little girl that looks less than three years old, followed by a small boy that looks exactly the same, followed by a small boy who jumped off the carriage on his own.","Looking at the three children standing beside her husband, she couldn’t help but be stunned, and didn’t know what came to her mind, her face turned slightly white, and her figure shook slightly.","“Husband, they are ...” the woman asked, her beautiful eyes looking towards Pan Ning.","Pan Ning saw her look, knew that she thought too much, so he smiled and came to her side to put his arm around her waist to support her, and said, “Lady, don’t think too much, this is not the place to talk, let’s go in and talk about it!”","Pan Ning’s son, on the other hand, did not understand his Mother’s strangeness, he was looking at the three people in front of him with curiously wide eyes, his gaze turned on Hao’er’s body before falling back to the two little dolls that were smaller than him but looked exactly the same, a look of novelty on his face.","“Let’s go! I’ll take you guys to get to know the people in the manor.” Pan Ning said as he looked at the three children and led them inside together.","The subordinates of the manor had gone to inform them early, and without a mansion, the old man of Pan Manor and the others knew that Pan Ning had returned, and had brought the three children with him, so they all came to the front hall.","“Big Brother, why are you at home today? Is father also here?” Seeing his elder brother walking out, Pan Ning smiled and called out inquiringly.","That was a man a few years older than Pan Ning, with an aristocratic aura tinged with a bit of harshness, somewhat different from Pan Ning’s flamboyant and elegant Young Master.","At this time, he stood with his arms folded, his eyes swept past Pan Ning, and landed on the three children to take a look. He was slightly surprised, but his face did not show it.","No other, only afraid, these three children born too outstanding, at such a young age, their outstanding looks were unparalleled. One can imagine how many people would be smitten by them when they grew up."]},{"number":4443,"title":"Chapter 4443: What’s going on","paragraphs":["Chapter 4443: What’s going on","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","And what surprised him even more was that these three children emanated a noble aura! He was the official in the court, and has seen all kinds of characters, however, even the temperament of the Palace’s Prince and Princess was not as good as these three small children.","The two twins were still young, the little girl was blinking her pair of pure and beautiful eyes, simple and lovely, while the little boy had a small adult appearance, his expression stern and solemn, his pair of eyes filled with scrutiny and probing.","There was also that older boy, looking no more than eight or nine years old, but an aura had already been vaguely formed, like a sharp sword. He was stern and regal, his breath slightly cold and his small face was cold with sharpness. At this time, he was also staring at him, at the same time as he was sizing him up, he was sizing him up as well.","One had to know that he himself was of a high position, he had great aura and even adults did not dare to stare at him straight in the eye. Yet, these three children, not only were they not scared, there was not a trace of panic, and even dared to stare straight at him to size him up. He had to admit that that left him somewhat impressed.","“I’m off today, Father also just came back and knowing that you should have arrived, I came over.” He said, his gaze retracting over the three children.","“That’s just right, I brought the three children back, it’s just right to introduce them so that everyone can get to know each other as well. From now on, these three children will be staying at our home.” Pan Ning said with a smile, and said to the lady beside him, “You take the children inside first, and have the servants prepare some pastries for them to eat first.”","“Yes.” The beautiful woman answered softly, and after making a slight bow, she then held her own son, looked at the three children, and said in a warm voice, “Come in with me! Go to the front hall to take a rest.”","Looking at the several children being led away, Pan Hong then asked, “What’s going on here?”","“It’s a long story, hey, Grandfather is here.” When Pan Ning saw the familiar figure coming slowly, he couldn’t help but smile and hurriedly went forward to help him, “Grandfather, you’re well-informed! You knew as soon as I entered the house.”","Elder Pan glanced at him and said, “I heard that you brought three children back, that’s why I thought to come over to see what’s going on with you?” With slight pause, he continued on, “You wouldn’t have messed around outside and done something wrong to Qiuyi, right?”","At those words, Pan Ning was stunned, then laughed out, “Grandfather, what kind of person is your Granson?! Besides, I am deeply in love with Qiuyi, how could I do that kind of thing? This matter, ah, it really isn’t what you think it is.”","He laughed and shook his head, he didn’t expect his family to misunderstand, however, he didn’t say anything else, he just said, “These three children were the ones I met when I was returning, they were just separated from their family and couldn’t remember where their home was, so I brought them back so they will be temporarily living in our home.”","“That’s not a brilliant excuse, it’s full of loopholes.” Next to him, the Patriarch of the Pan Family, Pan Hong, faintly swept a glance at him, clearly not believing his words.","The Old Patriarch also glanced at him without saying anything, and that glance made it clear that he shouldn’t just bring up excuses to fob them off.","Pan Ning smiled sardonically, and at that moment, he saw his Father arrive, and at that moment, he hastily saluted and called out, “Father.”","“Mm.” He nodded and looked at Pan Ning, “Why did I hear that you brought three children back? What’s this all about?”"]},{"number":4444,"title":"Chapter 4444: Moving into the South Courtyard","paragraphs":["Chapter 4444: Moving into the South Courtyard","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Heh heh heh, this, I’ll tell you guys more about it when we get to the backyard later! For now, let’s go in first and take you guys to meet these three children, from now on they’ll be living in our house.” Pan Ning said, as he invited the three children to go first.","The three of them looked at each other before taking a step inside, for the two of them, Elder Pan and Pan Hong, who had arrived first and had seen those three children, they walked in slowly, and only after they had walked to the front and sat down, did their gaze fall on the three children.","And when his Father saw the three children, his expression was exactly the same. First, was surprise as he did not expect the three children would be such esteemed nobles with regal aura.","After he glanced at the seated trio, he glanced at his youngest son again before coming to the front and sitting down.","“Ha ha Grandfather, Father, Big Brother, Madam, let me introduce you.” Pan Ning smiled as he stood in the centre of the hall and said to the seated few, “These three children are three siblings, this is the oldest, Xuanyuan Hao, this is Xuanyuan Muchen and this is Xuanyuan Muyue.”","After introducing the three children, he turned to the side as he started to introduce his family to the three children. “This is my Grandfather, this is my Father, there is my Big Brother, this is my wife. These are the people in my family, except for my sister-in-law who has returned to her mother’s home with their pair of children to stay there, all of them are here.”","Upon hearing this, the three children got down from their chairs, but also bowed towards them with good manners, calling out in unison, “Greetings, Great Grandfather Pan, Grandfather Pan, Uncle Pan, Aunt Qiu.”","The titles were what Pan Ning had told them on the way, so the three children followed what he said to address them.","Looking at the three children who were so well-behaved, the few people sitting there nodded their heads, revealing a smile on their faces. The Old Predecessor of the Pan Family looked at the two twins who were so young and knew the rules so well, and liked it in his heart, so his face softened a few points and said to the three of them, “Pan Ning has already spoken to us, and from today onwards, you guys will be staying here! Just treat this place as if it were your own home.”","“Well, since you’re here, don’t be formal, just stay with ease.” His Father also nodded and spoke.","Pan Hong looked at the three children, paused for a moment, and said, “If there’s anything missing, or if you need anything, just tell Pan Ning, and he’ll arrange it for you.”","“Yes.” The three children answered.","“By the way, this is my son, called Pan Boqing, you guys can play with him in the future.” Pan Ning came to his son’s side, stroked his son’s head, and asked with a smile, “Father brought a few little friends back, aren’t you happy?”","“Mmm hmm, I’m very happy! The two little siblings are so cute.” The little boy grinned innocently as he looked at Hao’er, and added, “Big Brother is also good-looking.” Just that he looked too cold, he didn’t quite dare to look at him.","At these words, Pan Ning could not help but laugh out softly and pinched his son’s little face.","At this moment, Pan Ning’s wife, Qiuyi, then stood up and asked, “Husband, which courtyard do you want to settle the three children in?”","Hearing this, some of the several elders of the Pan family looked towards Pan Ning, while others restrained their eyes and sipped their tea, but they all listened with sideways ears to see how he would arrange it.","“Give them the South Courtyard to live in!” Pan Ning said with a smile, saying, “The South Courtyard is quiet, and the environment is also good, so let the three siblings live together, and they can also be companions.”","Hearing that it was actually the South Courtyard, the Master of the Pan Family, Pan Hong, raised an eyebrow, somewhat amused and surprised."]},{"number":4445,"title":"Chapter 4445: Asked In Detail","paragraphs":["Chapter 4445: Asked In Detail","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","One had to know, the South Courtyard was actually the best one after several main courtyards of the Pan family, usually even if entertaining general guests, one will not arrange to the South Courtyard. It’s only when entertaining honourable guests, would they arrange to stay in the South Courtyard. None of them had expected that Pan Ning would arrange the South Courtyard for three children to live in. It was really surprising and also more curious, who were these three children?","Old Patriarch Pan glanced at Pan Ning, and with a light cough, he said, “Qiuyi, take the children to familiarise themselves with the manor’s surroundings first, then see what you want to add, and arrange it for them.”","“Yes.” She answered and bowed before leading her son over and spoke in a gentle voice to the three children: “Follow me, I’ll show you the courtyard.”","The three of them responded and bowed in a regular manner to the several people in the hall before following them out.","With their departure, only the Pan family father and son remained in the hall. Looking at the several people sitting there, Pan Ning couldn’t help but smile bitterly, originally thinking that he would talk to them in detail in the backyard, but from the looks of it, they had a lot of things to ask him.","“Now, tell us properly! What’s going on here?” Old Patriarch Pan lifted his teacup and took a sip of tea, then slowly said, “Don’t think about weaving some story to hoodwink us, whether it’s the truth or not, we’ll know it as soon as we hear it.”","Pan Ning helplessly smiled, stepped to the side and sat down, said: “Grandfather, where can I find the guts to deceive you! It’s just that it’s a long story.”","“Then take your time, we have time today.” His Father said, also picking up the tea, with the posture of being ready for a long chat.","Seeing this, Pan Ning let out a silent sigh and said, “I really don’t know where to start.”","Upon hearing this, Pan Hong then asked, “What are they? Where do you know them from?”","Pan Ning glanced at his elder brother, waved his hands, and laughed, “You may not believe me when I say it, I really don’t know what they are, but I can tell you about the latter question, I met them in Chess City.”","However, as soon as the three old foxes heard his words, they discovered the problem. What he said meant that he only answered selectively. This was interesting, it seemed that it wasn’t that he didn’t know what origins these three children had, he just didn’t tell them.","The three of them looked at each other and averted their gazes in unison.","Pan Ning sipped his tea, but he didn’t notice them exchanging glances.","“Where is their family? Why didn’t they go home? Instead, why did you, and why did you bring them home instead? What is the reason for this?” Pan Hong asked again.","With Pan Hong asking, the two elders sipped their tea as well, treating it as if they were listening from the sidelines.","“They’re looking for them as well, only, they were injured and hit their heads, and couldn’t recall where their home was.” Pan Ning said, put the tea cup down, looked at the three of them, said, “The three children do not have elders and adults around them to follow and protect them, you have also seen that the three of them, just from their very appearance and temperament is not like the average family’s children. Wherever they go, they will attract all kinds of unwarranted attention.”","He paused for a moment, said, “In Chess City, the two little ones were targeted by human traffickers and were taken away, it was me who helped to save them. Seeing that they also had nowhere to go, I thought of letting them come back with me, anyway, our family can afford to raise the three of them. On one hand, they can be a companion for the children of the family, and on the other hand, we can gain some good karma.”"]},{"number":4446,"title":"Chapter 4446: Very Good","paragraphs":["Chapter 4446: Very Good","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Listening to his words, the three fell silent. In their hearts, they were thinking, not bad, in their eyes, naturally they could see that the three children have an extraordinary origin and must not be the children of ordinary people. However, just from this, he simply brought back the three children, it seems that ...","His Father looked at him and said, “You know that raising three more children is not a big deal for our Pan family, just that, what we are concerned and worried about is precisely the identity and origin of these three children, and that’s what’s important.”","“I don’t know about their identities and origins, I also know that their origins must be extraordinary, that’s why I thought of helping them out when they are in trouble.” Pan Ning looked at them, his expression carrying seriousness and solemnity, and said, “Grandfather, father, Big Brother, there are things that I cannot tell you, but please believe me, I do things with discretion.”","Hearing him say this, the three of them then didn’t ask any more questions, and just nodded: “If you have said so, then we won’t ask any more questions, and we also believe that you have a sense of proportion in what you do.”","Seeing that they didn’t ask any more questions, Pan Ning was slightly relieved and said, Since they’re staying at home, so I’m thinking, let’s just go with the status of distant relatives! Moreover, I also think that they should follow Qing’er and the others to study with Grandfather.”","Old Patriarch Pan stroked his beard and nodded, saying, “Teaching one is also teaching, teaching several more is also teaching. Since those children also seem to be pleasing to the eye, let them follow and study together!”","“Many thanks, Grandfather.” Pan Ning hurriedly rose to thank him.","Old Patriarch Pan smiled and said, “We’re all family.” He stood up and said, “Alright, I’m going to go back first, you can bring them along with Qing’er!”","“Yes.” Pan Ning smiled and answered.","“I still have some things to take care of, so you’ll have to put in more effort on your own to settle the three children.” His Father said, and followed suit.","Pan Hong walked to his side, patted his shoulder, and said, “I still have to pick up your sister-in-law and the children in a while, so I’ll leave first as well.”","Watching them leave, Pan Ning then stepped out of the hall, looking at the sky outside, his heart moved slightly. This world was so marvellous, if one did not really see it with their own eyes, how could one know that there were really immortals in this world?","If he hadn’t seen it with his own eyes, how would he have believed that three children that young would be so calm and meticulous in dealing with things?","But I wonder what kind of immortals their parents were? How could they raise such outstanding three children ...?","The three children stayed in the manor, telling the servants in the manor that they were the young master and young miss, and because of the instructions and the family tradition of the Pan family, the servants in the manor treated them respectfully and did not dare to be a bit reckless.","It was night, Hao’er stood in the courtyard, looking at the elegant and quiet courtyard, not knowing what he was thinking.","Muchen and Muyue walked out and saw him standing in the courtyard, so they came over and asked, “Big Brother, what are you standing here for?”","Hao’er looked at the two little people and a smile appeared on his cold little face, “No, I’m just thinking about something.” He leads the two of them inside and says, “It’s windy at night, don’t catch a cold, all of you should go to bed early tonight!”","“Uncle Ning said he’ll take us to the city tomorrow.” Yue’er said with a smile.","In the room, Hao’er looked at the two of them and asked, “What do you think of Uncle Ning?”","“Uncle Ning is very good to us!” Yue’er said, while Chen’er didn’t say anything."]},{"number":4447,"title":"Chapter 4447: Pride","paragraphs":["Chapter 4447: Pride","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Upon hearing this, Hao’er held both of their hands and said with a serious look, “The two of you have to remember that although Uncle Ning treats us very well, but no matter what, we can’t tell him our secrets, alright?”","Muchen nodded and said, “I know.”","Yue’er smiled, like a little fox also nodded along, “Mm hmm, Yue’er knows that too, Big Brother told us that one should not try to harm others, but what... ..against ..something to those who want to harm you...well, Yue’er has remembered it all!”","“It’s one should not try to harm others, but you should also be prudent and guard against those who harm you.” Hao’er revealed a smile and taught her once again.","“Mm hmm, Yue’er has remembered~” The little doll smiled and nodded his head.","” As for the things inside the space, you can’t just take them out. You cannot let anyone know that we have space, even Uncle Ning can’t. That includes the mind mantra and martial arts techniques that Big Brother taught you to cultivate, you can’t tell anyone.” He warned them solemnly once more.","“Mm hmm~” The two little ones nodded and responded, listening attentively.","“Alright, you guys are also tired, so go to bed early today!” With the appearance of a young adult, he stroked the two little ones’ heads and told them to go to bed first.","“Then Big Brother should also go to bed early.” The two said.","“Good.” Hao’er watched them take off their outer robes and go to bed before helping them pull up the quilt, before turning around and going outside to the next room.","Since they had to cultivate, there couldn’t be too many servants walking around in the courtyard, so when they wanted to arrange for servants to come over to take care of them today, he refused.","Returning to his room, he didn’t rest directly, but instead, he sat on the bed and cultivated. He was the Big Brother, he was older than his younger siblings, moreover, he thought of more things, only, there were things that he didn’t tell the two younger ones.","There were no immortal cultivators in this continent, he was actually afraid. Very afraid that Father and Mother couldn’t find their way here, and also afraid that they can’t go back, but fortunately, he knows the heart mantra for cultivation, and there were quite a lot of cultivation manuals in his space, so he could only work hard on his cultivation in the hope that his strength will become a little bit stronger, and that he can bring his younger siblings to find the way back in the future.","Early the next morning, Pan Ning brought a few children and left the house in a carriage, compared to the three children who were sitting in a regular manner, his own child was a totally different story. He couldn’t stop moving even when he was sitting in the carriage.","The little boy’s eyes were spinning around, looking at Yue’er who was sitting in the carriage, he couldn’t help but move towards her side and asked with a smile, “Sister Yue’er, I’m also a Big Brother, do you want to call me Big Brother?”","Yue’er blinked her pretty eyes, looking at the little brother in front of her who was older than her, after thinking about it, she sweetly called out, “Big Brother Boqing.”","Hearing that soft and sweet voice sweetly call out to him as Brother Boqing, the little boy jumped up excitedly, “I’ve become a brother too! I’ve become a big brother too!”","The little boy was very happy and looked at Muchen with an expectant face, asking, “Little Brother Muchen, do you want to call me Big Brother as well?”","Muchen glanced at him and looked away, saying, “No.”","“Ah? Why? I’m clearly older than you.” He scratched his head and looked at him with a puzzled expression.","“If I don’t want to, there’s no need to.” Muchen was also a little arrogant, giving such an explanation.","Seeing this, Boqing thought for a moment and pulled out candy from his arms and handed it forward, saying, “Call me Big Brother and I’ll give you candy.”","“Don’t wanna.” Muchen glanced at it and directly averted his eyes.","Pan Ning on the side looked at the arrogance in Muchen’s eyes and couldn’t help but feel amused, he secretly shook his head and laughed, “Alright, Qing’er sit down quickly, don’t fall down later.”"]},{"number":4448,"title":"Chapter 4448: Seventeen","paragraphs":["Chapter 4448: Seventeen","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Pan Boqing saw his Father telling him to sit down, so he obediently ran to his side and sat leaning against him, while his pair of eyes landed on Muchen.","They went to the city and had breakfast and went for a walk around the city and did some shopping. It was only until the evening did they return to the manor.","After sending the three children back to the South Courtyard, Pan Ning paused for a moment and said, “Hao’er, it’s inconvenient for you to have no servants here, so let’s do it this way! I’ll call Seventeen over to follow you.”","Before that, he added, “Seventeen is the secret guard who followed me to that courtyard to look for you that day.”","Upon hearing this, Hao’er thought for a moment before nodding, “Alright.”","“You guys should rest early today! You can study with Qing’er tomorrow.” Pan Ning smiled and said, adding, “As for other things, you don’t need to care too much about them, I’ll help you inquire about them myself.”","“Many thanks.” Hao’er bowed with manners.","Pan Ning nodded, before leaving first.","The three children entered the room, and after a short while, they heard voices from outside.","“Young Master Hao, my subordinate has come to report for duty.” The young man who had changed into an ordinary green robe stood in the courtyard and reported.","The door opened and the three of them walked out, looking at the man in the courtyard. Hao’er then asked, “Did Uncle Ning tell you everything?”","“Back to Young Master Hao, yes, from today onwards, Seventeen will wait by the side of the two Young Masters and the Young Miss and follow the orders of the two Young Masters and the Young Miss.” He said respectfully.","Hao’er glanced at him and did not say anything more, he only told him the rules: “If you stay here, you have to abide by my rules. No one is allowed to enter the courtyard without our permission. For usual times, you can wait outside the courtyard. If something happens, we will call you.”","“Yes.” He respectfully answered.","“You may go!” Hao’er said.","Seventeen made a bow and then retreated.","At nightfall, the three children did not go to bed early, but under Hao’er’s leadership, sat cross-legged on their beds and cultivated. Seventeen, who was on guard outside the courtyard, looked at the room with the lights on, his gaze flickered, and he couldn’t help but think of the words Young Master had given him when he had approached him in the evening.","The Young Master asked him to take care of the three of them, let him do more work, talk less in the South Courtyard. No matter what the three children did or said, he looked in his eyes, not to say anything to the outside world, and even included the Pan Family’s Masters, if they asked, he was not allowed to say much.","Thinking of the Young Master’s instructions, he also knows that these three children come from an extraordinary background and did not dare to be sloppy.","In the room, Hao’er, who accompanied the two little ones to cultivate together, slowly opened his eyes at midnight, looked towards the two little ones and lightly called out.","“Chen’er, Yue’er.”","The two heard his voice and opened their eyes to look at him. The moment their eyes opened, what crossed their eyes was clarity instead of confusion and sleepiness.","“Big Brother, what’s wrong?” Yue’er asked, blinking her big beautiful eyes at him.","“Just come here every night, and don’t go to bed too late. After your spirit energy grows, you don’t need to practice at night. If you have time during the weekdays, you can all practice, however, tomorrow morning you also have to get up early. Big Brother will teach you two some boxing techniques, so both of you have to continue to work hard.” Hao’er was like a little adult and was teaching them earnestly."]},{"number":4449,"title":"Chapter 4449: Class","paragraphs":["Chapter 4449: Class","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Yes, we will.”","The two nodded, before that, Yue’er smiled and said, “Big Brother, if Yue’er sleeps and can’t get up tomorrow, Big Brother must come and call us ~”","Hearing this, Hao’er revealed a smile and touched her head, “Yeah,, Big Brother will. Don’t worry too much and just focus on sleeping, it’s alright if you forget to get up tomorrow, Big Brother will come and call you when he wakes up.”","“Mm hmm~” Yue’er joyfully answered, while yawning.","“Let’s go to bed early!” Hao’er said, tucking them into bed before leaving.","The next morning, before dawn, Hao’er called Muchen and Muyue up. The three of them were practicing boxing in the courtyard, compared to Hao’er’s fists that were strong to the end, Muyhen and Muyue’s punches were weak. But after all, the two of them were also still young so Hao’er’s demand on them was not too high. All he required from them was to practise and get used to the movements, and as for the rest, they would talk about it later on.","After sweating and bathing, the three children ate breakfast and were about to go out when they saw Pan Boqing trotting towards them.","“Big Brother Hao’er, Little Brother Chen’er, Little Sister Yue’er, I’ve come to take you to the school!” The little guy came bouncing along, followed by two boys and girls who were two or three years older than him.","One girl was about six or seven years old, and the boy looked to be the same age as Hao’er, both of them came and looked at the three of them with curiosity in their eyes.","“Little Brother Qing, are they the three people my Father said?” The boy asked, walking up and looking at the three of them.","“Well well, that’s them, this is ...” Pan Boqing was about to speak when the boy interrupted.","“I’m Pan Bowen, this is my sister, Pan Xue’er. My Father is the Master of the Pan Family, we came back yesterday, and we’ve already heard my Father mention you guys.” He said, with a smile on his face, “You are Xuanyuan Hao, the two of you are twins, Xuanyuan Muchen and Xuanyuan Muyue.”","“Brother Bowen, Sister Xue’er, you can just call me Yue’er~” The little doll revealed a sweet smile and looked at the two of them with a well-behaved face.","“This, this is for you.”","The red-faced little girl took out a wooden doll and handed it to Yue’er, she seemed to be a little shy and spoke in a soft voice, but when she heard Yue’er call her Sister Xue’er, her eyes sparkled, she was very happy.","Yue’er’s eyes lit up as she took the gift she handed over and said with a smile, “Thank you Sister Xue’er~”","“I also have gifts for you guys.” Pan Bowen looked at Hao’er and Chen’er, taking out two long boxes from his arms to hand them over, “These brushes are for you, Father accompanied me to buy them yesterday. We specially picked them up for you.”","“Many thanks.” Hao’er and Muchen took them and thanked him earnestly.","“Let’s go to the classroom! If we’re late, Great Grandfather will slap our hands.” Pan Bowen said as they led them towards the classroom.","The red-faced little girl timidly held Yue’er’s hand, and seeing Yue’er smiling, she couldn’t help but smile along with her, and even her footsteps became lighter.","When several children arrived at the classroom, originally Xue’er wanted to sit together with Yue’er, but when she saw Muchen, who looked exactly like Yue’er but had a tense face, she could only find a seat for herself.","There were no outsiders in their class and seeing that their Great Grandfather had not yet arrived, Boqing ran around playing, until he saw his Great Grandfatherdid he hastily ran back to his seat and sat down obediently."]},{"number":4450,"title":"Chapter 4450: Intelligent","paragraphs":["Chapter 4450: Intelligent","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The Old Patriarch walked in slowly with his hand on his back, glancing at the several children who were sitting upright in a regimented manner before he coughed softly and asked, “Do all of you know each other?”","“Yes, we do.” Several children responded.","“Mmm.” Only then did the Old Patriarch walk down and said to Bowen, who was sitting in front of him and said, “The last time, I asked you to memorise a book, today you will write it out.”","“Yes, Great Grandfather.” Bowen answered in a regimented manner and didn’t look back any further, but began to grind his ink and write silently.","“Xue’er, this is the character you will practice today.” The Old Patriarch handed out her homework and walked over to Boqing, saying, “Today, you will practice your calligraphy, and your assignment is here.”","After assigning work to the three of them, he then walked over to the three of them and asked, “Have you ever studied formally? What do you know?”","Hao’er thought for a moment and said, “I don’t quite remember, but, I remember that my parents did teach them.”","Hearing this, the old man paused for a moment and asked, “So, do all of you know how to write your own names?”","“Yes, we do.” The three of them said in unison.","“Write it down and let’s have a look.” He pulled over the chair next to him and sat between them.","Then he saw the three children pick up the brush, dabbed some ink, and earnestly wrote down their names on the paper, before handing them over for him to see.","When he saw what they handed to him, he was a little surprised. Hao’er’s words were crisply written, and the two small ones, although the written strokes were not as stable, but looking at the regular spacing, it was not quite what kids their age would write.","After all, they were still so young ...","However, thinking about the distinctive temperament of these three children, it was not surprising.","“Well, the characters are all written well, today, I will first test you all to see what you all know.” He looked at the three children, thought about it, and tested them one by one.","However, what he didn’t expect was that this school test would yield such startling results.","The three children knew more than he expected, especially Hao’er, it was a book that he had not read and he just let him read it once and he could already memorise it. His amazing memory really shocked him.","However, Old Patriarch Pan wouldn’t have thought that it was because Hao’er was a cultivator, and his spirit consciousness was not comparable to that of any ordinary person.","In just one morning, Old Patriarch Pan could not help but cherish his talent, he found that not only Hao’er, but also the two children who were less than three years old, their memory was also very good. With a little bit of explanation, their level of understanding and comprehension won him over.","“That’s all for today, time to head back! Do the homework you’ve been assigned, I’ll check them one by one tomorrow.” The Old Patriarch reminded them and dismissed them.","Over the next few days, the days went on as usual, only, Hao’er learnt things extremely fast, even Bowen couldn’t catch up with him. Moreover, he didn’t only learn to read and practise calligraphy, he even learnt painting.","On this day, the Old Patriarch was on his way back after class, and when he walked slowly to the front, he met Pan Hong, and after Pan Hong made a bow, he asked, “Why haven’t I seen Pan Ning over the past few days? What has he been busy with these days?”","“Grandfather, I don’t know what he’s been busy with lately, but I see that he goes out early every day and doesn’t return until dark.” He paused for a moment, as if remembering something, and said, “Yes, today I heard someone say that he ran to have a look at the Palace’s book collection.”"]},{"number":4451,"title":"Chapter 4451: Preparing for the funeral","paragraphs":["Chapter 4451: Preparing for the funeral","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","At those words, the old man frowned, “Why did he go there for?”","” I don’t really know.” Pan Hong said, paused for a moment, and then asked, “Grandfather, how are the studies of the three children progressing?”","The Old Patriarch glanced at him and said, “Born smart, can’t forget a single word, can be called a perverse talent!”","Pan Hong’s gaze flickered, “All three children are like this?”","“Mm.”","The Old Patriarch nodded and sighed, “An ordinary family can’t really raise such outstanding children! I really don’t know, what exactly are their origins? I’m really very curious!”","Pan Hong gave a smile and said, “Perhaps, we will know one day.” To be honest, he was also curious about the origins of those three children in his heart, only, the people were brought back by his brother, even though he was curious, he didn’t think of secretly investigating, after all, he believed that his brother, doing things in his own way, when it was time to let them know, they would know.","“Yes, I heard your Father say yesterday that His Majesty seems to want to send you on a long journey?” The Old Patriarch inquired.","“There is such a thing, it’s just that it hasn’t been confirmed yet.”","“If you have to go on a long journey then, the people following you will have to be arranged, and safety is most important.” He patted his shoulder and said, “I’ll go back to rest first, if you encounter things that can’t be solved, discuss more with your family.”","“Grandfather don’t worry, grandson will.” Pan Hong said and watched him leave before heading to the backyard.","Days passed unknowingly, in the blink of an eye, it has been more than three months since the three of them came to the Pan family. Compared to Muchen and Muyue, Hao’er’s cultivation has improved faster, only, in this place, the spirit energy was very thin, and even though there were medicinal pills in his space to enhance his strength, he doesn’t dare to use them casually.","One early morning, the Pan family was sitting around eating their breakfast but the tranquility was broken and they were caught off guard when they received sudden news.","“It’s not good, it’s not good! Old Patriarch, Young Master, something has happened to the Grand Duke!” The Steward hurried in to report, while behind him, two blood-stained and bruised secret guards came in carrying Young Master Pan Hong.","The Old Patriarch, who was eating his breakfast, after hearing the Steward’s words, his entire body violently stood up, the bowl in his hand also smashed on the ground, his heart pounding, he busily asked, “What’s going on? What happened?”","However, when the words fell and he saw the eldest grandchild being carried by the secret guards, he only felt the blood rushing towards his head, and his whole person swayed, almost unable to stand.","“Husband!”","“Father!”","“Father!”","Pan Hong’s wife and children’s faces suddenly changed, and they hurriedly ran forward, but after seeing the injuries and blood all over his body, tears started rolling down their faces.","“How could this happen? How could this happen? Husband, husband ...”","“Hong’er!” Father Pan supported his old man to come to the front together, and when he saw the wounded Pan Hong, he couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air, “Quickly, summon the doctor! Quickly!”","Pan Ning got up late today and didn’t join them for breakfast, but quickly rushed over after hearing the news of his Big Brother’s accident.","Hao’er, Muchen and Muyue were in the South Courtyard, as they were used to eating by themselves, they didn’t know what happened and no one in Pan Manor told them about the news of Young Master’s accident, after all, in the eyes of the public, they were just three children.","The Pan family was in chaos, because Pan Hong was seriously injured, the doctor shook his head after helping him to check his wounds and bandage them with medicine, and said to the Pan family wryly, “The injuries are too severe, it is estimated that he won’t be able to make it through the night, you might as well start prepare for his funeral!”"]},{"number":4452,"title":"Chapter 4452: Terrified","paragraphs":["Chapter 4452: Terrified","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Watching the doctor shake his head and walk out, Old Patriarch Pan’s entire body shook and he blacked out.","“Father, father!” Father Pan was startled and hurriedly held him up while shouting out, “Doctor, doctor!”","“Doctor, quickly take a look at my Grandfather!” Pan Ning quickly headed outside, pulling back the doctor who had just walked out of the room.","The doctor sighed softly in his heart, and came back to help Old Patriarch Pan take his pulse, and tooka bottle and placed it beneath his nose for him to smell as the other hand pinched his an acupoint, and said, “There’s nothing wrong with Old Patriarch, he just fainted when he couldn’t take the blow. This is due to his age, it’s better to send him back to rest first!” The moment he finished his words, the Old Patriarch woke up in daze.","“Is there really no more hope for Hong’er? Doctor, doctor, you must save him! You must save him!” The Old Patriarch woke up and pulled the doctor’s hand, pleading in desperation.","“Alas! Young Master’s lungs have been injured and he has lost a lot of blood, not only that, his hamstrings have also been broken, this, the person who wounded him was really cruel. His injuries are too severe, I really can’t do anything about it!” The doctor sighed softly, drew back his hand and bowed to them before he turned around and walked out.","Listening to the doctor’s words, their faces all turned pale, filled with grief and sorrow, Pan Hong’s wife covered her mouth and lay on the bedside sobbing uncontrollably.","“How could this happen? How could this be ...” His Father’s entire body slumped down, muttering and whispering in disbelief.","Pan Ning clenched his fists and said without giving up, “I’ll go to the city to find other doctors, Big Brother, you go to the Palace right away to explain the situation to His Majesty, and ask the Imperial Physician to come and treat Big Brother!”","“Right, right! I’ll immediately go into the Palace to ask the imperial physician!” Hearing Pan Ning’s words, Father Pan slowed down from the blow and quickly stood up before heading out, “I’ll immediately go into the Palace to ask for an imperial physician!”","“Madam, you send grandfather back to the courtyard to rest.” Pan Ning looked at his wife and spoke.","“No, I’m staying here, I’m not leaving!” Old Patriarch Pan said, unwilling to leave, he was worried that if he left, he wouldn’t see the last of his grandson.","“I’ll take care of it here! With all of you going out, there has to be someone here to look after him as well.” Pan Ning’s wife spoke softly.","“Good, then the manor will be in your hands, I’ll go out now, at sister-in-law’s place, you ...,” Pan Ning signalled, looking towards his sobbing sister-in-law in the inner room.","“You go! I’ll be at home.” She said, watching him quickly leave after pouring a cup of water for the Old Patriarch, before coming to the inner room, squatting down beside her, gently hugging her and comforting her, “Sister-in-law, don’t worry, he will definitely be fine.”","“Oooh ... how could this happen? How did you go out properly and come back injured like this? In the end, what kind of person did this? In the end what happened?” She cried out in grief.","On the other hand, several children of the Pan family were brought back to the courtyard, the manor was in chaos after the incident, they didn’t have the heart to care about several children, so they let the subordinates bring them back to the courtyard.","However, the several children found out what had happened and had been brought back to the courtyard. None of them spoke a word but tears kept streaming down their little faces.","Even the most naughty Pan Boqing, was silent when he saw Bowen and Xue’er crying, stifling his sobs, he wiped his tears, pursed his little mouth, said: ” Big Brother, sister, you do not cry, my Father and Grandfather has already gone to find a doctor, Uncle will definitely be fine.”","“Woo hoo ... there’s blood all over Father’s body, he has been sleeping and may no longer wake up ...” Xue’er was terrified and could not help but burst out crying even more."]},{"number":4453,"title":"Chapter 4453: Have a look","paragraphs":["Chapter 4453: Have a look","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Sister, don’t cry, don’t cry.” Boqing did not know how to coax people saw that she was getting sadder and sadder each moment. Big Brother also lowered his head and tears kept falling. Surrounded by such an atmosphere, he too could not help but also followed and cried out loudly with a wail, wiping snot and tears, while running out.","Hao’er and his siblings were still in the courtyard, and as the South Courtyard was also more remote, although the servants were running about with panicked steps ot the other parts of the manor, all was peaceful back at the South Courtyard.","Seventeen was guarding outside, because he learnt the news from other secret guards, he was also anxious and worried. He kept thinking how things were on the other end?","Just as he was thinking, he saw Boqing walking this way while crying and wiping his tears, he hurriedly went forward and called out, “Young Master Qing, what’s wrong with you?”","Boqing glanced at him and ignored him, still whimpering and crying while walking towards the South Courtyard.","Seeing this, Seventeen hurriedly came to the door of the South Courtyard and spoke inside, “Young Master Hao, Young Master Qing is here.”","“Wooo... wooo...,” Boqing walked inside while crying and came to stand in front of the three of them. He was crying so hard that he couldn’t stop.","Hao’er, Muchen and Muyue couldn’t help but look at each other, and Yue’er couldn’t help but ask: “Brother Boqing, why are you crying? Did Uncle Ning beat you?”","“Wooo... no, no, wooo...,” Boqing cried even harder.","“Then what’s wrong with you?” Muchen then asked as well, really unable to look on any further at this boy who was a head taller than him bawling his eyes out like this.","“Wooo... my, my Uncle, Uncle is going to, is going to wooo... die, wooo...”","He said in a broken voice: “Wooo...I, I told Big Brother and Sister, Sister Xue’er said, said Uncle will be fine, but, but, he has a lot of blood on his body, and, and has not been able to wake up, and the servants in the manor are all, are all saying, the Uncle..Uncle is going to die, wooo... ... I, I don’t want Uncle to die, don’t want Uncle to die, oooh ...”","Upon hearing this, Muchen and Muyue both had a stunned look on their faces, that Uncle Hong who had a cold face but would give them things was going to die?","Hao’er frowned, his cold little face sank, looking towards Seventeen who was standing by the side and asked, “What’s going on?”","“Young Master encountered an ambush on his way back, the guards accompanying him were all killed, the dark guards tried their best to save him, but I heard that the injuries are very serious, the doctor said that he’ll most likely not to live through the night.” Seventeen hurriedly informed him of all he knew.","Hearing this, Hao’er was silent and did not speak, not knowing what he was thinking.","“Oooh ... Big Brother and Xue’er, Xue’er sister have been crying, I, I’m also scared, oooh ...” Boqing sobbed softly.","“Brother Boqing don’t cry, Uncle Hong will be fine.” Yue’er stood on her tiptoes and gently patted his head and said.","“Chen’er, Yue’er.” Hao’er looked at the two of them, “You guys go and keep Bowen and Xue’er company!”","“What about Big Brother?” Muchen looked at him and asked.","Hao’er thought for a moment and said, “I’ll go see Uncle Hong.”","“Good.” Muchen nodded and said to Boqing, “Don’t cry, boys can’t just cry.”","“Seventeen, take them over!” Hao’er looked to Seventeen and ordered.","“Yes.” Seventeen answered, and only then did he take the three younger ones to leave first.","After watching them leave, Hao’er also headed out, only that he was heading towards Pan Hong’s courtyard, but he didn’t expect to meet Pan Ning who was marching over with an entire entourage of doctors when he walked to the front courtyard."]},{"number":4454,"title":"Chapter 4454: To Save or Not to Save","paragraphs":["Chapter 4454: To Save or Not to Save","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Hao’er?”","Pan Ning was a little surprised to see him here, but right now he was in a hurry to save his Big Brother, so didn’t stop as he continued walking forward. He said, “Something has happened in the manor, if there’s anything you need, look for Seventeen first!”","Hao’er followed beside him and said, “I heard that something happened to Uncle Hong, so I thought of coming over to take a look.”","“Big Brother encountered an ambush on his way back, he’s not doing too well, I’m bringing the doctors to treat him now.” Pan Ning said, his feet moving at a hurried pace, while speaking to the dozen or so Doctors who were rushing right behind him, “I’ll trouble you all to walk faster again.”","The Doctors behind them walked hurriedly, their breath panting slightly, a fatter one also sweating a lot, wiping the sweat while gasping for breath, rushing along with the crowd.","Until, after coming to the courtyard, before they could catch their breath, they were invited inside to diagnose, only, one by one, after going in, they all came out shaking their heads.","“Too many injuries, there’re even injuries to the lungs, forgive us for not being able to do anything.” After they gave their diagnosis, they also did not dare to ask for any consultation fees and quickly left.","A dozen or so doctors came fast and left fast. Watching those Doctors leave, Pan Ning even have no strength to stop, he looked at his brother on the bed, stood in a daze, his eyes could not help but red.","Outside, Hao’er listened to the words of the doctors and remained silent for a while, just as he was thinking of walking in, he saw Father Pan hurrying in with two old men, so he stepped aside and watched them go in before following them in.","“I’ve brought two Imperial Physicians with me, quick, please two of you quickly save my eldest son.” Father Pan hurriedly said, pulling the two imperial physicians forward.","“And let us catch our breath first.” The two old men were pulled hurriedly, at this point they were unable to catch their breath, after standing firmly and taking a few breaths, they then looked at the person on the bed.","They were no strangers to Pah Hong, but, at this time looking at the pale Pan Hong who’s was breathing weakly and lying unconscious on the bed, the two Imperial Physicians looked at each othe and let out a sigh in their hearts. With just a glance, they knew that this Young Master was at death’s door.","Even so, the two did not say anything more, just went forward to help him seriously check his pulse.","The Pan family watched with their hearts in their mouths, and because of their nervousness, sweat seeped out of their palms. The city’s top doctors had all come in a wave, but they all said that there was no hope. Now, all they could do was to place all their hope in the two Imperial Physicians, if even they could not help, then ...","Hao’er saw the Old Patriarch was so nervous that his body was trembling, and the others also were extremely nervous. Their eyes were fixated at the two Imperial Physicians bated breaths, their eyes mixed with worry and hope. Seeing this situation, he pursed his lips and narrowed his eyes.","In his memory, Mother had taught him simple medical skills. Not to mention, he had felt from the time he came in that Pan Hong’s breath was extremely weak, and his face was also vaguely already covered with a layer of deathly aura. A mortal’s breath was weak like that, and at any time, he would breath his last and if there were no miraculous elixirs, it was almost certain that he would be a dead man.","As for the matter of life-saving medicinal pills, he had some in his space. It was just that, for a person who has been determined that he could not live by so many experts in the field, if he recovered from the medicinal pills given by him, then there must be a lot of trouble and mess that would entail.","Moreover, if they learnt that he had medicinal pills that could save their lives, there was no guarantee that greed would not arise in their hearts.","But, the Pan Family had been kind to the three of them, if he didn’t save them and watched Pan Hong die, it seemed that he shouldn’t, in both reason and sentiment."]},{"number":4455,"title":"Chapter 4455: Needs to be treated","paragraphs":["Chapter 4455: Needs to be treated","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","No one in the room made a single sound due to the Imperial Physician’s examination, until, the two Imperial Physicians withdrew their hands and looked at them and shook their heads, “There are a total of twenty-seven injuries on the Young Master’s body, the most serious of which was stabbed by a sword to the lungs and internal organs, and now he’s just holding on with his last breath and he won’t be able to make it through tonight, so you might as well prepare for the funeral!”","They let out a sigh and shook their heads as they were about to head out, when one of the old Imperial Physicians’ legs was hugged by Pan Hong’s wife.","“No, my Husband won’t die, please, please save him! He won’t die, he won’t leave us behind, please, please, please save him ...” She cried and begged, refusing to let go and let them leave.","In her opinion, if even they left, then there would really be no one to save her Husband.","That voice begging sad and mournful, even the two Imperial Physicians, could not help but be saddened as well. Pan Hong was in his prime and deeply valued by His Majesty. Seeing that such a tragedy had happened to him, they felt regretful.","“Madam, I’m sorry for your loss!” They said helplessly, watching the woman cry her eyes out and fainted.","“Sister-in-law!”","“Sister-in-law!”","Pan Ning and his wife quickly went forward to support her.","The Imperial Physician quickly went forward to take a look and said, “Excessive grief, please send her back to rest! We’ll take our leave first.” The two of them said, before heading out. They still had to report Pan Hong’s situation to His Majesty.","The Old Patriarch’s body swayed for a moment, his face as pale as paper, and when he saw that he was about to fall, he was supported by Hao’er next to him.","Father Pan, on the other hand, sat in a daze on the chair, his entire body seeming to have aged ten years in an instant.","“Madam, send your sister-in-law back and take good care of her.” Pan Ning forced himself to pull himself together and asked his wife to send her away first, and only after seeing them leave did he then take a deep breath and look at his elder brother on the bed with grief in his eyes.","The Old Patriarch, supported by Hao’er, tremblingly came to the bedside, looking at his dying grandson with only one breath left, his old tears could not help but fall, his voice choked with sobs, “To send off a younger generation, why is it not me that is lying here ...”","Unable to withstand the impact of this grief, the old man who had been holding on strongly for a long time finally couldn’t hold on and fell backwards, his body was convulsing and his mouth was slightly crooked, saliva flowed out from the corners of his mouth, startling the Pan family’s father and son as they both jolted forward.","“Grandfather!”","“Father!”","Both Father Pan and Pan Ning quickly stepped forward to support him, fearing that something would happen to him, His Father hurriedly said, “Quickly send your Grandfather back, let the doctor give him a good look, your Big Brother is already like this, in our house, we can’t afford to have anyone else fall down.”","Hao’er watched as the room was in chaos with the collapse of Old Patriarch, he withdrew his gaze, his hand moved, and a medicinal pill held between his two fingers was stuffed into the mouth of Pan Hong who was dying on the bed.","His movements were extremely fast, almost in a single breath, no one even noticed that he had stuffed the medicinal pill into Pan Hong’s mouth.","With the Old Patriarch was sent back to the courtyard, the compartment was quiet again, His Father turned to come in, heavy steps to the bedside, looking at his dying son, finally could not help but cover his face and cried in a low voice.","Hao’er stood next to him, not comforting, not leaving, just standing quietly, after he cried a lot, he then opened his mouth and said, “Grandfather Pan, the injuries on Uncle Hong ‘s body need to be treated.”"]},{"number":4456,"title":"Chapter 4456: Won’t Die","paragraphs":["Chapter 4456: Won’t Die","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Father Pan heard his words, he thought of the injuries on Pan Hong’s body, then he wiped his tears and said, “Yes, you are right. The doctors all said that he won’t live, they just treated his wounds simply. Well, even if he won’t live, I still have to let him leave in a dignified manner.”","Hao’er was helping out at the side, he had someone fetch a basin of water to help clean the wound again, and when he saw Father Pan take out the medicine and was about to apply some on Pan Hong, he rushed to hand the prepared medicine forward.","“Grandfather Pan, use this wound medicine of mine! This medicine is very good for external wounds.” Hao’er said, handing him the medicine bottle.","Father Pan glanced at him and nodded, and without saying anything more, he earnestly helped Pan Hong apply the medicine and bandage all the wounds on his body.","Hao’er frowned slightly as he looked at Pan Hong’s severed hamstrings. He could take out a medicinal pill and give it to him to repair his internal injuries , and he could also take out a trauma medicine to treat his shocking wounds, but he couldn’t help him with the severed hamstrings.","If his Mother was here, he thought, there must be a way, but it was a pity that both his parents were nowhere to be found.","“Father.” Pan Ning walked in, looking at his father who was sitting on the side of the bed with a sad face, as well as Hao’er who was standing on the side, he paused slightly in his footsteps before heading inside.","“Father, I’ll guard Big Brother here!” He was really worried that he too would not be able to withstand the shock and collapse.","“No, I’m going to stand guard here.” Father Pan shook his head, unwilling to leave.","Seeing this, Pan Ning sighed softly in his heart and said to Hao’er, “Hao’er, you go back first!”","“Mm.” Hao’er answered, glancing at Pan Hong on the bed before turning to walk outside.","Hao’er did not go directly back to the courtyard, but went to Bowen’s side, and as soon as he entered the courtyard, he saw Muchen and Muyue accompanying Bowen, Boqing, and Xue’er sitting around the stone table, while Seventeen stood on the side.","“Big Brother!” When Yue’er saw him, she hurriedly ran to his side, tilting her little head in worry, she asked, “Big Brother, how is Uncle Hong? Is he better?”","Hao’er looked at his sister beside him and couldn’t help but reveal a doting smile, he reached out and touched her little head, saying, “Don’t worry, Uncle Hong will be fine, he’s just too tired and slept for a while.”","Hearing these words, Yue’er’s eyes lit up, revealing a joyful smile, “That’s good, then brother Bowen and Sister Xue’er won’t be without Father.”","On the side, Seventeen sighed in his heart as he listened to Hao’er’s words. They were still young, they don’t understand how much pain such an injury was. Another secret guard told him that even the Imperial Physicians who came had said that there was no hope for their Young Master, moreover, he won’t be able to make it through this night.","“Brother Bowen, Sister Xue’er, don’t worry, my Big Brother has said that Uncle Hong will be fine, he’s just tired, he’ll be fine after a nap.” Yue’er said as she looked at them with a smile.","Xue’er’s red and swollen eyes from crying carried a glimmer of hope, while Bowen hung his head low and did not speak.","Because of this, the adults in the house also fell one after another, so Hao’er three stayed here to accompany the several children of the Pan family until, at night, Hao’er three went back to the South Courtyard.","Returning to the South Courtyard, closing the door to the room, the two little ones sat on the bed and looked at their Big Brother, Muchen lowered his voice and asked, “Big Brother, did you give medicine to Uncle Hong to eat? He can survive right?”"]},{"number":4457,"title":"Chapter 4457: Not A Peaceful Night","paragraphs":["Chapter 4457: Not A Peaceful Night","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Mm Hmm.” Hao’er answered and continued on, “Their family has also been kind to us, and there are medicines in the space that can save his life, so I quietly fed him one.”","Hao’er said, and then added: “However, his hamstrings have both been severed, so I’m afraid that after he gets better, his legs will be ruined.”","“Didn’t Big Brother say that Mother’s medical skills are very good? In the future, when we find Father and Mother, wouldn’t it be better to let Mother help Uncle Hong Hong heal?” Yue’er blinked her pair of beautiful eyes and asked, her little face full of innocence.","“If Mother was here, his injuries wouldn’t be a big problem, only, Mother isn’t here now, and it’s hard to say what will happen in the future.”","Hao’er said, looking at the two of them looking at him, he then said, “However, to be able to survive is already considered good, he had already been said to be bound to die by those Imperial Physicians and doctors, now that he can save his life and live, even if he can’t stand up, it shouldn’t matter much.”","Compared to death, at least, he kept his life alive, in his opinion, this would already be considered a fluke.","“Great Grandfather Pan couldn’t take the blow and collapsed, so I guess he won’t be able to teach the class during this period of time, sothe two if you will have to start studying on your own from tomorrow onwards, and if you encounter anything that you don’t understand, ask me.” Hao’er said with a serious little face.","“Mm hmm.” The two younger ones nodded and responded in a well-behaved and obedient manner.","This night was difficult for the people of the Pan family, apart from the collapsed Old Patriarch and the Pan Hong’s wife, the rest of the Pan family, along with a few children were all gathered in Pan Hong’s room.","The reason for calling Bowen and Xue’er here was because, for fear that they wouldn’t be able to see their father for the last time.","The two children stood in front of the bed, their small hands holding their Father’s big hand, not daring to cry, not daring to make noise, just kept looking at him. In their hearts, they all hoped that their Father was just as Hao’er had said, just tired before falling asleep, and that when the day dawned tomorrow, perhaps he would wake up.","All the forces in the Imperial Capital have heard about what happened to the Pan family, and know that the Young Master Pan Hong was ambushed on his way back, and was so badly injured that even the Imperial Physicians invited have both said he won’t live through the night.","On the one hand, they are shocked that there were some people who have started on the Young Master of the Pan family, on the other hand, they feel sorry for Pan Hong, such a brilliant character to die so young, it was really saddening.","In the Palace, the Imperial Physicians reported the situation in detail to the Emperor and also said similar that Pan Hong would not live through tonight. Hearing this, he was extremely angry and ordered to dig out the people behind this. Later in the night, he personally came out, followed by a dozen guards and came to the Pan family.","“Patriarch, Young Master, His Majesty is here!” The Steward came swiftly to the courtyard to report.","Hearing this, both Pan Ning and his Father both quickly walked outside to meet him, and as soon as they were outside, they saw a middle-aged man coming with a steady pace, followed by a dozen guards.","“Your subordinate greets Your Majesty.” Both father and son stepped forward and knelt on one knee.","“No need to be polite.” The Emperor went forward to help Father Pan, looking at Father Pan who had aged ten years overnight, he couldn’t help but let out a light sigh and said, “I am here to see Pan Hong.”","“We are humbled by your presence, thank you, Your Majesty.” Father Pan said while he led him in.","When he came to the inner room and saw Pan Hong’s pair of son and daughter standing by the bedside with tearful eyes, his footsteps paused. He did not step forward any further and just stood three metres away from the edge of the bed and watched.","They saw him looking at the two children guarding the bedside, eyes showing pity, and could not help but hang their heads low with depression."]},{"number":4458,"title":"Chapter 4458: Incredible","paragraphs":["Chapter 4458: Incredible","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","After a long while, he took his first step and came to the bedside. After taking a look at the person in the bed, he shifted his gaze to the two children.","“What are your names?” the emperor asked, looking at the two children.","“Your Majesty, my name is Pan Bowen,” the child replied with red eyes.","“My name is Pan Xue’er,” Pan Xue’er timidly said when she saw her brother speak.","Upon hearing this, the Emperor nodded and patted the children on the head, saying, “I will catch the person who harmed your Father.” He thought to himself that he would have to think about how to compensate the Pan family and these two children when he got back. After all, Pan Hong had left home on a long journey by his orders, and this journey had caused his death. It was estimated that it was also related to the matter of his trip.","He did not linger long at the Pan family’s home. After offering a few words of comfort, he quietly left. After all, for someone in his position, it was already not easy to risk his life by going out at night.","After seeing the Emperor off, the Pan family father and son continued to keep watch in the side room. However, after midnight, the two children fell asleep on the edge of the bed. Pan Ning ordered someone to take the children back to rest, and suddenly noticed that his brother, who had been pale, seemed to be gradually breathing more steadily.","He was startled, his heart tightened, and he was afraid it was his own illusion. He quickly walked out into the room and took his father’s hand. “Father, Father, Big Brother...” Before he could finish speaking, his father, who had been sitting in a dazewith sad, vacant eyes, suddenly stood up and interrupted him.","“Did...did Big Brother go?” He asked, his voice trembling, tears welling up in his eyes.","“No, no, Father, come and see, Big Brother’s breathing seems to have stabilised a little, come and have a look.” Pan Ning said, his face aglow with emotion, as he pulled his Father to the bed .","When Father Pan went over to take a look, he couldn’t help but be stunned at the sight, and then he was so excited that he couldn’t speak: “This, this, this... doctor! Hurry! Go get the doctor!”","That night, the lights in the courtyard stayed on until dawn...","When Pan Hong’s wife woke up at dawn, she looked outside at the sky. She sat there in a daze, her expression sad. The next moment, she covered her face and wept bitterly.","When Pan Ning’s wife came in and saw her crying, she hurried over and said, “Sister-in-law, what’s wrong with you?”","“Qiuyi, I didn’t even get to see his last face, I... I... ohhh...” She covered her face and wept bitterly, her cries saddening and heartbreaking.","Upon hearing this, the second wife hurriedly said, “Sister-in-law, don’t cry yet, your husband is fine, he’s still alive!”","“What?” Upon hearing this, the first wife, who had been crying with her face covered, stopped crying and stood up excitedly, grabbing her hand and trembling as she asked, “What did you say? Is my husband... is he still alive?”","She quickly told her what had happened last night. As soon as she finished speaking, she saw her cry and laugh at the same time as she hurriedly put on her outer robes and ran outside.","At that moment, several doctors were in the room taking Pan Hong’s pulse. When they felt the strong pulse, they widened their eyes in surprise as if they had seen a ghost, with disbelief written all over their faces. They muttered, ‘this is a miracle, a true miracle! He survived despite being injured like this? This is simply unbelievable!”","Father Pan and Pan Ning listened with excitement on their faces. Pan Ning asked again with a worried heart, “Doctor, is my Big Brother really alright? Did he really survive?”","“He survived, he really survived.” The old doctor who spoke had a look of surprise and joy on his face. He said, “I have been practicing medicine for so many years, and I have never seen anyone survive an injury like this. It really is incredible!”"]},{"number":4459,"title":"Chapter 4459: Words spread","paragraphs":["Chapter 4459: Words spread","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Yes! I have never seen anyone survive an injury like that either. With an injury like that, there is no way they could have survived. Yesterday when we left, it was clear that he was hanging on by a thread, but now, his pulse is strong and his overall condition has recovered. It’s truly incredible!”","“If I hadn’t seen it with my own eyes, I wouldn’t have believed it was real!” Another doctor said in excitement.","A senior doctor who had not spoken up until now stroked his beard, withdrew his hand from the patient’s wrist, looked at the father and son, and asked, “Yesterday’s injuries were so severe, but today he has almost recovered. May I ask, Old Patriarch Pan, Young Master Pan, what miraculous medicine you have given him?”","Father Pan was taken aback and shook his head: “What kind of magic medicine do we have? Even the Imperial Physicians came yesterday, and be it you or the Imperial Physicians who had diagnosed him just left without even prescribing any medicine. Where can I find any medicine to feed him with?”","Yesterday, they all said that he would not survive, and no one even prescribed any medicine. Even the wounds on his body were only treated briefly. It was only later that he cleaned and re-applied the medicine himself. And from the time of the accident yesterday until now, he has been guarding in this room, and no one has ever given him any medicine.","“That’s strange. The Young Master’s internal injuries healed overnight. This doesn’t seem like self-healing. However, if there is any medicinal pill that can heal the Young Master’s injuries, after practicing medicine for so many years, I have never heard of such a thing. If there is, it can only be that legendary immortal medicinal pill.”","He seemed to be muttering to himself, but unexpectedly, when Pan Ning heard this, his heart trembled. His eyes narrowed as if he had thought of something.","He lowered his eyes, took a deep breath, then looked up again and sighed. “Yesterday, my father and I stayed here together. If there was any magic medicine, we wouldn’t have started preparing for my Big Brother’s funeral yesterday.”","Hearing this, several doctors also nodded in secret. They knew this as well. Last night, everyone in the Pan family began to prepare for the funeral, but unexpectedly, in the middle of the night, Pan Hong’s condition gradually improved.","“If there is, it is also because of the deep blessings of His Majesty and the protection of the true dragon’s aura that allowed my Big Brother to escape death and survive.” When he said this, Pan Ning’s face was filled with gratitude and awe, and he respectfully bowed in the direction of the Palace.","Upon hearing this, the doctors were taken aback and asked cautiously, “Could it be that His Majesty came by last night?”","“Yes, apart from the people in my family, His Majesty also came to see my Big Brother last night. Shortly after His Majesty left, my Big Brother’s breathing gradually stabilised. I think this must be the grace of His Majesty’s protection,” said Pan Ning, his face full of emotion.","The doctors looked at each other, a little surprised and uncertain, but in the end they all felt that perhaps it really was the case. Otherwise, how could it be explained?","Pan Ning spoke with emotion and a look of gratitude on his face, and even Father Pan believed seven parts of it. He kept saying, “Once Hong’er recovers, we must go to the Emperor to thank him for his great kindness.”","After the doctors had prescribed the medicine, the servants escorted the doctors out. However, within half a day, a piece of good news spread outside: Pan Hong, the eldest son of the Pan family, who was said by the doctors to have died the previous night, had actually survived!","As the news spread, the Emperor visited the Pan family at night, and the legend that the blessings of the Emperor had saved Young Master Pan, who had taken a step into death’s gate, also began to spread.","When the news reached the Palace, even the Emperor himself was stunned."]},{"number":4460,"title":"Chapter 4460: Thoughts","paragraphs":["Chapter 4460: Thoughts","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“So, Pan Hong survived?” The Emperor asked, looking at the people below.","“Your Majesty, according to reports, he survived. The city’s doctors went to see him and his pulse is stable. However, I heard that his hamstrings have been severed, so even if he survives, I’m afraid he’ll never be able to stand again.”","Upon hearing this, the Emperor was silent for a moment, and then said, “Have the Imperial Physicians go to the Pan Manor again and see for themselves. No matter what, they must heal his injuries.”","“Yes,” the man below replied, bowing before stepping down.","After a while, the Emperor looked at the old man hidden in the shadows and asked, “What do you think is going on? Last night, when I went to see Pan Hong, I clearly saw that his breathing was very weak and he really looked like he was going to die. But today, I heard that he survived?”","The old man walked out from the shadows, his hands folded in front of him, his body leaning slightly forward. He said respectfully, “The city’s doctors and the Imperial Physicians in the Palace all came to the same diagnosis. Moreover, the injuries affected the lungs and they could not be healed with ordinary medicine. Now that Pan Hong has survived, it is evident that after Your Majesty left, he must have taken some immortal medicine that preserved his life.”","“Immortal medicine?”","The Emperor was momentarily taken aback and looked at him, hesitatingly saying, “In this world, is there really immortal medicine?” He didn’t believe in the rumours that circulated outside, that he was protected by the true dragon. He had only went there briefly last night, and even if there really was some true dragon protecting him, it wouldn’t protect Pan Hong.","The old man’s gaze flickered slightly, as if he had remembered something. He said slowly, “In this world, there are immortals, and naturally there are also immortal medicines. However, unless we have great good fortune, even if an immortal appeared before us, we would not recognise their true form.”","“Oh?”","Hearing him say this, he became interested and asked, “Could it be that you have seen one? Is such immortals really as powerful as legend has it? Can they fly through the air, move mountains and overturn the sea, and never die?”","The old man smiled and said, “I dare not hide it from Your Majesty, when I was four or five years old, I saw an immortal in white flying on a sword. I still vividly remember it till today.”","“Are there really immortals in this world?” The Emperor’s eyes widened with excitement, unable to hide his emotions. “Where did you meet the immortal? Why have you never mentioned such a matter before?”","No one knew how excited and expectant the Emperor felt that day. Hearing the story of immortals for the first time, and having a trusted person confirm the existence of immortals in this world with his own mouth, his heart could not help but race.","Immortals! They were a presence that cannot be compared to imperial power. Even though he is the supreme ruler of the empire, his lifespan was only a hundred years. He may not even live to be a hundred years old. After all, ordinary people rarely live past sixty or seventy, let alone a hundred years.","He was in a high position, with power and influence in his hands, and naturally hoped that he could live an endless life, as long as the heavens. If there were immortals to help him, or if they could give him a medicinal pill that could increase his lifespan, then...","Thinking of this, his heart suddenly became agitated, and a thought formed vaguely in his mind...","On the other side, in the Pan family.","As Pan Hong’s condition had stabilised, the Pan family was also relieved. After all, for them, Pan Hong being alive was better than anything else.","After arranging the affairs of the household, Pan Ning returned to the courtyard to rest, while thinking about whether or not to talk to Hao’er about this matter."]},{"number":4461,"title":"Chapter 4461: He knows it in his heart","paragraphs":["Chapter 4461: He knows it in his heart","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","He knows that his Big Brother will survive this time, and that Hao’er must have saved him. Those three children were no ordinary children. Even if they didn’t say anything, he could guess it. After all, a person who has been pronounced dead by both doctors and Imperial Physicians has survived overnight, and his internal injuries have almost completely healed. No one else knows what’s going on, but he does.","He just didn’t expect that the three children had such great abilities, and even less did he expect that they would be willing to risk being discovered to save his Big Brother.","He was grateful in his heart, but at this time he was torn between whether or not to go find the three children to say thank you. If he didn’t go, he always felt like he owed them a thank you. If he went, he thought about how Hao’er hadn’t told him about it either, which obviously meant that he didn’t want him to know. If he went, wouldn’t that be...","He hesitated between going and not going, but he couldn’t tell anyone else, so he let out a sigh.","Fine, since they don’t want him to know, he’ll pretend he doesn’t know, and keep this life-saving kindness in his heart for now, and repay it later if he gets the chance!","After freshening up in the courtyard and taking a break, Pan Ning went to the South Courtyard.","Standing outside the South Courtyard, he saw the two Young Masters practising martial arts seriously inside, while Hao’er was giving instructions nearby. His eyes sparkled.","“Young Master Hao, Second Young Master is here,” Seventeen immediately reported.","“Uncle Ning~” Yue’er gave him a bright smile and winked at him as she trotted over. “Uncle Ning, is Uncle Hong going to be alright?”","Ning smiled and said, “Yes, the doctor said that there is no longer a need to worry about his life.” He looked at Hao’er and said, “It is estimated that the Old Patriarch will not be able to teach you for a while. He suffered a blow and collapsed, but he is already much better today. The doctor said he needs to rest for a while.”","“Mm,” Hao’er responded.","“Uncle Ning, my Big Brother will teach us. It’s alright. Let Great Grandfather rest and recuperate, and teach us calligraphy again when he’s better,” Yue’er said with a smile.","“Alright, if you have any questions or need anything, just let me know,” said Pan Ning, before leaving first after giving them a few reminders.","After he left, Seventeen also retreated and guarded outside the courtyard. Inside, Muchen looked at his Big Brother and asked, “Does he know?”","Yue’er, who was standing nearby, blinked as she watched them and listened quietly.","Hao’er paused for a moment and said, “No matter if he knows or not, that’s it!” He knew full well that he didn’t necessarily have to say it out loud.","“Keep practicing,” Hao’er said as he looked at the two of them and continued, “We’ll go through the entire set of boxing techniques today, and I want to check it tomorrow.” After giving the two of them their instructions, he also gave Seventeen a shout before heading back to his room first to prepare for his cultivation in his room.","The two little guys nodded in agreement and obediently began their practice.","Not long after Pan Ning left, Boqing, Bowen, and Xue’er headed towards the South Courtyard. Bowen and Xue’er in particular were very happy today, knowing that their Father would not die.","“We’ll tell Yue’er and the others the good news, and they’ll be very happy too,” Boqing said with a grin, adding, “Today, my mother told me that after Great Grandfather learned that my uncle was fine, his health improved as well.”","The three of them walked and talked as they made their way to the South Courtyard. Just as they were about to go in, they were stopped by Seventeen.","Seventeen glanced at the two little guys practicing kung fu in the courtyard and said, “Master Hao’er instructed that they are not be disturbed today.”"]},{"number":4462,"title":"Chapter 4462: Different","paragraphs":["Chapter 4462: Different","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Ah? Why? We have good news for them,” Boqing lamented, poking his head forward, trying to take a look inside, but he couldn’t take a single step further.","The three Hao’ers had been living in the Pan family for a few months, and Bowen also knew the rules of the South Courtyard, so he said, “In that case, we won’t go in, we’ll come back later.”","“But we’ve already come here, so we can’t just leave like this, can we?” Boqing rolled his eyes, suddenly shouted loudly with a hoarse throat, “Yue’er, we’ve come to find you, Seventeen won’t let us in, you come out quickly.”","The two little guys practicing boxing heard the voice and glanced at each other. Yue’er said, “Brother, it’s Boqing and the others.”","Muchen paused for a moment, thinking that Big Brother was practising in his room and that shouting like that was not going to help. So he said, “Go and take a look, and make sure he doesn’t disturb Big Brother.”","“Alright,” Yue’er nodded, and followed him out into the courtyard.","Since they didn’t have their parents around, they had to do a lot of things themselves, and with their Big Brother teaching them, the two of them, despite their young age, were quite well-behaved and didn’t act up like ordinary children.","When they got outside, Muchen glanced at Boqing and said, “Stop shouting, it’s so noisy.”","Boqing grinned and ignored him, saying happily, “I’m telling you, my Uncle isn’t going to die. The doctor said he’s not going to die.”","“We know,” Muchen said.","“Huh? How do you know?” Boqing asked in surprise.","Yue’er said with a smile, “Uncle Ning was just here, and he told us.” Yue’er then looked at Boqing and said in a serious tone, “Boqing, next time you can’t shout outside the courtyard, it will disturb my Big Brother.”","Boqing felt a little embarrassed when she said this and quickly promised, “I, I won’t do it again. It’s just that Seventeen has been guarding the courtyard and won’t let us in.”","Yue’er looked at him with a smile and said, “Because my Big Brother told Seventeen to guard the courtyard and not let anyone in! Big Brother doesn’t like to be disturbed, he’ll get angry.”","“Alright, I understand, I won’t do it again!” He promised again.","Bowen, who was standing nearby, looked at the two of them and said, “Great Grandfather needs to recuperate, so he can’t teach us for a while. Do you want to study with us?”","“No, we’ll just study on our own in the South Courtyard,” said Muchen.","“Alright, we’ll go then,” said Bowen, taking Xue’er’s hand and walking away.","“Yue’er, I’ll come find you tomorrow!” Xue’er said, turning around, waving her hand, and following her older brother away.","“I’ll go too,” said Boqing, skipping away.","After watching them leave, Muchen said, “Sister, let’s go back.” He took her hand and walked towards the courtyard. They were different from them. They must practice hard to find the way back and to find their Father and Mother.","“Mmm,” Yue’er agreed, obediently going back to continue practising her boxing.","Seventeen watched Bowen and the others leave, and then looked at the two children heading towards the courtyard. His gaze couldn’t help but flicker, and he wondered to himself: Could it be that the children of immortals were all so understanding? At such a young age, they already know how to arrange their own time to practise. If they were other children, at this age they would still be hanging in their parents’ arms asking for cuddles!"]},{"number":4463,"title":"Chapter 4463: The traces of immortals are hard to find","paragraphs":["Chapter 4463: The traces of immortals are hard to find","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","As the days passed in the Pan family, the three children continued to practise on their own in earnest. During this period, the three of them went to visit Pan Hong a few times, watching his body recover day by day, the only thing was that he could no longer stand up on his feet.","On this day, Pan Ning returned from outside and went straight to the South Courtyard to find the three Hao’ers.","Today, I learned that His Majesty has issued an imperial decree to search for traces of immortals. The decree has already been distributed to towns and villages everywhere. I heard that it was because an old man close to His Majesty once saw an immortal flying on a sword when he was young, so His Majesty was moved and has embarked on his search for immortals.”","As Pan Ning spoke, he looked at the calm, unruffled faces of the three children. After a pause, he said, “There’s one more thing. His Majesty summoned me today and specifically asked if I had given Big Brother any immortal medicine.”","Seeing the three children, he hurriedly said, “I told him that I hadn’t used any immortal medicine, but I think he was a little suspicious. I think there must be something going on if my Big Brother is still alive despite his serious injuries.”","However, Hao’er didn’t say anything about this, but just asked, “If he issues an imperial decree to search for immortals, will he be able to find the traces of the cultivators?”","Pan Ning shook his head and said, “It’s hard to say. After all, if immortals don’t display their immortal arts, they look no different from ordinary people. People like us simply can’t tell if the other person is an immortal.”","“Well, you’re right that you can’t tell,” Hao’er nodded, agreeing with this. After all, if someone isn’t an immortal cultivator, they naturally won’t be able to sense the spirit energy of an immortal cultivator.","“But don’t worry, if there’s any news, I’ll be the first to let you know,” Pan Ning said, looking at the three of them.","“Thank you, Uncle Ning~” Yue’er said with a smile.","Ning smiled and said, “You’re welcome.” He didn’t disturb them either, and after delivering the news, he left first.","Once the news of the Emperor’s search for immortals spread, it could be said that the whole country was shaken. Many people were discussing whether immortals really existed in this world, and what they looked like.","In that remote and isolated village, the old village chief, a man who had heard the news, sat in the doorway smoking a water pipe. The two men glanced at each other, but couldn’t help but think of the scene from a few months ago and the three children.","His Majesty was seeking immortals. It has spread that if there is news of immortals, there will be a heavy reward. However, even if they hear that there will be a heavy reward, the two men dare not reveal a single bit of what happened that day.","It was an immortal! And one had saved them! Even though the three were still so young, they dared not casually reveal what had happened. They had been fortunate enough to meet an immortal in their lifetime, and that was something they would keep to themselves forever...","As the days passed, some people became greedy and said that they had seen traces of immortals in the deep mountains and forests. However, the Emperor sent someone to search for traces but found none. After ascertaining that it was someone who had a greedy heart, he immediately ordered the person to be killed. For a time, those who had greedy thoughts and wanted to take a chance stopped thinking.","In the blink of an eye, a year passed. In another world, Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu, who were searching for their three children, had travelled to many places over the past year or so, but still had not found any trace of them.","One day, the two entered the city and, as they looked at a three or four year old girl in front of a small stall in the city, Feng Jiu’s eyes flickered slightly and she muttered, “Yue’er should be this tall by now, right?”"]},{"number":4464,"title":"Chapter 4464: Encountering an old friend","paragraphs":["Chapter 4464: Encountering an old friend","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","As she murmured, Xuanyuan Mo Ze followed her gaze. When his deep gaze fell on the little girl, his expression also carried a hint of trance.","It’s been more than a year, and the two children will soon be four years old.","He gathered his thoughts and, embracing Feng Jiu beside him, said, “We’ve looked for quite a few regions and towns over the past year and four months. Perhaps the children aren’t far from us.”","“Well, the two younger ones are almost four years old, and Hao’er is almost ten. I just don’t know what they’ve become like these days. How much have they grown? Have they improved in cultivation? Have they thought of us?” Feng Jiu said softly, feeling an indescribable sense of loss.","“Let’s find an inn and rest for a while! I’ll go around the city and ask around to see if there’s any news of them here,” said Xuanyuan Mo Ze, taking her hand and walking together to the inn in front of them.","When they arrived at the inn and a room was booked for two people, they were about to go upstairs when a surprised voice suddenly came.","“Feng Jiu?”","Hearing the voice, Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu both stopped and looked back. At this glance, the two of them couldn’t help but blink slightly.","“Murong Yixuan? Why are you here?”","Feng Jiu asked, looking at the man sitting at the corner table drinking. That man was precisely her former fiancé, Murong Yixuan, whom she had not seen for a long time, and had even almost forgotten about in her memories.","Murong Yixuan was wearing a green robe, his hair loose and half covering his outstanding face. He had a beard at the chin, which made him look less ethereal and more casual and carefree.","Compared to a few years ago, he has changed a lot. If he hadn’t called out to Feng Jiu, they probably wouldn’t have noticed him in the corner.","Murong Yixuan walked over, his gaze sweeping over Xuanyuan Mo Ze and landing on Feng Jiu. Looking at the still unchanged face, his eyes flickered slightly, and he smiled, “I didn’t expect to meet you here. Why don’t we sit down and have a drink?”","Feng Jiu looked at Xuanyuan Mo Ze, who nodded, and they went to sit together at the table in the corner.","After watching the two sit down, Murong Yixuan sat down as well, poured them each a glass of wine, and said, “I travelled around before arriving here. After all, people like me have no fixed abode, and it’s good to wander around and see the local customs.”","He smiled, took a sip of wine, looked at the two men, and asked, “What about you? Why did you come to a place like this?”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze lifted his wine glass and drank without saying a word.","Feng Jiu, on the other hand, paused for a moment and said, “We came out to look for our children.”","“Looking for your children?” Murong Yixuan, who was drinking, was slightly startled and looked at her, asking, “What do you mean?”","“Our children are missing, so we’re out looking for them,” Feng Jiu said slowly, and before he could ask, she continued, “They were sent away by the Devil Lord using an ancient blood curse during a fight with him. We don’t know where they are, so we’re out looking for them.”","Murong Yixuan paused for a moment and said, “I have been wandering outside for too long, and I haven’t gone back for a long time. I don’t know anything about what happened over there. Why don’t you tell me about it? What happened to the Devil Lord? Has the ancient black lotus been destroyed?”","There was nothing to be afraid of, so Feng Jiu told him everything.","After learning the whole story, Murong Yixuan understood and could only reply wryly, “I see.”"]},{"number":4465,"title":"Chapter 4465: Ghost Cultivator","paragraphs":["Chapter 4465: Ghost Cultivator","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Seeing that he had said everything and had had his drink, Xuanyuan Mo Ze stood up and said, “Ah Jiu, go and rest for a while!”","“Alright,” Feng Jiu stood up and said to Murong Yixuan, “We’re going to go ahead and rest.”","Murong Yixuan also stood up, nodded, and watched them go upstairs before continuing to sit down and drink. He didn’t expect to meet Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu here, and even less did he expect that after he left that familiar region and travelled around, so many things would happen again.","Did she lose her children?","He drank his wine, thinking to himself, I have travelled around a lot over the years, and there are some other powerful realms and heavens that I couldn’t go to with his strength, but there are some smaller realms and heavens that he could come and go freely.","A thought rose in his heart, and he finished the wine in his cup, he paid the bill and then got up to leave.","In the room on the second floor, Feng Jiu took off her outer robes, rubbed her neck, walked over to the table and sat down. She said, “This Murong Yixuan has really changed a lot over the past few years. If I hadn’t seen it with my own eyes, I would never have thought that he was the same person as before.”","Xuanyuan Mo Ze poured her a glass of water and said, “There’s no need to try to understand unrelated people. So there’s no need to worry about it. You rest for a while. I’ll ask the waiter to prepare some hot water for you. You can take a hot bath and then go to sleep.”","“You’re going out again?” Feng Jiu asked, looking at him.","“I’m going to take a walk around town and pay a visit to the City Lord’s Manor.”","The world was so big that they can’t possibly search every single place, and even if they were in a town, they couldn’t go from house to house. So, whenever they arrived somewhere, they would take a stroll around and say hello to the local City Lord or influential people, to get their attention.","“It’s getting late, why don’t you take a break? We’ll go out again tomorrow,” Feng Jiu said, not wanting him to get too tired. There was no one else around, and he did everything himself, which made him both mentally and physically tired.","“It’s fine, you rest first, I’ll be back in a bit, it won’t take long,” Xuanyuan Mo Ze said, and then he heard the sound of the waiter knocking on the door outside.","“Guest, the water is here.”","“Come in!” Xuanyuan Mo Ze said.","The waiter carried the water in and placed it in the corner of the inner room where he washed himself. After filling it up, he retreated.","“The water is ready. Go take a bath and relax. I’ll be back in a bit,” Xuanyuan Mo Ze said, indicating for her to go take a bath first.","“Alright, then don’t be too long,” Feng Jiu said softly, and after seeing him out of the room, she locked the door and went into the inner room to take a bath.","Xuanyuan Mo Ze went for a walk around the city alone. Here, he didn’t sense any familiar auras. After all, the child had something of theirs on it. Even if the connection was severed, as long as it was within a certain distance, he could sense their presence.","After asking for the direction of the City Lord’s Manor, he was thinking about going there when he glanced into an alley and saw Murong Yixuan, whom he had just met not long ago, cornered and surrounded.","He raised an eyebrow and glanced at the people surrounding Murong Yixuan. No, those couldn’t be considered people, they should be ghost cultivators. There were more than ten ghost cultivators, wearing conical hats on their heads and black cloaks on their bodies. The cold air filled the alley, almost blocking it off, and the yin energy formed a barrier, preventing Murong Yixuan from having a chance to escape."]},{"number":4466,"title":"Chapter 4466: Worried","paragraphs":["Chapter 4466: Worried","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Ghost cultivators who can cultivate entities and even dare to go out in the daytime, their strength was considered pretty powerful. He started to wonder, how can there be so many ghost cultivators in this place? And it looks like they were specifically rushing towards Murong Yixuan?","He watched in the dark for a while, the condensed Yin Energy blocked the breath of the fight inside, even if that alley was only ten or so metres away from the street. At this time, the people outside the street didn’t know what was happening inside that alley.","Seeing that Murong Yixuan alone had to deal with more than a dozen ghost cultivators, he did not step forward to help. Instead, with the identity of a spectator, he watched on. After all, this Murong Yixuan’s strength was not weak, more than a dozen ghost cultivators were powerful, but not enough to take his life.","After about the time it took for a stick of incense to burn, after the death of the dozen ghost cultivators, the boundary broke open. Murong Yixuan who had obviously been through a battle with tattered robes and injuries all over walked out. He sensed something and looked towards a certain area but did not see anything.","He paused for a moment, then turned around and left.","After he left, Xuanyuan Mo Ze walked out from the shadows, and after watching him leave, he also headed in the direction of the City Lord’s Manor.","In the evening, when Xuanyuan Mo Ze returned to the inn, Feng Jiu had already fallen asleep, but then opened her eyes after hearing his return.","“You’re back?” Feng Jiu asked, her voice lazy, filled with sleepiness.","“Yeah, I’m back.” Xuanyuan Mo Ze answered and said, “I went out for a stroll today and found that this tiny place is not peaceful either.”","“Oh? What did you encounter?” Feng Jiu asked, sitting up from the bed.","“Well, I saw a dozen or so ghost cultivators who dared to go out in the daytime, all of them were not weak, however, in the end, they were all killed by Murong Yixuan.” He poured a cup of water and drank it, as he told her what he had encountered earlier in the day.","Hearing this, Feng Jiu was slightly surprised, “How did he provoke those ghost cultivators? Ghost cultivators who condense entities that dare to go out in the daytime, their strength aren’t simple, it seems that his cultivation has also risen in the past few years when he has been travelling outside.”","“When I went to the City Lord’s Manor, I also heard the City Lord mention that there is a Ghost King in the area of Yin Mountain, there are quite a few ghost cultivators under his hand, and they also often come out to do evil. When I came back a while ago, I could feel that there was a slight change in the aura of the city and quite a lot of shops had closed their doors early.” Xuanyuan Mo Ze said, playing with the tea cup in his hand, thinking of the scene when he just came back, a glint flashed by his eyes.","Hearing this, Feng Jiu’s eyes flickered slightly, lifted the quilt and got out of bed, put on her clothes, and said, “Hmm? Even such a tiny place like this has such a thing? Then I really need to go and take a look.”","She smiled and said, “Since I’ve already slept for a while, I’ve rested enough. Moreover, after hearing this, I no longer feel sleepy! How about this? I’ll go out and take a look, you should take a rest first.”","“You want to go deal with that Ghost King?” Xuanyuan Mo Ze raised an eyebrow to look at her.","“Since I have encountered it, how can I leave it unattended?” Feng Jiu slowly said, taking a gentle step to his side, saying, “We have this strength, since we can manage it, if we don’t care, won’t we let that Ghost King do harm to the people?”","In fact, she was thinking in her heart, whether it was a ghost cultivator or a Ghost King, keeping it was simply a big scourge, if she didn’t exterminate this threat, if one day, if her children arrived at this place, with their innate spiritual bodies, wouldn’t they be targeted by that Ghost King and ghost cultivators?","Thinking of this possibility, it was impossible for her to leave it unattended. Such a threat, since they had encountered it, should be snuffed out before it was too late!"]},{"number":4467,"title":"Chapter 4467: Quietly solving","paragraphs":["Chapter 4467: Quietly solving","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“I’ll accompany you.” Xuanyuan Mo Ze said, the corners of his lips slightly hooked as he said, “I knew that you would definitely go if you knew.” Even if she didn’t say it, he could vaguely guess what was on her mind.","Seeing this, Feng Jiu smiled and didn’t say anything more, just softly answered, “Alright.”","After nightfall, the two of them were ready to go out of the inn, the innkeeper saw that they wanted to go out, and couldn’t help but remind: “Dear guests, night has already fallen in the city, the people in this city all have a habit of staying home and resting early so everywhere is closed. Even if you go out on the streets now, there won’t be many people.”","“That’s not a problem.” Feng Jiu smiled lightly.","“Just, this night is not too safe ... ” Before he could finish his words, he saw that the two of them had already left the inn and walked towards the street. Seeing this, he shook his head and secretly sighed.","The city often had accidents at night, some were children, some were women, and some were cultivators. Over time, everyone in the city knew that it was best not to walk around freely in the city at night, only some outsiders didn’t know and didn’t listen to advice.","Those two people were so outstanding, going out at this time, they’ll most probably never return.","Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu walked on the street, on both sides of the street, the lanterns in front of the shops swayed in the night wind. They also saw that in the shadows of the street, there were shadowy entities floating restlessly about, wanting to get close to them, but then quietly retreated after a few attempts of not being able to get close and started to follow from afar.","“There are cultivators in this place as well, how could they let these Yin Souls cause trouble here?” Feng Jiu’s brows wrinkled slightly as she faintly swept the surroundings, then, with a raise of her hand, the two Cloud Devouring Beasts, the White Tiger as well as Old White leapt out.","“Master.” The several contracted beasts called out as they gathered around.","“Go, clear those Yin Souls in the city.” Feng Jiu said indifferently, her gaze swept towards the Yin Souls that were drifting around and escaping quickly.","If Chen’er and Yue’er were here, with their innate spirit bodies, wouldn’t they be targeted by these Yin Souls?","Thinking of the Yin Soul who had set it’s sight upon her precious Yue’er last time, coldness flashed in her eyes.","“Yes.” Several contracted beasts responded, leaping and chasing in several directions.","“The two children have the sacred artifacts we gave them on their bodies, and ordinary Yin Souls and ghosts won’t be able to get close to them.” Xuanyuan Mo Ze reassured her while holding her hand, “Don’t worry too much, they will be fine.”","“Without seeing them return safe and sound with my own eyes, tell me, how can I rest assured?” Feng Jiu said softly, her eyes looking ahead, only hoping, they turn all their bad luck into good fortune, with the help of noble people ...","That very night, the city’s ghosts were extinguished by Feng Jiu’s several contracted beasts. The Ghost King, who was the king of the mountain, in the hands of Xuanyuan Mo Ze and Feng Jiu’s turned into ashes. Under their hands, as long as the ghost cultivators were in Yin Mountain, almost none of them could survive.","After exterminating the Ghost King and ghost cultivators of the Yin Mountain, Feng Jiu used a heavenly fire to burn the Yin Mountain for three days, completely removing the Yin Energy in the mountain, before they quietly left the area.","As for the people in this city, they only know that an inexplicable fire burned that Yin Mountain for three full days, and they simply don’t know, what exactly happened there, only the City Lord in the city, after he learnt the news, immediately rushed over to take a look, and then made three respectful bows to the sky...","On the other hand, in the Pan family, at midnight, a small figure sat cross-legged on the roof of the Pan family, absorbing the essence of heaven and earth at midnight, and the spirit energy breath in the body flew around, rapidly surging towards the medicinal pill, and finally, as if he was going to make a breakthrough ..."]},{"number":4468,"title":"Chapter 4468: Recover","paragraphs":["Chapter 4468: Recover","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Seventeen, who was guarding outside the courtyard, looked at the tiny figure sitting cross-legged on the roof, and walked around outside somewhat nervously. From time to time , he’d look at the roof.","Vaguely, he seems to feel that there was something not quite the same in the air, and it was just like that time in the dilapidated courtyard, when he saw Young Master Hao killing people with his sword.","Due to the remote location of the South Courtyard, coupled with the fact that Pan Ning had told him, therefore, this side of the movement at this time, although the secret guards of the manor had noticed, but did not come over to check, after all, they also know that there was Seventeen in the South Courtyard side guarding.","In the room of the South Courtyard, Muchen and Muyue were originally sleeping, however, when they sensed the fluctuation of the spirit energy, the two of them couldn’t help but quickly get up and got out of bed. They quickly opened the door, tilted their heads upwards, and saw their Big Brother sitting on the rooftop, bathing under the moonlight.","“Young Master Chen, Young Miss Yue, why did you come out without your outer robes?” Seeing the two of them, Seventeen hurriedly went into the house and helped them get their outer robes for them to put on.","“It’s alright, it’s not cold.” Yue’er said with a smile, tilted her head and looked at the roof, saying, “Brother, is Big Brother about to make a breakthrough?”","“Not sure.” Muchen shook his head and looked upwards somewhat nervously.","And at the roof, Hao’er only felt a ‘click’ coming from a certain place towards his body, as if something had cracked, and in an instant, the sealed spirit energy surged out as much as it could, heading towards the medicinal pill.","Sweat seeped out of his forehead, and in his mind, a picture surfaced with the breakthrough inside his body, the previous, the vague things that he could always not remember, finally became clear at this moment.","It was also at the time when the spirit energy surged up greatly in his body, a light flashed out from his body and leapt up violently.","“Awoooooo~”","A wolf howl rose up to the sky, the sound echoing in the night, spreading throughout the Imperial Capital...","“Hiss! Wolf, wolf!”","Seventeen was startled, the whole person stared in shock, it did not occur to him that a huge Silver Wolf would leap out of Young Master Hao’s body, that, how on earth did that happen? How could a wolf live in his body?","The moment the wolf’s howl sounded, Hao’er, who had his eyes closed, suddenly opened his gaze, and with a flash of light in his eyes, he regained his usual splendour and aura.","At this moment, the spirit energy in his body was restored as before, and the aura that burst out from the tiny teenager who was less than ten years old at this moment was very intriguing.","Muchen and Muyue looked at their Big Brother in surprise, as well as the majestic Silver Wolf that leapt into the air and landed steadily on the roof, standing beside their Big Brother, with a look of surprise in their eyes.","Hao’er raised his hand, gently caressing the Silver Wolf by his side, a faint smile appearing on his cold little face, “You finally came out.”","“Master.”","The Silver Wolf called out, slightly lowering its head, and then looked at the two below, Muchen and Muyue. When it saw the two of them, the Silver Wolf’s gaze softened by a few points.","Those were the two children of the Master that it had once wanted to follow, since that Devil Lord’s battle, it had fallen asleep and now that it had woken up, it was relieved to see that they were all well together.","Hao’er gently leapt down from the roof, and the Silver Wolf also leapt with him, landing steadily at his side.","“Seventeen, you should know what to do about tonight, right?” Hao’er faintly swept a glance at him, his aura was like a sharp blade, filled with regal and dominance."]},{"number":4469,"title":"Chapter 4469: Not Awake","paragraphs":["Chapter 4469: Not Awake","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Don’t worry, Young Master Hao, Seventeen understands!” He hurriedly arched his hands and bent his head to speak.","“You may go back!” Hao’er said, reaching out to lead Muchen and Muyue back into the room, with Silver Wolf behind him.","After watching them enter the room, Seventeen couldn’t help but wipe the cold sweat seeping out of his forehead, took a deep breath, turned around and walked outside. Not long after, two dark guards came to him.","“Seventeen, is there anything different on your side?” The two dark guards asked, looking around.","Seventeen’s gaze flickered slightly as he asked, “What’s different?”","“Didn’t you hear the sound of a wolf howling? Just now, that wolf howl was so loud that almost the entire Imperial Capital heard it, moreover, it seems that we saw a snow-white Silver Wolf leaping into mid-air and disappearing in the blink of an eye.”","“No, I didn’t see it, but I heard the sound of a wolf howling, maybe it came from somewhere outside.” Seventeen hurriedly said.","“You’d better guard the South Courtyard properly then, let’s go to other places to take a look, the sound of a wolf howling in the middle of the night is a bit unusual.” The two dark guards said and quickly left again.","In Pan’s Manor, Old Patriarch Pan and Father Pan both got up in the middle of the night, and they went out of their rooms and looked towards the night sky, with doubts and surprise in their eyes. Because, they also heard that wolf howl.","How could there be the howl of a wolf in the middle of this Imperial Capital? This was too bizarre.","Pan Hong heard the wolf howl, then called someone to enquire about it, and after learning the situation, he leaned back and sat on the head of the bed with a thoughtful look.","Pan Ning heard the wolf howl, his heart jumped, he put on his coat out of the room, called the dark guards to ask about it, then stood in the courtyard looking at the night sky.Some thoughts stirred in his heart as a vague idea arose, he raised a foot and wanted to take a step, but finally did not continue.","This night, not only did the Pan family hear the sound of the wolf howl. This startled even the Emperor in the palace as well as all the various noble families. Who did not understand, under the foot of the Emperor, how could there be the sound of the wolf howl? Such were common occurrences in the wilderness, however, this was a city, the Imperial City!","This night was a restless night for everyone. Compared to those who stayed all night sighing in amazement as well as contemplating, Hao’er, Muchen and Muyue chatted in the room for the whole night, and the light in the room was also on all night. It was only until dawn that Hao’er went back to his room, and Muchen and Muyue went to sleep. This time round, they slept through the morning and woke up only at noon.","Boqing, who had been waiting outside the courtyard all morning, had his hands resting on his chin, looking from time to time at the courtyard that was not moving, and then looking towards Seventeen, who was guarding the courtyard door, and asked: “‘seventeen, did they sleep late last night? Why are they sleeping so late today? Usually they are all up at this time.”","“This, subordinate does not know.” Seventeen said, shaking his head.","“Brother Boqing.” Xue’er came this way, beckoning and calling, and beside her, Bowen walked slowly.","“What brings you here?” Boqing looked back at them with some surprise, “You guys didn’t go to class today?”","“Great Grandfather told us to practice and memorise some words. After we practised and memorised our characters, my Father said that he’d take us to the city to play, so my brother and I came over to call up Sister Yue’er and the others.” Xue’er said as she came to his side, looked at the courtyard, and asked, “Sister Yue’er and the others aren’t in the courtyard?”","“Seventeen said that they haven’t woken up yet.” Boqing rested his chin on his hands and said with an exaggerated sigh."]},{"number":4470,"title":"Chapter 4470: Going Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 4470: Going Out","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“They are still sleeping?!” Bowen looked at Seventeen with some surprise: “Normally they should all be up at this time, are they sick? Did you go in to take a look?”","Hearing this, Seventeen hurriedly said, “No, it’s because they slept late last night.”","When Boqing heard this, he pursed his mouth in dissatisfaction, stood up, crossed his arms, and said, “Seventeen, then when I asked you just now, why did you tell me that you didn’t know?”","“This ...”","Seventeen sighed softly in his heart and said, “Young Master Hao gave instructions that they can’t be disturbed when they are not awake, so ...” Having followed them for more than a year, he has some understanding of their habits. Boqing was more mischievous, so he didn’t intend to say more to him.","Boqing lightly grunted, “You’re bullying me because I’m so small, hmph! I’m going to tell my Father.”","“Boqing, they haven’t woken up yet, so it looks like they won’t be able to go, do you want to go play with us?” Bowen asked, looking at Boqing beside him.","“Of course! I’ll go with you guys.” As soon as he heard that he was going to play, he immediately smiled, “I’ll come back and recite my books, otherwise if I can’t recite them tomorrow, Great Grandfather will beat my poor hand.”","Half a year ago, Hao’er and Muchen Muyue didn’t read and learn words with them, because, when they picked up their books, they could always read them once and memorise them, they learnt things fast, Great Grandfather praised them for being smart, and they didn’t need to learn this matter of reading and learning words.","The three of them didn’t go to class nor did they go out to play, they stayed in the courtyard all day long. They rarely went out and if he didn’t come to find them to play, they wouldn’t go to find them to play.","“Brother Bowen, Brother Boqing, Sister Xue’er, why are you here?” Yue’er, who was wearing a small pink dress, skipped out of the room, followed by Muchen, who was wearing a small white robe.","“You guys are awake?” Boqing saw them and happily trotted forward.","“Muchen, Yue’er, my Father wants to take us out to play, do you guys want to come along?” Bowen opened his mouth and asked, looking at the two little ones.","Hearing this, Yue’er looked at her brother and asked, “Brother, are we going?” There was a look of anticipation on her little face.","“Ask Big Brother.” Muchen spoke.","As soon as he spoke, Yue’er ran to the door of her Big Brother’s room and shouted, “Big Brother, Big Brother, Brother Bowen is asking us to go out and play together, do we want to go?”","The tender voice carries the meaning of anticipation, and when Hao’er in the room heard this, the corners of his lips rose slightly, and after tidying up his robes, he walked out.","“Let’s go!” Hao’er opened the door and then looked at his sister in front of him, pinching her little head, saying, “It’s also been a long time since we’ve gone out, so it’s good to go out and have a look around.”","“That’s great, I’ll go and tell my Father first, you guys can come later.” Bowen smiled and turned to leave first.","“Seventeen, go to the kitchen and get some pastries to bring along.” Hao’er instructed, looking at Seventeen at the side.","“Yes.” Seventeen answered and quickly turned to leave.","“Let’s go to the front! My Father is in the front yard.” Xue’er held Yue’er’s hand and walked forwards with a smile on her face, behind her, Muchen and Boqing followed, and Hao’er walked at the end.","At the front courtyard, Pan Hong was sitting in a wheelchair, talking with Pan Ning, while Bowen stood quietly at the side.","“Father, Second Uncle.” Xue’er saw them and called out with a smiling face.","“Father, Uncle, we’re here! Muchen and Yue’er and the others are going, Big Brother Hao’er is also going, all of us are going to play together.” Boqing grinned and trotted forward."]},{"number":4471,"title":"Chapter 4471: News","paragraphs":["Chapter 4471: News","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Pan Hong and Pan Ning looked towards the children and saw that although their own children were not bad looking, they were nothing compared to the three of them.","This, was a fact that they had known this for a long time. However, today, this difference seems to be even more obvious. Especially more so for Hao’er, who was not quite the same as usual, his body, his gaze, all seem to have more of an indescribable feeling.","“I don’t have much to do today, so I’ll go out with you guys! It’s just right to take two carriages.” Pan Ning smiled, looked at the several children, and asked, “Is there anywhere you guys want to go today?”","“Father, I want to go pick peaches, they said that there’s a large peach forest behind the Imperial Temple, and they all have peaches that are ready for picking now.” Boqing hurriedly spoke.","“Oh? Who said that?” Pan Ning raised an eyebrow and looked at his son.","“The subordinates in the manor said it!”","“The Imperial Temple is a bit far from here, and it’s not early for this to go over.” He looked at the sky and said, saying, “Moreover, if we go over now, we might not be able to make it back this evening.”","“Well, since the children like it, it would be good to go there and stay for the night and come back the next day.” Pan Hong smiled, looked at his brother, and said, “Moreover, the Imperial Temple is quiet and elegant and I haven’t been there for a long time, so it’s just as well that I’m going to take a look this time.”","Hearing this, Pan Ning thought for a moment, then said, “Since Big Brother has said so, then let’s go! I’ll go tell father and the others, you guys get on the carriage first.”","“Great!” Boqing jumped up excitedly, Bowen also had a happy smile on his face, and Xue’er smiled as she snuggled into her Father’s arms.","“Picking peaches, huh?” Yue’er blinked and looked at Hao’er, saying, “Big Brother, I seem to remember picking peaches as well.”","Hao’er listened and nodded, “Well, you’ve picked them.” Their Mother had a large forest of peaches.","Muchen also thought about it, and it seemed, there was that scene that appeared in his memory as well, only, he couldn’t remember it clearly.","Pan Hong looked at the three of them, revealed a smile, and said, “Let’s go! Let’s get on the carriage first.” He raised his hand, and a guard came out behind him to help push his wheelchair.","There were some things that might never have been understood, but, vaguely could be guessed, only, since they were all silent, let’s pretend not to know!","Two carriages, accompanied by twelve guards, there were eight secret guards in the dark to protect the carriage all the way from the Imperial City as they headed towards the Imperial Temple ...","In one of the carriages at the back, Boqing was sitting in a carriage with Bowen as well as Xue’er and Pan Hong, at this time, Boqing was pouting.","“Uncle, why won’t my Father let me sit in a carriage with him?” He looked towards Pan Hong who was sipping his tea and asked.","Pan Hong took a sip of tea and asked, “You don’t like riding in a carriage with Uncle? Or do you not like Bowen and Xue’er?”","As soon as he heard this, the two people next to him looked at him, seeing this, Boqing hurriedly waved his hands, “No no, I don’t dislike Uncle, nor do I dislike Brother Bowen and Xue’er.”","“Since that’s the case, then just sit with us, after all, if you go over there, their side will be too crowded to sit comfortably.” Pan Hong spoke nonchalantly.","“Like this?” Boqing scratched his head, and in the end, he no longer thought further.","And in the carriage in front, Muchen and Muyue were eating snacks, while Hao’er was sitting on the side. Pan Ning looked at the three of them and said, “Recently, I received news that someone had discovered an Immortal and had already been invited back to the Imperial Capital, and they are probably on their way now.”"]},{"number":4472,"title":"Chapter 4472: Greeting in Person","paragraphs":["Chapter 4472: Greeting in Person","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hearing these words, Muchen and Muyue, who were eating their food, stopped immediately as they looked towards Pan Ning with wide eyes. Hao’er, on the other hand, paused for a moment before asking, “Is the information reliable? How can we be sure that the other party is an Immortal Cultivator?”","His memory was restored, even though he was still young, he had become more and more cautious in his dealings. This place belonged to the mortal realm and in this mortal world, neither power nor money was what a person who cultivated immortality was looking for. Even if there was really a person who cultivated immortality who had come to this place, he shouldn’t have shown his face in front of the people, so when he heard that he that they had found traces of an Immortal, and that the person had been invited back to the Imperial Capital, all he had in his heart was suspicion.","“This is something I haven’t verified either, so I guess we can only find out in a few days.” Pan Ning said, looking at Hao’er and asking, “Do you suspect that person is not an Immortal?”","Hao’er shook her head and said, “This place belongs to the realm of mortals, generally cultivators will not come here unless they are some wanderers, but if they are that kind, they will not show themselves in front of people and make it known.”","“I understand, I will pay more attention to this matter, and ask around before I tell you.” Pan Ning nodded and spoke.","The carriage travelled slowly, along the way, there was constant laughter in the carriage, and the few children sitting in the carriage picked up the curtain from time to time, looking at the scenery along the road.","All the way along, until they arrived at the gate of the Imperial Temple.","“Come down quickly! We’re here.” Pan Ning got off the carriage first, and after carrying Yue’er off the carriage, he saw Muchen himself gently leap off the carriage, followed by Hao’er.","“Father!”","Behind him, Boqing jumped down like a little monkey and came to his side in three moves, “Father, are we staying here tonight?” He grabbed his Father’s hand with one hand while looking at the imposing and majestic Temple, his eyes filled with curiosity.","“When we go in later, we’ll first pay our respects to the temple’s Abbot, and then we’ll show you around.” Pan Ning laughed and said, stroking his head, saying, “We’ll stay here tonight and we’ll go back tomorrow after lunch.”","Over there, after the guards helped Pan Hong off the carriage, they pushed the wheelchair in towards that gate. Pan Hong shouted across to them as he did so, “Let’s go!”","“Qing’er, Yue’er and Muchen, don’t run around, follow me closely.” Pan Ning called out, telling the few younger ones not to run around, before leading them inside together.","Bowen and Xue’er followed beside their Father’s wheelchair, and it wasn’t long before they entered the gate before they saw the Abbot, who was over sixty years old, walking slowly towards them with a few young monks.","“Amitabha.” The Abbot bowed towards Pan Hong and Pan Ning, reciting the Buddha’s name softly under his breath, but his gaze swept past the few children and landed on Hao’er , Muchen and Muyue at the back.","With just a glance, a flash of light crossed his wise gaze, and he smiled as he folded his hands and bowed again, “I didn’t know that an honoured guest had arrived, This Monk has missed out on welcoming you.”","Hearing these words, Pan Hong’s eyes flickered slightly, and he turned slightly sideways, his eyes falling on Hao’er, Muchen and Muyue.","Pan Ning was also a little surprised, it was said that the Imperial Temple’s Abbot was as discerning as a torch, and he did not expect that a glance would also be able to tell that Hao’er and his siblings were extraordinary.","He smiled and bowed with his hands folded, his mouth said noble guest, his gaze swept over them to land on Hao’er, Muchen and Muyue. With such an obvious greeting, it was naturally picked up.","Bowen, standing beside his father, followed his gaze to the three siblings, doubts crossing his eyes."]},{"number":4473,"title":"Chapter 4473: Peach Forest","paragraphs":["Chapter 4473: Peach Forest","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","He has been smart since childhood, not to mention, he has been taught and nurtured personally by his Great Grandfather. After all, he was still at a tender young age and there were a lot of things he always saw but did not understand and also could not comprehend more complex things.","Hao’er stood still, neither servile nor overbearing, with an indifferent expression, his eyes calmly looked at the Abbot and did not speak. Muchen, on the other hand, pursed his small lips, after glancing at that old monk, his gaze fell on his bald head, and did not know what he was thinking about, but it was Yue’er who smiled and her pair of beautiful eyes curved up and a pure and harmless innocent smile lit up on her face.","“Master Hui Zhen, after a farewell of many years, Master’s divine splendour remains the same.” Pan Hong revealed a faint smile, breaking the tranquillity of that moment.","“Heh heh heh, Young Master, This Monk is looking forward to playing a few more games of chess with you.” He revealed an amiable smile, and his gaze also retracted from the three children, landing on Pan Hong’s body.","“To be able to play against a grandmaster, I am looking forward to it.” He said with a smile and added, “Master, this is my second brother, Pan Ning, who has brought a few children from the manor over to disturb me today.”","“Greetings, Abbot.” Pan Ning hurriedly bowed.","That Abbot looked at Pan Ning, smiled, and said, “Young Master is truly a man of deep fortune, and the Imperial Temple would not dare to be slow in welcoming you all today.” As he spoke, he instructed the young monk at the side, “Tidy up the eastern courtyard for all the honourable guests to stay.”","“Yes.” The little monk answered and made a polite gesture to invite them as he led the way.","“Then I won’t be polite, I’ll take the children over first.” Pan Ning said, bowing towards the Abbot before leaving with the children.","After watching them leave, the Abbot then said to Pan Hong, “Young Master, this way please.” Saying so, he walked slowly.","The guards pushed Pan Hong to follow beside him, and the two of them walked and chatted like old friends who had known each other for many years, until, they arrived at a quiet courtyard.","The little monk retired, the guards also retired, and in the large courtyard, only the Abbot and Pan Hong left two people, a stone table, a chessboard, a pot of tea, quiet and elegant.","Pan Hong sighed, said: “Seeing you today, the Master is still the same, but here I am, sitting in this wheelchair. I’ll no longer stand up in this lifetime, in just less than two years of time, I’ve experienced the ups and downs of this world.”","The host poured two cups of clear tea and laughed, ‘everything is predetermined, so why does Young Master need to sigh.” He placed the chess pieces in front of him and said, “Come, let’s see if Young Master’s chess skills have improved again after not seeing him for a few years.”","Upon hearing this, Pan Hong smiled, so he picked up the chess pieces and slowly fell ...","On the other hand, Pan Ning took a child and followed the young monk to the east courtyard to rest for a while before taking a few children to the peach forest at the back of the mountain by himself.","At the same time, in the front of the Maharishi Treasure Hall, a richly dressed beautiful woman is kneeling, the heart of the silent recitation of the request, after a while, slowly stood up, a side of the maidservant hurriedly came forward to support, personally went up to add the incense and oil.","Seeing this, the monk on the side said, “The benefactor has depression in your heart, you might as well go to the Peach Forest in the back of the mountain to take a walk to disperse your mind.”","“Peach forest?” The beautiful woman was stunned, and after thinking about it, she said, “Sounds good.” Then after gently performing a salute, she turned around and left the temple, heading towards the Peach Forest in the back of the mountain.","At this time in the peach forest, the peach tree was bearing a pink and tender peach, looking very tempting. After Pan Ning brought the few children into the peach forest, the few children were like caged birds being released, laughing and joking as they went their own way to play.","“Don’t go too far, just pick enough peaches.” Pan Ning shouted at them, shook his head, and then found a place to sit down and rest."]},{"number":4474,"title":"Chapter 4474: Saw","paragraphs":["Chapter 4474: Saw","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This place was a sacred holy land, since there would not be any danger, there were not many people in the peach forest. It was very quiet, so they let a few children play by themselves.","“Sister Yue’er, Xue’er, Brother Bowen, let’s play hide and seek!” Boqing suggested with an excited face.","“Good! But I’m not going to catch, I’m going to hide.” Yue’er said with a smile on her face, pulling Muchen beside her, saying, “Brother, you too! Come along and play together~”","As soon as she finishe her words, she looked around and saw her Big Brother not far away, so she shouted, “Big Brother, are you playing?”","“No, you guys just go ahead and play! Just don’t run too far.” Hao’er said, not forgetting to give a word of advice.","“Mm hmm~” Yue’er nodded obediently, pulled her brother and ran, shouting at the same time, “Brother Bowen, quickly take Sister Xue’er to hide!”","“Then you guys hurry up, I’m going to open my eyes when I count to ten.” Boqing covers his eyes with both hands and lies down next to the peach tree while counting loudly, “One, two, three ...”","Yue’er pulled Muchen trotting along, soft and sticky voice while saying, “Brother, you don’t always put on a wooden face when we are playing with them, they will be sad.”","Muchen pursed his little lips as he listened and said, “They just know how to play, it’s too childish.”","Hearing this, Yue’er smiled and bent a pair of eyes, saying, “Brother, we are both younger than them~”","“But we are better than them.” He raised his chin in a little arrogant manner.","“That’s because they are different from us.” Yue’er smiled and said, looking at the larger peach tree, saying, “Brother, let’s hide up there, there are many leaves up there, Brother Boqing will definitely not be able to find us.”","Saying that, pulling her brother with a gentle leap, she jumped up to the top of the peach tree, the two of them found a branch to sit on, and with the peach leaves as a cover, Yue’er picked two big peaches and wiped them on herself, before handing one to Muchen.","When Muchen saw her rubbing the peaches on her body, and her little pink dress was stained with peach fuzz due to the rubbing, he frowned, and taught in an older brotherly manner, “Sister, you’re a girl, you can’t always get dirty on your body.” As he spoke, he also took out a handkerchief from his sleeve and helped her wipe her dress which had been stained.","“It’s alright, I’ll go back and take a bath in a while.” Yue’er said without much care, while taking a bite of the peach, while peeking through the peach leaves again, she carefully looked around to see if Boqing had found her.","However, she didn’t expect to see Boqing, but instead saw a beautiful woman standing under a peach tree not far away, wiping her tears.","Yue’er blinked and tugged on her brother’s sleeve, saying, “Brother, there’s an Aunt over there crying!”","Muchen glanced at him and said, “Whatever, it’s none of our business.” He took the peach and didn’t eat it, just held it in his hand and played with it.","Yue’er ate the peach while watching, and didn’t say anything, just listening to the two maidservants over there softly comforting. The three people who were originally standing over there, after the woman wiped away her tears, they also lightly moved their steps towards this side, stopping at the foot of the peach tree where they were.","“Madam, this peach tree is very lush and bears a lot of peaches, so why don’t we pick some back for good luck.” A maidservant spoke softly, holding a bamboo basket in her hand.","“Yeah.” The beautiful woman said, saying, “I’ll pick them myself!” She had come all the way to the Buddha’s Gate to ask for a wish, only, this wish she didn’t know if it could be fulfilled."]},{"number":4475,"title":"Chapter 4475: Not a Peach Fairy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4475: Not a Peach Fairy","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","They’ve been married for many years, but have not been blessed with a child. Although the couple were deeply in love, it could not withstand the weather of time. Today, she came here to pray, in hope that there will be a good omen.","She gathered her mind, her eyes skimmed over that one pink and delightful peach, finally landed in a larger peach, stretched out her hand and tiptoed, trying to pick it but her fingertips could only vaguely touch it. She tried a few times, was about to take back her hand, suddenly, a small pink hand reached out from the lush foliage, picking the peach and handed it over.","“Here.”","Yue’er half lying on her back, set aside the leaves smilingly looking at the beautiful woman who was staring at her dumbly, seeing that she didn’t say anything and didn’t pick it up, as if she was stunned, she then stretched out her little hand down and handed it over a few more points, shouting, “Here you go, your peach.”","“Ah!”","That lady slowed down, let out a low cry, the whole person could not help but take a step back, but then as if she thought of something, she looked up, and happened to look at that smiling delicate little face between the peach leaves and peaches.","That pink and tender little face, delicate and innocent, a pair of beautiful big eyes are smilingly looking at her, and that pair of white and tender chubby whirring little hands, are holding a big peach and handing it down, at first glance, it’s as if she saw the Peach Fairy, which made her heart skip a beat.","“The Peach Fairy has manifested!” That lady murmured, and actually directly knelt down, her eyes full of surprise: “Greetings to the Peach Fairy.”","The two maidservants were also shocked by this scene, they only saw that above the peach tree, a little girl who was so tender and delicate that she didn’t look like anything else on earth was looking at them with a smile on her face, holding a large peach in her hand, and when they saw their madam kneeling down, they also hurriedly knelt down and didn’t dare to raise their heads.","This peach tree was huge and tall, its leaves luxuriant and full of peaches. It was not a tree that a mere child could climb up. Another reason was that the pink and smiling innocent little face was exquisite, she did not look like a mortal. Adding on to the fact that this was in the midst of the Buddha’s door in the Peach Forest inside, it was thought to be the Peach Immortal descending.","However, compared to them, Yue’er couldn’t help but blink her eyes at this moment, somewhat surprised and confused. She just looked at this beautiful aunt who can’t even pick peaches, so she helped to pick it and handed it to her. Why did she end up kneeling down and worshipping her?","Muchen, who was sitting on the other side of the branch, glanced down below and was somewhat speechless, apparently not expecting these people to misunderstand either.","Although they were also Immortals, they were not Peach Immortals.","“I’m not a Peach Fairy oh~” Yue’er said with a smile, she looked at them, her soft and childish voice with laughter, saying, “Don’t worship me, I’ll get used to it~”","When that madam heard that, she was stunned for a moment, and cautiously raised her head, she saw that the little girl had already sat down, her feet dangling down and swaying in mid-air, and she was still holding that big peach in her hand, and next to her, the leaves were being ruffled, and she also saw that there was another boy in a small white dress, and that boy also had a delicate little face that was exactly the same as that little girl’s.","“We’re playing hide and seek!” Yue’er said with a smiling face, and vaguely heard Boqing’s voice shouting in the peach forest.","Upon hearing this, that madam hurriedly stood up and looked at the two children sitting up there, and then looked to the left and right before asking, “Whose children are you? How can you climb so high? If you fall down ...”"]},{"number":4476,"title":"Chapter 4476: Danger","paragraphs":["Chapter 4476: Danger","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Before she finished her words, she saw that little girl stretching her little hand and handing over the peach again, “Here you go.”","She looked at her in a daze, only to see the little girl’s delicate little face with an innocent smile, a pair of beautiful eyes that were very soulful, wearing a little pink dress, a tiny doll that looked very adorable, which made a heart of hers uncontrollably soften.","While extending her hand to catch that peach, she also said, “Come down! I’ll carry you guys down.”","“Don’t! Don’t, my brother and I are playing hide and seek.” Yue’er shook her head and retracted her hand, she held onto the branch of the tree and was about to stand up and re-hide it, but who knew that her feet slipped, and her small body fell downwards.","“Sister!” Muchen exclaimed in shock, reaching out to grab her in a hurry, but failed to do so.","When the lady standing under the tree saw that little girl fell down, also let out a low cry, and hastily reached out to catch her, however, the impact of falling down from the tree was larger, even though the lady caught her, she couldn’t stand up, and the whole person fell down, but her hands were tightly holding the little girl in her arms.","“Hiss! Madam!” The two maidservants exclaimed, rushing forward.","Yue’er blinked her eyes and looked at the woman who fell to the ground, and hurriedly got down from her, asking with some concern, “Aunt, how are you? Are you injured?”","Muchen leapt down from the tree and stood beside Yue’er, looking at that lady.","She smiled and reassured her in a gentle voice, “I’m fine.” She rubbed her waist and felt some stinging pain at her arm, and when she took a look, she saw that the skin had been cut by a stone, and a trace of blood was oozing out.","“It’s bleeding.” Yue’er blamed herself somewhat.","“It’s alright.” The woman smiled and said, looking at these two outstanding looking children in front of her, she only felt cute as hell, she thought, if she also had two children like this, how good would that be?","“Thank you.” Muchen thanked, knowing that if she hadn’t caught Yue’er, even if she wouldn’t have fallen and hurt herself, it would still hurt.","“Whose children are you?” The woman sat on the ground, letting the two maidservants tear off strips of cloth to help her simply bandage her wounds, while looking at the two children and asking.","Yue’er tilted her head, thought for a moment, and said, “Of course we are the children of my Father and Mother! However, we couldn’t find Father and Mother, so we stayed at Uncle Ning’s house.”","At those words, that lady was slightly stunned, “How could you not find your parents?”","Muchen pulled Yue’er, signalling her not to say too much, while saying, “We’re leaving.” As he said that, he held Yue’er’s hand and walked towards the road they came from.","However, just as they walked out a dozen metres away, they suddenly heard cries of alarm from behind them, as well as, the sound of sword qi.","Muchen and Muyue immediately stopped their steps and looked back, they saw that, out of nowhere, several black robed men came out and were attacking that lady with swords, the two maidservants were calling for help in alarm, but one of them was killed by those black robed men, and the other one was escorting that lady to escape, shouting for help at the same time.","“Yue’er!” Muchen exclaimed in shock, only because, the sister he was holding by his side broke away from his hand and swept out in the next moment.","Almost without hesitation, Yue’er swept towards the lady, her small figure, her steps moved lightly, her speed was extremely fast, and while she swept, she also shouted, “Brother, quickly shout for help!”","“Ah!”","The lady’s feet were soft, fell and sat down, the maidservant hurriedly went to help her: “Madam, quickly get up, quickly get up!” However, right at this moment, a long sword stabbed towards that madam’s chest with an astounding speed, intending to take her life!"]},{"number":4477,"title":"Chapter 4477: Practising","paragraphs":["Chapter 4477: Practising","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Madam!” That maidservant cried out in shock, her body was shaking in fear, but she couldn’t do anything, she just looked at the long sword coming with her face pale and eyes wide open.","And that madam was also stunned, the killing intent came, she was so shocked that she couldn’t even shout out, thinking that she would surely die. Her eyes widened when she saw a small figure dash out in front of her, a dagger held in her small hand blocked that incoming long sword.","“Clang!”","Only to hear a crisp clanging sound, that long sword was actually deflected. However, the other several black robed men saw this and shouted, “Kill!”","As the angry shouts fell, several long swords attacked towards Yue’er and the lady, and right at this moment, a childish voice containing anger came out.","“Hmph! Seeking death!”","Looking at those black robed men holding their swords against his sister, Muchen immediately shouted angrily and drew his dagger, which also flew directly out of his hand and attacked towards one of the black robed men at the front.","The dagger with a hint of spirit energy breath swooshed through the air and pierced into the neck of a black robed man with a swoosh like an arrow.","“Ughh!”","The black robed men who was holding up his sword and was about to slash down let out a muffled grunt, his body froze there in a split second, the sword in his hand didn’t fall for a long time, his eyes were wide open in fear, staring dead ahead, as if he couldn’t believe that the dagger that had killed him had actually flown out of the hands of a three or four year old child, and hit his vitals with a single precise slash!","When those black robed men saw this, they were shocked for a moment and looked in that direction, but when they saw that it was just a three or four year old boy, they could not help but be furious and shouted, “Kill them! Fight quickly!”","Hao’er had heard the sound and came over, his figure swept through the peach trees, before he reached Yue’er and Muchen and his side, he saw that those black robed men were raining down killing blows, after his eyes swept those black robed men, his heart moved slightly, two air currents popped out of his hands, knocking the woman and the maidservant out of their senses.","“Big Brother?” Yue’er turned around and saw his Big Brother coming this way.","“Chen’er, Yue’er, these few people are left for you to practice on.” Hao’er said, his indifferent gaze swept over the few black robed men and did not make a move, instead choosing to have Muchen and Muyue deal with them.","After cultivating for so long, they hadn’t had a real battle yet, these few black robed men were just a few, so let them practice their hands and guts.","The two of them were stunned for a moment, and then they also knew what he meant, so they answered. Yue’er held the dagger and turned the spirit energy in her body, and in the next moment, she swept forward with a tap of her toes.","And after Muchen also swept forward, he removed the dagger from the chest of that black robed man, his spirit energy surging in his palm, killing intent overflowing in his eyes.","The two of them had been training for so long, whether it was their stance or martial arts skills, they were all very skilled, but the opportunities for actual combat were very few, this time, after hearing their Big Brother’s words, the small two figures, their body’s aura changed the moment their spirit energy surged up.","Different from the usual appearance, this moment they, whether it is on the body or in the eyes, have brought a killing intent. Without a hint of hesitation, in their hearts, they always remember that for those who want to take their lives, they will have to leave their lives behind!","Hao’er watched from a short distance away, and when he saw that the two of them were more than capable of dealing with the several black robed men, the corners of his pretty lips couldn’t help but hook up slightly, and he thought to himself: if Father and Mother saw Chen’s and Yue’er’s skills this outstanding, they should be very happy as well, right?"]},{"number":4478,"title":"Chapter 4478: Aftermath","paragraphs":["Chapter 4478: Aftermath","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When he was small, Father and Mother had personally taught him, telling him that Father and Mother couldn’t always be by his side to protect him, and that they could only rest assured if he became stronger and had the ability to defend himself.","And he, now and his younger siblings strayed here, he has also been personally teaching the two to cultivate, so that they have the ability to protect themselves, as back then, Father and Mother taught him in general.","A few breaths of time, the forest once again returned to calm, on the ground, a few corpses fell there, and those two small people, standing in the middle of those corpses, is seriously wiping off the hands of the dagger stained with blood.","Pan Ning had rushed here after hearing the commotion, only, he didn’t expect that after rushing here, what he would see would be a scene like that.","‘Hiss! What happened? Are you guys alright?’ Pan Ning’s face changed as he quickly stepped forward, seeing Hao’er standing on the side, while the two younger ones were standing beside the woman who had fallen on the ground.","‘Uncle Ning, we’re fine.’ Yue’er said, looking at the corpses on the ground and slightly hanging her head.","Muchen, on the other hand, looked at those corpses with a taut little face, his eyes calm and wave-free, as if those people weren’t killed by him.","Pan Ning stepped forward and inspected, his brows slightly wrinkled, his face tinged with gravity as he said, ‘The Buddhist Sect’s place of tranquillity, but it’s actually infiltrated with dead soldiers?’ Looking at the several dead dead soldiers, he looked at the several children with a complicated gaze.","There was no one else here besides them, so he knew in his heart who killed these dead soldiers.","‘They wanted to kill this Auntie, and then they wanted to kill us, so we killed them.’ Yue’er spoke in a small voice, somewhat uneasily tugging at the corner of her coat.","Pan Ning let out a light sigh and said, ‘Don’t be afraid, it’s fine.’ He patted Yue’er’s little head, and as the words came out, he felt strange again. These children even dared to kill dead soldiers, so where would they be afraid of anything?","‘I’ll tell you, if anyone asks later, just say that I killed all these people, and as for the rest, don’t say a word.’ Pan Ning delivered, knowing in his heart that this matter was probably not that simple.","‘Hm.’ The three responded, looking at him.","‘Hao’er, you first take them to the Bo Wen several people, then bring them all back to the courtyard where they are resting.’ Pan Ning said, glancing out of the corner of his eye at Seventeen, who was quickly sweeping over there.","‘Good.’ Hao’er responded, which led his younger siblings to go first.","‘Young Master Hao’er, Young Master Chen, Miss Yue’er.’ Seeing them, Seventeen hurriedly bowed, and only after seeing them leave did he quickly step forward to Pan Ning’s side.","‘Second Young Master, what happened here?’ He was a little stunned as he looked at those bodies on the ground of the fallen woman.","‘Let’s talk about it later, for now, you first go to the front to find the presiding masters and ask them to come over for a moment.’ Pan Ning confided.","‘Yes!’ Seventeen answered and quickly left.","Pan Ning went up and saw that the woman and the maidservant had only fainted, so he first pinched the woman’s Renzhong acupoint, and saw that the woman slowly woke up.","‘Greetings, Lady Hou.’ Pan Ning made a bow and retreated three steps away.","That lady rubbed her brow and opened her eyes, and when she saw the corpse in front of her, she thought of what had happened earlier, and couldn’t help but blanch, and as if she had thought of something, she looked to the left and right, but the two children were nowhere to be seen.","‘Where are those two children?’ She asked anxiously.","‘They are fine, madam need not worry.’ Pan Ning spoke.","‘Are you ...’ She then carefully sized up Pan Ning, thought for a moment, and was a little unsure: ‘Are you Pan Ning?’"]},{"number":4479,"title":"Chapter 4479: Knowing by Heart","paragraphs":["Chapter 4479: Knowing by Heart","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","‘Yes.’ Pan Ning answered, looked at her, and said, ‘Madam, what happened here just now ...’","On the other side, the presiding officer and Pan Hong were playing chess when they saw a young monk rush in with seventeen.","‘Benefactor, it’s not good, this monk said that an assassin came in at the Peach Forest in the back of the mountain, and that there’s been a death.’ The little monk hurriedly said.","‘Young Master, Presiding Master.’ Seventeen looked at the two and also hurriedly bowed.","Pan Hong’s brows wrinkled slightly as he looked at Seventeen and asked, ‘What’s going on? How could an assassin sneak into the land of Buddhism?’","‘Young Master, Presiding Master, it was the Second Young Master who asked his subordinate to invite the two of you over, other than that, my subordinate does not know.’","The Presiding Master stood up, his face slightly condensed, saying, ‘A human life in the Buddhist Sect’s pure land is not a small matter, This Monk will go and take a look first, the Young Master doesn’t need to be in a hurry, he can just follow later.’ As soon as his voice fell, he quickly left with the young monk first.","‘Are the several children alright?’ Pan Hong inquired.","‘The several Young Masters and Young Misses are all fine, and the Second Prince is not injured, so there is no need for the Grand Master to worry.’ Seventeen said, leading the way for him in front, behind him, the guards pushed their wheelchairs and followed.","Arriving at the peach forest, the presiding officer and Pan Ning and that lady had already spoken for a while. Understanding the situation, the presiding master softly chanted, ‘Amitabha, all of you have been frightened, please go back and rest first, This Monk will arrange to take care of things here.’","‘Thank you, Master Presiding.’ That Lady made a slight bow, and then said towards Pan Ning thankfully, ‘I really have to thank Young Master today, if it wasn’t for you, I’m afraid I would have had trouble surviving today, when I get back, I will definitely pay my respects at the door with a generous gift.’","‘Lady Wait is serious.’ Pan Ning spoke in a hurry.","Lady Wait performed another salute, and was helped by the pale-faced servant girl to leave first.","‘These are the dead soldiers.’ Pan Hong glanced at the several corpses on the ground and knew that these were not ordinary assassins, but dead soldiers.","‘It’s towards that Lady Hou, it just happened that I met them.’ Pan Ning said, saying, ‘Master, then I’ll leave the matters here to you, we’ll go back first.’","The presiding officer put his hands together and performed a slight salute, seeing them off before looking at the several corpses on the ground, a touch of thought crossing his wise gaze ...","Arriving at the courtyard where he was resting, Pan Hong entered the compartment, and then called out to Pan Ning, who was about to enter the room, ‘You come in with me.’","Pan Ning’s footsteps, heart some helpless, know that those words other people may believe, but his Big Brother, will not believe.","Entering the compartment, Pan Ning smoothly closed the door, two guards guarded outside, looking at his Big Brother, he then asked, ‘Big Brother, what is it that you called me for?’","Pan Hong poured a cup of tea and said, ‘Don’t you think you should tell me properly? With your stature, how is it possible for you to deal with a few secret guards on your own and yet remain unharmed?’","Pan Ning was silent, really not knowing what to say.","Pan Hong drank a cup of water before saying, ‘Ever since you brought Hao’er and the three of them back, the things you’ve been hiding from us have been increasing day by day, you do know that we’re a family, even if there’s something you can’t tell outsiders, can’t you tell us about it? If this continues, have you ever thought that one day, you won’t be able to protect them at all?’","Upon hearing this, Pan Ning let out a sigh and helplessly said, ‘Big Brother, since you know, why do you need me to state it? There are things that I know you all know in your hearts, but it’s just that I promised them that if they didn’t ask for it themselves, I wouldn’t say one more word or divulge half a cent.’"]},{"number":4480,"title":"Chapter 4480: Getting to Know","paragraphs":["Chapter 4480: Getting to Know","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hearing these words, Pan Hong’s heart shook. Just what were the identities of the three children? To be able to make him hold onto their identities like this without mentioning a single word?","‘In that case, I’ll only ask you one thing, at that time, I was diagnosed by the imperial physician and the doctor as not being able to live through that night, yet I survived, was it Hao’er and the others who saved me?’","This doubt had been hidden in his heart for a long time, and he didn’t believe in the words that were said to the outside world, only, he knew that since Pan Ning had said those words out, it must have been to cover up some truth.","Therefore, he guessed that he could survive with Hao’er three people, but, even if he guessed, but even he did not want to believe, after all, the three of them are only children.","Pan Ning looked at him for a long time, took a deep breath and answered, ‘Yes.’","Pan Hong’s gaze narrowed, even if he had already guessed, at this point, when he received his own admission, his heart still shook violently. He took a deep breath and exhaled slowly, saying, ‘I know, you go back! After running into a scene like that today, I guess they are scared, so you go take a look at them.’","Hearing these words, Pan Ning’s heart also secretly sighed in relief. Even though his Big Brother had guessed that his survival had nothing to do with Hao’er and the others, he would never have thought that those three children, who were already people who dared to kill, could not be easily frightened.","He was about to walk out, but then he heard his Big Brother’s voice from behind him.","‘Wait.’","As if Pan Hong had only just reacted, his eyes swept over him and hesitantly asked, ‘Those black robed men couldn’t have been killed by Hao’er as well, right?’","‘Hehe, how could it be? Big Brother, I’ll leave first to check on a few children.’ Pan Ning turned back and smiled sardonically, not caring what he had to say again, and left quickly.","Seeing him like this, where did Pan Hong need to ask more questions? It was just that it felt unbelievable.","On the other side of the room, all six children were sitting in the room, compared to the more introverted Bo Wen, Bo Qing was like a little monkey walking around the room, looking at this and playing with that, asking questions as he did so.","Yue’er sat obediently at the table, her hands resting on her chin, blinking her beautiful innocent eyes, with an innocent look on her face, no one would have thought that such a well-behaved, innocent and harmless child had just killed three specially trained dead soldiers.","Muchen sat next to him and didn’t say anything, just pursed his little lips and listened to Bo Qing talking non-stop there.","Xue’er, on the other hand, turned back from time to time to look towards the door of the room, while Bo Wen sat quietly, sometimes looking towards Hao’er, who was sitting in the corner, and didn’t know what he was thinking about.","When Pan Ning walked in, he saw that several children were present, so he said, ‘You are all tired today as well, aren’t you? After we have eaten, let’s all rest first! Tomorrow, get up early in the morning and go around the temple, and we’ll go back after lunch.’","Apart from Hao’er’s three, Bo Wen’s three didn’t know what had happened, at this time, when he heard him say this, Bo Wen said, ‘Second uncle, I heard the monks in the temple say that there was a death at this time?’","‘That’s none of our business, and even less of your children’s business, don’t go thinking about it too much, well, let’s go! Let’s go eat first.’ He said with a smile and looked towards Hao’er and the three Muchen Yue’er.","Several children followed him to eat together, and when they came back, the sky was already dark, and after they freshened up, they went back to their rooms early to rest.","The next morning, Hao’er brought Muchen and Muyue to the front hall early in the morning. They had heard that the sign here was very spiritual, so they thought of coming to shake it to see if it was really spiritual."]},{"number":4481,"title":"Chapter 4481: Immortal Buddha","paragraphs":["Chapter 4481: Immortal Buddha","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","‘Big Brother, can we shake the lot to ask when we’re going home?’ Yue’er held his Big Brother’s hand on his left and her brother’s hand on his right, tilting his head and asking.","‘You’ll shake it later and then take it to interpret the sign to see if it’s accurate.’ Hao’er said with a smile, leading her in a slow walk.","‘Big Brother, we are immortals, why do we need to worship Buddha?’ Muchen, on the other hand, asked in disbelief, obviously they are the ones who cultivate immortality, his Big Brother also said that their parents are very powerful, they are the monarchs of heaven and earth, in that case, why do they still need to worship Buddha?","Hao’er looked at the main hall in front of him and said, ‘We don’t worship, we don’t kneel, we only shake the sign, you have to remember, in this heaven and earth, apart from our parents and our elders, no one else is qualified to make us kneel and perform the bowing ritual.’","Hearing this, Muchen and Muyue nodded, secretly remembering it in their hearts.","‘Big Brother, is that Buddha powerful? Or is it an immortal that’s powerful? Why do the people here only worship Buddha, but not Immortals?’ Yue’er asked curiously.","Hao’er gave a beat, thought for a moment, and said, ‘I don’t know about this, when we see Father and Mother later, we’ll ask them.’","‘Good.’ Yue’er asked with a smiling face.","The three of them came to the main hall, perhaps because it was still early, other than the three of them, there was only that presiding officer that they had met yesterday standing in front of the lamp adding oil, as well as, a middle-aged monk standing behind the presiding officer.","Seeing them come in, the host and that monk will look towards them, the middle-aged monk behind them for the first time to see the three of them, only to feel that these three children were born as a dragon and phoenix, extremely outstanding, however, the next moment, the three children’s behaviour, but let him be stunned for a moment.","Only saw the three people came in, then only towards the hall above the golden Buddha salute, immediately after, the little girl went to the front to pick up a sign box, and drew out a to look at, do not understand to ask: ‘ Big Brother, this to how to shake? There are only numbers on it, nothing else, is it so that drawing one is shaking it out?’","Looking at this scene, the middle-aged monk secretly shook his head, walked over and said, ‘Which family’s children are you? How come you’re not accompanied by an adult?’ He came to the side of the three children and said, ‘How can you be that courteous when you see our Buddha? You have to kneel down and dive into your hearts to make a wish before my Buddha can hear your hearts.’","Upon hearing this, Yue’er blinked her eyes and asked with a curious expression, ‘Can he hear us?’","If it was an adult speaking like this, it was expected that the middle-aged monk would be angry, but seeing that it was a little girl of three or four years old, blinking with a pair of innocent and clear eyes looking at him curiously asking, he carefully explained, ‘My Buddha is everywhere, naturally he can hear you.’","Yue’er froze and asked, ‘Then how am I going to shake the sign? I have to ask how to get home, will he tell me?’","‘Heh heh heh, the sign, to kneel down, hands together in the heart wish, kowtow three times, and then so grab the bamboo sign and turn three times, hands holding gently up and down shaking, until, one of the signatures fall to the ground can be.’ The middle-aged monk said with a smile, seeing this little girl child looks lovely, and good and innocent, then carefully taught her some.","‘Mmmmm, Yue’er will do it.’","She smiled sweetly, after nodding, she took the signet cylinder from the middle-aged monk, then walked forward, first placed the cylinder on the ground, then put her hands together to make a wish in her heart, and immediately after that, picked up the cylinder and shook it like what he had just taught her."]},{"number":4482,"title":"Chapter 4482: The Divination","paragraphs":["Chapter 4482: The Divination","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Hey, it’s not ...,” the middle-aged monk was about to speak when he was interrupted.","“Liao Wu.” The Abbot opened his mouth and shook his head slightly towards him, signalling that he didn’t need to say much.","The middle-aged monk was stunned, and after glancing at the Abbot, he looked towards the little girl shaking the divination lots, the bamboo sticks rattling as she shook it up and down her hand, the crisp sound echoing in the hall, one sound after another.","The Abbot also walked forward, quietly stood aside and watched.","After a long time, a bamboo stick fell to the ground, and the shaking also stopped. Yue’er was extremely pleased with herself as she trotted forward with a smile on her face to pick the stick up.","“Little Benefactor, This Monk will come and interpret it for you!” The Abbot stepped forward with a kind smile on his face, using an honorific words.","“Mmm, her yu go~.”","Yue’er handed him that lot, blinking her pair of beautiful eyes at him, asking with some anticipation, “Can this tell me when we can go home to see Father and Mother?”","The Abbot smiled, looked at the bamboo stick, the next moment, the smile on his face froze, only to see, this was a sign that did not have any number on it. He once again looked carefully at the bamboo stick, scanning it thoroughly but still could bit find any number on either side of it. With furrowed brows, he stred intently at it and saw golden words appear, one by one, floating up. Seeing the words, his heart could not help but had a great shock.","“Hiss! How could this ... this be?”","That middle-aged monk was also shocked, his eyes widening incredulously. On top of the bamboo stick, usually only the lot number would be written, and then the text would be taken to correspond to it, but there was no number on top of this bamboo stick, and at this moment, lines and lines of words glowing with golden light appeared out of thin air.","Even though he had stayed in the Imperial Temple for many years and interpreted lots for more than twenty years, he had never encountered such a shocking thing.","When they saw it, Hao’er naturally saw it as well, looking at that scene, Hao’er didn’t say anything, but just glanced at it before looking towards the Golden Buddha in that big hall, his heart was also a little surprised.","“Immortal foetus conceived into a Dragon and Phoenix, but the heavenly palace has no life star, nine deaths and one life is difficult to live, let nature take its course and do not force.” The Abbot recited these words under his breath, the hand holding the bamboo stick was slightly trembling.","Immortal foetus? No life star?","Hao’er listened to the Abbot read the words lightly, his sword brows raised and his cold face turned frosty. He stepped forward and took the bamboo stick from the Abbot’s hand to read it again, his thin lips pursed slightly as he looked towards the Abbot and the middle-aged monk.","“It’s best not to reveal half a word about this today!” He said coldly, and as soon as his voice fell, he turned around and led Muchen and Muyue outside.","Watching them leave, the middle-aged monk took a deep breath and looked towards the Abbot, wanting to open his mouth to enquire, but found himself unable to speak at all, as if the words were stuck in the middle of his throat, not knowing how to open his mouth.","Today, this matter was far beyond his imagination. If he had not seen this with his own eyes, he would not believe that the Buddha really manifested, just, why would it be for a little girl like that? And those words ...","“Ah! Abbot! That bamboo lot was taken away by them!” It was only then that he reacted to the fact that the lot stick with the manifestation of the Lord Buddha had actually been taken away by them.","The Abbot took a deep breath and suppressed the churning in his heart, and hurriedly came to the middle of the hall and knelt down, joining his hands together and lightly reciting, “Amitabha.”","And only then did he get up and said, “Nothing that happened today shall be revealed.” He looked at Liao Wu, with a serious and grave expression, and said, “Remember, not to reveal half a word to the outside world.”"]},{"number":4483,"title":"Chapter 4483: Think of a way","paragraphs":["Chapter 4483: Think of a way","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When the middle-aged monk saw this, he asked, “Abbot, that divination ...” He could not finish his words because after seeing the Abbot’s gaze, it made it hard for him to say all the words he wanted to ask.","“Liao Wu, you have to forget this matter. You need to know, there are things that are not for you and me to know.” He spoke slowly.","“But, if the matter of the Buddha’s manifestation is told, our Imperial Temple’s incense will definitely be more prosperous, moreover, this is the first time in the last hundred years since the foundation of the Temple that the Buddha has manifested, could it be that this matter will be suppressed just like this?” He spoke sharply, not understanding what the Abbot was really thinking?","“Don’t say anything more about this matter.” He frowned and glanced at him, saying, “Remember, do not divulge a word of it!” After warning him again, he took a step outside.","Watching the Abbot leave, the middle-aged man opened his mouth. In the end, he just let out a light sigh, shook his head and walked to the corner and sat down. He just could not understand, why would Buddha manifest for a little girl?","On the other side, Muchen and Muyue looked at their Big Brother who was holding their hands and walking forward in big strides, seeing that the breath on his body was repressive, his face was also a few points colder than usual, the two of them couldn’t help but look at each other.","“Big Brother.” Yue’er opened her mouth and called out.","Hao’er stopped, looked at Yue’er, then at Muchen, and said, “Don’t worry, Big Brother will protect you and won’t let anything happen to you!”","That divination was extremely accurate, and it also caused a hint of explosive anger in his heart. What did it mean that ‘it’s hard to live through nine deaths’? What did it mean by ‘let nature take its course’? All he knew was that his Mother had told him that man would prevail over heaven!","Moreover, his Mother did not only tell him with words, but also with actions, that man will win! Therefore, the words of ‘let nature take its course and don’t force it’ were bullshit to him!","After Muchen thought about it, he said, “Big Brother, we’ll work hard to cultivate, when we’re as powerful as Big Brother, even if there’s danger, we’ll be able to protect ourselves.”","“Mmm, Yue’er is the same, Yue’er won’t go out to play when she goes back, Yue’er will also cultivate hard!~” The little doll also hurriedly assured.","Listening to the words of the two, Hao’er suppressed the undulating emotions in his heart, and after a moment’s reprieve, he led the two to a pavilion and sat down, saying, “Big Brother knows that Chen’er and Yue’er have always been very well-behaved, and also worked hard at their cultivation, Big Brother knows it all.”","“Big Brother, we will never go to shake those divination lots again.” Yue’er said, she didn’t want Big Brother to be very angry like he was just now.","Hearing this, Hao’er rubbed her head and said, “Big Brother will find a way, Big Brother will find a way to let Father and Mother know that we are here.” His gaze looked towards the sky, and the thoughts in his heart grew firmer and firmer.","In the middle of this mortal realm, the summoning jade couldn’t contact his parents, and even though his cultivation had recovered and he had the silver wolf by his side, he was still unable to return to the Heavenly Realm where they were originally located with his cultivation.","Just, if it keeps going like this, maybe for a few years, or even ten years, they won’t be able to leave this mortal realm.","Pan Ning said that he had found traces of an Immortal who had been invited to the Imperial Capital, and even if the expectations were not great, he had to go and see just what kind of person that was? This situation, there had to be a way to break it.","“Big Brother, do you still want this thing?” Yue’er pointed at the stick she was holding in his hand.","Hao’er glanced down, the words on it had already disappeared, it was just an ordinary bamboo stick, so he threw it aside into the grass, “Let’s go back!”"]},{"number":4484,"title":"Chapter 4484: Pay a visit","paragraphs":["Chapter 4484: Pay a visit","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When they arrived at the courtyard, they saw that Pan Ning and the others were all eating their breakfast in the courtyard, and when they saw them come in, Pan Ning didn’t ask for anything more and just said, “Come over and have some porridge! I”ll take you guys around later.”","“Alright.” The three of them responded and walked up to sit down.","Pan Hong had already eaten and was sitting in his wheelchair, looking at a book, while several of the Pan family’s children asked in whispers, “Where did you go early in the morning? Why didn’t you call us?”","“Brother took us to the temple to take a look around, but there was nothing interesting, so we came back again.”","Yue’er said with a smile. For them, there really wasn’t much fun in this temple, if there was something that could let them let go and play, it was only that peach forest in the back of the mountain, only, the peach forest had a death just yesterday, they wouldn’t let them go again, only, the peaches in that peach forest were grown well, she still wanted to pick some to go back!","So, after they had their breakfast, they followed Pan Ning around, until, when they were ready to leave, Yue’er pulled her Brother and Big Brother quietly away, and went to the back of the forest to pick a basket of peaches.","Pan Ning was ready to get on the carriage, but after seeing that only the Pan family’s three children were on the carriage, but they were still missing Hao’er and his siblings, he could not help but slightly surprised. After he swept a glance, seeing that Seventeen was also missing, he then walked towards the front of the carriage.","“Big Brother, I’m not sure where the three of them have gone to, so I guess we’ll have to wait a little longer.”","“You go and look for them! We’ll wait here.” Pan Hong said.","“Alright.” Pan Ning responded, turning around and was about to go look when he saw three children trotting over with a basket of peaches, while Seventeen followed behind them, seeing this, he was slightly surprised, “You guys went to pick peaches?”","“Uh huh, we picked some so that when we go back, we can give Great Grandfather and the others a taste~” Yue’er said with a smile.","Upon hearing this, Pan Ning couldn’t help but smile, reaching out to take the basket Hao’er was carrying in his hand and said, “Give it to me! You guys get in the car quickly, we’re going back.”","“Alright.” The three of them responded, and only then did they quickly get on the carriage, and after they all got on the carriage, Seventeen also got on and drove the carriage back.","At the gate of the Imperial Temple, the Abbot slowly walked out, looking at the carriage that was moving away, he put his hands together and lightly recited, “Amitabha.”","Two days later, the Pan family welcomed Marquis Qibo as well as his wife. The two of them came with a gift of thanks, mainly for saving their lives at the Imperial Temple.","In the hall of the Pan family, a man in his thirties with a majestic aura looked at Pan’s father who was in the main seat, as well as Pan Ning who was sitting on the right side, and revealed a smile and said, ” The Second Young Master saved my wife in the Imperial Temple, and our husband and wife have always wanted to show our gratitude. It is only because we have been working on the investigation of the dead man for the past two days that we have been delayed, and we hope that the Second Young Master will not be offended. ”","“Marquis is too serious, it’s just a small matter, how could I dare to labour you and your wife to come to the door.” Pan Ning hastily spoke.","Haha it is also fate to be able to save the Madam, so Marquis Qibo does not need to take this matter to heart.” Pan’s father smiled, only knowing that they went to the Imperial Temple and came back, saying that something had happened there, and that he happened to save Marquis Qibo’s wife.","Hearing this, Marquis Qibo smiled, and after a pause, he said, “I heard Madam say that there is a pair of identical looking children in your mansion, born extremely cute and outstanding, I wonder, could our couple go and meet them?”","Hearing these words, Pan’s father and Pan Ning couldn’t help but look at each other, the former had surprise in his eyes and was unsure."]},{"number":4485,"title":"Chapter 4485: Wanting to Meet","paragraphs":["Chapter 4485: Wanting to Meet","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","And Pan Ning’s brows wrinkled slightly as he glanced at the Marquise. Obviously, she had told her husband about what had happened at that time, thinking of this, he couldn’t help but lightly sigh in his heart, he should have known.","Seeing Pan Ning’s slightly wrinkled brow, the Marquise couldn’t help but slightly flash her gaze, slightly converging her eyes without looking at him.","That pair of children look so delicate and outstanding, she liked them extremely and over the past two days, although she did not go out, but also let people inquire about them and knew that the two children were brought back by Pan Ning more than a year ago, and said that they were their family’s distant relatives.","Only, after some investigation, she naturally found out that was not what he said what distant relatives. Only, what surprised her and her husband was that even the power of the House of Marquis couldn’t find out the origins of those two children, but, from that scene on that day, she knew that those two children weren’t ordinary children.","“What? Is it inconvenient?” the Marquis asked, looking towards the two of them.","“Ha ha ha, there’s nothing inconvenient, I”ll have someone go summon them over!” Father Pan laughed and said, he didn’t think anything of it, after all, Muchen and Muyue were determined to be exquisite looking, it was normal for people to be fond of them when they saw them.","“No need to bother, let’s go over and take a look!” The Marquis stood up and smiled, “Letting a child into the hall would be more or less a bit constricting, so would it be alright if we ask the Young Master to take us over to take a look?”","Seeing this, Father Pan signalled, “You take the Marquis and the others over! Treat them well, and don’t lose your etiquette.”","Upon hearing this, Pan Ning stood up and answered before saying to the two, “Marquis, Marquise, this way please.”","Meanwhile, in the southern courtyard, the three children were all in their rooms cultivating without going out, and only Seventeen was guarding the outside of the compound.","“Second Young Master.” When Seventeen saw Pan Ning, he stepped forward and bowed.","“You go in and say a word, just say that Marquis Qibo and his Lady have come to visit Chen’er and Yue’er.” Pan Ning signalled.","“Yes.” Seventeen answered and turned to walk inside.","The couple who saw this scene felt that it was a little strange. Marquis Qibo looked towards Pan Ning and jokingly said, “Could it be that, without their permission, we are still not allowed to enter the courtyard where they live?”","Pan Ning glanced at him and said, “The three children live together in this courtyard, and usually don’t like to be disturbed when they have to rest or study on their own, so they set up this rule.”","“Hmm, they have a rather good personality.” He smiled, and saw inside, two children of the same height and identical appearance walked out, and his eyes couldn’t help but light up when he saw those two children.","“What exquisite children.” He couldn’t help but let out a praise as his eyes fell on the two children and sized them up, and the more he looked, the more surprised he felt.","These two children were no more than three or four years old, and the little boy in the little white robe had a hidden noble aura about him, while the girl in the little pink dress had a lively temperament about her, and was truly delightful to look at.","“Uncle Ning.” The two called out, and then looked towards the two people on the side.","“This is Marquis Qibo and the Marquise, they said they wanted to come and see you.” Pan Ning said, briefly introducing them without another word.","That Marquise looked at the two children and couldn’t help but reveal a smile, squatting down and holding Yue’er’s small hand, saying, “Child, look what I”ve brought for you.”","As she spoke, she took out a box from her sleeve, the box opened and inside were two night pearls the size of egg yolks.","“This is for you siblings, one night pearl each, take it and play with it!”"]},{"number":4486,"title":"Chapter 4486: No","paragraphs":["Chapter 4486: No","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","When Pan Ning saw the two night pearls, he couldn’t help but slightly move his eyes, a flash of surprise crossing his eyes. This night pearl was a very precious item and extremely rare. He did know that the Emperor had given two to Marquis Qibo, but he did not think that they would, in turn, be given to the two children.","Seeing this, he glanced towards the Marquise, seeing that she looked at Yue’er and Muchen with love in her eyes, he was relieved. However, he still said, “Marquis, Marquise, this gift is too expensive.”","“It’s alright, My Lady likes these two children very much, and after spending a long time in the treasury did she finally pick this.” Marquis Qibo smiled and said, “Children are all fond of such glowing and shiny things, just let them keep it.”","Muchen glanced at the night pearls and thought to himself, this night pearl was also really small, the ones in their space were much bigger than this.","Yue’er was holding the box and glanced over at her Brother. She then shook her head and pushed the box of night pearls back, “Aunty, we can’t have this one, our Big Brother said that we can’t just accept other people’s things.”","After she pushed the thing back, she quickly hid behind her Brother. Her Big Brother had said before, something about how they were Immortal Cultivators and not to take on too many favours because they all had to be paid back.","Marquise was stunned for a moment and said, “It’s alright, you guys can take it.”","“No need, there’s no use for us to take this.” Muchen said with a taut little face, also putting his hands behind his back, not wanting to take it.","“This ...” The first time he sent a night pearl, but he couldn’t even get a child to accept it. For a while, the Marquis and Marquise were also dismayed.","Seeing that the two children really didn’t want it, Pan Ning said, “Marquis, Marquise, the children are still young, and it wouldn’t be appropriate to give them such expensive things, so just put it away!”","Upon hearing this, Marquise had no choice but to put the things away, hesitated, and asked with a hint of anticipation, “Can I invite them to stay at our residence for some days? I really like these two children.”","She looked at Pan Ning and said, “As you know, Second Young Master, my husband and I haven’t had any children for many years since we got married, and it’s rare to see children that are so adorable. So I thought of letting them stay in the Marquis Mansion for a few days, so don’t worry, I”ll treat them very well, and I”ll send them back after a few days.”","“No!”","Before Pan Ning could speak, a cold voice directly rejected it.","Hearing the voice, they looked towards the visitor, and saw that Hao’er walked out of the courtyard, his small handsome and outstanding face was cold, and after sweeping a cold glance at the two men, he said to Muchen and Muyue, “Go back to your room.”","“Yeah.” The two little ones obediently answered, holding hands and walked towards the courtyard, entered the room, closed the door, and then lay down by the door to eavesdrop on the conversation outside.","After Hao’er withdrew his gaze, she looked at Pan Ning and said, “Uncle Ning, in the recent period of time, we have to study on our own and do not wish to be disturbed.”","Upon hearing this, Pan Ning hurriedly said, “Alright, I know, I will turn around and give instructions.” As soon as his voice fell, he saw Hao’er turn around and enter the courtyard, while at the same time instructing Seventeen.","“From today onwards, don’t see anyone who comes, much less come in to report.”","“Yes.” Seventeen sensed Hao’er’s displeasure and immediately responded respectfully.","It was only after Hao’er’s figure disappeared inside the courtyard that Marquis Qibo’s gaze flickered slightly before he asked, “Is this the Elder Brother of the two children?”"]},{"number":4487,"title":"Chapter 4487: Rumours","paragraphs":["Chapter 4487: Rumours","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Yes.” Pan Ning answered and said, “His name is Hao’er.”","The Marquis nodded and said thoughtfully, “This child looks extraordinary!”","Pan Ning did not answer, but simply said, “Marquis, Marquise, why don’t we have tea in the front hall!”","“No, since they are unwilling to go to our mansion for a small stay, we won’t stay long.” Marquis Qibo smiled and said, “I’ll have My Lady pick out some of the things that children like to send over later, so we’ll take our leave.”","Seeing this, Pan Ning sent them out, and after sending them away, he was about to go back when he saw his Big Brother waiting for him in the front courtyard.","“Are they coming for Yue’er and the others?” Pan Hong asked, looking at him.","“It’s probably because that Marquise said something to Marquis, they said that they wanted to like the two children very much and wanted to take them over to the residence for some days, but it made Hao’er reject it outright.” Pan Ning said.","He paused for a moment and added, “But as I see it, they don’t have anything else in mind, they simply like the two children.”","Pan Hong nodded and said, “The Marquis couple’s reputation in the Imperial Capital is still quite good, even if they notice something strange, they shouldn’t be holding on to a few children, but even if that’s the case, they still have to be careful.”","“I know, just now Hao’er even said that he asked people not to bother them during this period of time, and it is expected that they will not go out for some time.”","After the two brothers chatted for a while in the front courtyard, Pan Ning gave orders for people not to disturb them in the south courtyard, and also instructed the three children in the mansion not to look for Hao’er and the three of them during this period of time.","In the next few days, Hao’er and the three of them cultivated in the courtyard, and even the people in the residence didn’t know what they were busy with all day long, they only knew that apart from eating, they hardly ever went out of their rooms.","Until this day, a piece of news came out from the Imperial Temple, causing a huge stir in the Imperial Capital ...","“Have you heard? There’s news coming out of the Imperial Temple that a few days ago, Buddha manifested a divination lot out, and it’s said that the one who asked for the divination was still a three or four year old girl.”","“What? A manifestation? What kind of divination lot? How did a three or four year old girl get it?”","“I heard that it was a blank lot, but when the Abbot held it in his hand, a bit of golden light appeared on the white stick, and a few lines of the sign language appeared, and it was said that the little girl didn’t kneel down and worshiped, she just stood like that and asked for a spiritual stick, but this matter was suppressed by the Abbot, and it was only recently that the news came out.”","“Why did the Abbot suppress it? How did it come out again after it was suppressed? What is written on that? And who is that little girl? How could the Lord Buddha manifest?”","“I heard that it was the master who interpreted the sign, Master Liao Wu, who spoke in his sleep and was heard to spread the word, and I heard that the little girl was not a mortal but a fairy child, saying that it was the Buddha who manifested to give her a divination.”","On the street, groups of people together in low voices discussing as the rumours ran amok. As it travelled down the grapevine, several versions sprouted out and whether or not they were true or false, suspicion began to brew.","When the people of the Pan family heard the news, they were all gathered in the hall, one by one, their faces were grave as they looked towards Pan Ning, Pan’s father asked: “What the hell is going on here? Why did such a rumour come out after you guys went to the Imperial Temple? The rumours have spread outside now, and the more it spreads, the more ostentatious it becomes. The Emperor has also been alerted of this and has even sent someone to the Imperial Temple to invite the Abbot and Master Liao Wu into the palace.”","Pan Hong frowned, deep in thought.","Pan Ning, on the other hand, had a grave expression on his face, saying, “I don’t even know that this is still happening, it’s just that, things have already spread, and it has also alarmed the Emperor, I’m only afraid that, in a little while, someone should come."]},{"number":4488,"title":"Chapter 4488: Knowing","paragraphs":["Chapter 4488: Knowing","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“I’ll walk with you to the Southern Courtyard and ask Hao’er what their situation is. Only then can we make preparations as soon as possible.” Pan Hong said, pushing his wheelchair in front of Pan Ning.","“Mm.” Pan Ning pushed him outside, while saying to their father, “Father, let’s go ask, don’t worry.”","As Pan’s father watched them leave, he couldn’t help but shake his head and let out a sigh as he also got up and headed out.","When Pan Ning and the others arrived outside the Southern Courtyard, it was all quiet and did not see the three children, so they asked Seventeen to go in and inform them.","“Master, Second Young Master, Young Master Hao ordered not to disturb them these days, this ...” Seventeen said with a bitter face.","“You go and summon Hao’er! I’ll take care of the rest.” Pan Ning signalled, if it were not for the fact that this matter was not trivial, he would not have come to disturb them.","Seeing this, Seventeen answered and then headed inside, coming to the door of Hao’er’s room to inform, “Young Master Hao, the Master and the Second Young Master are outside, saying that there is something urgent.”","Hao’er, who was cultivating in his room, slowly opened his eyes when he heard the voice, and he exhaled softly before converging his spirit energy breath, before getting up and opening the door to his room.","When he came outside, he saw Pan Hong and Pan Ning, he said, “Uncle Hong, Uncle Ning, please come in.”","The two nodded and walked into the courtyard with him, coming to sit by the stone table. Before he waited for him to speak, Pan Ning informed him of the matter, “I came over to find you because there’s something I want to ask, that day when we went to the Imperial Temple, did you guys ask for some kind of divination?”","Upon hearing this, Hao’er glanced at them and asked without answering, “What’s wrong?”","The Pan brothers looked at each other, then Pan Hong said, “It is rumoured outside that the Buddha in the Imperial Temple showed that the person who asked for the divination was the body of an immortal child, now, the news has spread, the the Abbot of the Imperial Temple and Master Liao Wu have already been summoned by the Emperor to the palace, and it is estimated that, not long from now, people from the palace will be coming here, so we would like to ask what kind of a divination was it? Is it really Buddha’s manifestation?”","Hao’er’s handsome little face went cold and asked, “How did the news spread?”","“It is said that it was said to have been heard by other monks when Master Liao Wu spoke in his sleep, so much so that it spread.” Pan Ning said, looking at Hao’er and asking, “What about the divination lot? What exactly was written?”","“The divination lot has already been thrown away by me, and as for what is written on the it, it is ...,” Hao’er said those lines of the sign once again.","Listening to his words, the two men’s faces were a bit grave, Pan Hong even had a hard to hide dismay and stunned in his eyes, especially after seeing his brother’s not surprised look, his heart was even harder to hide the shock.","He guessed that their identities were not simple, but he never thought that their identities would be this complicated. Immortal foetus? Are they not mortals? Rather, they are immortals?","“The three of you... could it be that you really aren’t mortals, but, rather, Immortals?” Pan Hong could not hide his shock as he asked in trepidation.","“Not Immortals, just people who cultivate.” Hao’er said, looking at him, saying, “However, our identities are indeed extraordinary, which is why we have to keep it a secret.”","“There really are Immortals in this world ...,” Pan Hong muttered, his heart rolling like an appalling wave of shock.","“Big Brother, this is not the time to talk about this, but rather we must think about what to do if the Emperor sends a summons, then how should we respond?” Pan Ning spoke with some urgency, feeling that this was the most important thing at the moment."]},{"number":4489,"title":"Chapter 4489: Summoning","paragraphs":["Chapter 4489: Summoning","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","After hearing these words, Pan Hong took a while to digest the words and took a deep breath and exhaled slowly. After his mood gradually calmed down did he meditate, half a second later, he said, “Since His Majesty summoned the two people from the Imperial Temple, II’m only afraid that the matter of that divination lot cannot be hidden.”","He glanced at the two men and slowly said, “His Majesty has been searching for the Immortals for some time now, he will not let this opportunity pass. Especially, they are still living in our home, I am only afraid that once this matter is learnt about, coupled with the matter of me surviving that year after I had been concluded by all the renowned doctors and Imperial Physicians that I would not live through the night, he would even be more likely to conclude that you three are without a doubt, Immortals. ”","“What then?” Pan Ning couldn’t help but ask anxiously. In terms of planning and thinking, he was far inferior to his Big Brother, and now that his Big Brother also knew about this, he would at least feel relieved to have him come up with an idea to figure it out.","Pan Hong contemplated for a while, then said: ” If His Majesty asks, we have to say we do not know, otherwise, with the crime of deceiving the Emperor, our Pan family will meet with a big disaster. As for Hao’er and your siblings, if His Majesty asks, you will say you do not know, after all, you are still young, you can be pushed not to know about what that divination revealed. The matter about the immortal foetus, there is no other proof, so even if His Majesty guesses, there is no evidence.”","“Also, this incident has to be properly accounted for with Muchen and Yue’er, if we go to the palace, we will accompany you to go together, and we will see what happens then.” Pan Hong looked at Hao’er and said.","“Mm, I got it.” Hao’er responded and said, “I’ll go talk to them first.” With that, he walked towards the room where Muchen and Muyue were.","Meanwhile, the palace had sent someone, and at this time, they were entering the manor and heading towards the Southern Courtyard under the leadership of Pan father.","When Pan Hong and Pan Ning who were in the Southern Courtyard saw the people from the palace, the two of them looked at each other and before they could speak, they heard their father say, “This is the person from the palace, saying that he wants to invite the three siblings to enter the palace.”","Pan’s father’s expression was a bit grave, as if he also didn’t expect things to turn out like this, especially, since he didn’t know anything, he was even more disturbed.","In the room, after Hao’er had confided in Muchen and Muyue, the three of them went out of the room, and after taking a look at the person coming from the palace, they followed along with Pan Ning’s lead and headed out.","In the entire Pan family, apart from Pan Ning, no one else was allowed to travel with them, even Pan Hong was instructed to stay behind.","The three children followed Pan Ning into the palace together, came to a side hall,. After being told to wait for a while while the person went in to inform of their arrival. A short while later, there was a voice who told them to go in, only, when Pan Ning want to follow but was stopped again.","“Second Young Master, please wait a moment, His Majesty said to let the three children in, and will summon Second Young Master again in a moment.”","Hearing this, Pan Ning’s heart sank, and he couldn’t help but glance at the three of them.","“Hao’er, take care of the two younger ones.” Pan Ning could only confide.","“Mm.” Hao’er responded and led Muchen and Muyue inside.","When they entered the side hall, they saw that apart from the Emperor in the main seat, there was also an old man standing next to him, as well as, the Abbot and Master Liao Wu standing at the side of the hall.","Perhaps because of the guilt in his heart, when he saw the three children come in, the Abbot folded his hands and murmured, “Amitabha.”","And next to him with his head hanging low, Master Liao Wu did not dare to look at them, after all, the Abbot had warned him time and time again to not say a single word, but in the end it was him who had divulged it."]},{"number":4490,"title":"Chapter 4490: Infuriated","paragraphs":["Chapter 4490: Infuriated","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Heh heh heh, so these are the three little immortals?”","Sitting above the Emperor’s eyes burst out a strange light, he looked at the three children standing before him. Seeing that the oldest was about ten years old, but was born extremely well, the contours of the features were clear and handsome. It can be seen that, in the future, he will grow into a man with an extremely outstanding appearance.","What surprised him more was that the breath of this little boy was so different, he had a regal and noble temperament which could not be hidden, this was not something an average child could have, looking at him, the conjecture in his heart was more firm.","This little teenager must be an Immortal!","He then took a look at the pair of children who were standing next to him. They were around four years old, the small two people looked exactly the same, excellent features, exquisite and lovely, he could not move his eyes away from them.","These three children each had their own characteristics, and were all born so extraordinary, even his own children, none of them were comparable to them, to say that they weren’t Immortals? How could he believe that?","The three of them stood and watched without speaking.","Seeing this, the Emperor then looked at Liao Wu and asked, “Which child was the one who shook out the divination lot at that time?”","“Back to the Emperor, it was, it was that little girl.” Liao Wu said somewhat nervously, but did not dare to look at Hao’er and the three of them.","The Abbot sighed lightly and said, “Emperor, the matter of the divination lot is not serious enough, they, too, are just ordinary children.”","“Ha ha ha, whether they are Immortals or not, this Emperor will decide for himself.” The Emperor laughed softly, obviously, not taking his words seriously, but after looking at the three children, his eyes finally landed on Yue’er’s body, revealing a soft smile as he asked, “What is your name?”","Yue’er glanced at her Big Brother, then said, “My name is Xuanyuan Muyue.”","“Bold! In front of the Emperor, how dare you be so rude!” A chorus of voices rang out, it was the man who had brought them in.","The Emperor picked up the tea and took a sip, as if he didn’t hear the shout.","Seeing this, the eunuch shouted again, “When you see the Emperor, why don’t you all hurry up and kneel down!”","Hao’er’s face went cold, and the breath on his body followed suit, even Muchen tensed his face and pursed his lips, his face showing displeasure.","“Your Majesty...” The Abbot opened his mouth, but was again stopped by the Emperor, who was sitting on the upper seat, raising his hand.","He looked at the three children standing below and smiled, “No matter how honourable your origin is, when you arrive here and see This Emperor, you have to kneel and salute, because This Emperor is the most supreme lord here, however, if you yourselves personally admit that you are Immortals, then naturally you don’t have to kneel, not only that, This Emperor will treat you with the state’s rites.”","“We will not kneel.” Hao’er said, his gaze falling on that Emperor who claimed his own superiority.","“Then you mean to say that you are Immortals?” The Emperor’s eyes lit up as he said, “In that case, you guys quickly show your immortal spells to open my eyes, as Immortals, can you really live forever?”","“We are not Immortals.” Hao’er said coldly. They were not Immortals in the first place, but people who cultivated immortality.","Upon hearing this, the Emperor’s face, which originally still had a smile on his face, suddenly sank, and the teacup in his hand was thrown to one side, making a loud bang, and the tea even overflowed from the teacup, splattering all over the table.","“How dare you all tease This Emperor!”","He bellowed with rage as his face sank, showing his majesty and prestige. The Emperor was furious, except for Hao’er and his siblings, everyone else’s heart sank."]},{"number":4491,"title":"Chapter 4491: Do you dare to vouch","paragraphs":["Chapter 4491: Do you dare to vouch","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Amitabha, please calm your anger, Your Majesty.” The Abbot spoke softly as he stepped forward and said with benevolence, “They are just children.”","The movement in the hall made Pan Ning, who was guarding the outside, feel anxious, and tried to go in several times, but was stopped, so he could only walk around outside anxiously.","In the middle of the remote hall","“Just children? Hmph! Have you ever seen a child who would remain unruffled, unshocked, and unperturbed under This Emperor’s wrath?” He snorted coldly, narrowed his eyes and stared at the three children standing there, and his heart secretly appreciated. These three children were so young, but their guts were great! It seems that they were truly the children of Immortals.","His expression was furious, but his mind was flying, as his majestic gaze swept to the Abbot and said, “You two, first retreat!”","“Your Majesty.....”","“Stand down!” He bellowed again with a sombre expression.","Unable to do anything about it, the Abbot could only let out a light sigh and walk outside, and behind him, Liao Wu was even more quiet as he followed with his head hung low.","The eunuch who brought the three children in, also quietly retreated. In the large hall, only the Emperor, as well as an old man beside him and the three siblings remained.","After showing his majesty, he looked at the three children standing below and said, “Tell us! What exactly are you people? Since you have the body of an Immortal, why have you come here? How did you all come here? In this world, is there really a land of Immortals?”","“I don’t know.”","Hao’er said, not afraid of that Emperor who reigned superior over the mortals. With his current strength, since he can protect his younger siblings in this mortal realm, if he really can’t stay, then they just had to leave this place. Anyway, they still had to go and find their way back.","“Aren’t you afraid that This Emperor will kill you?” His gaze narrowed slightly, staring at the dangerous colour in their eyes as he said, “Even if you aren’t afraid, could it be, that you aren’t afraid of involving the entire Pan family?”","Listening to these words, Hao’er’s face became colder and colder, and a touch of coldness crossed his eyes, even Muchen and Muyue, although they did not speak, a touch of anger fleeted across their eyes as well.","The old man standing beside the Emperor had been secretly observing them, and found that after hearing the Emperor’s words, the aura on the three of them suddenly changed. Among them, the oldest child’s eyes flickered with murderous intent that made his heart tremble.","It was precisely for this reason that when the Emperor was about to open his mouth to threaten, he hastily spoke out to stop it, “Emperor, why don’t we let the second Young Master of the Pan Family come in? Perhaps, he will know where they came from.”","Inexplicably, that aura that permeated out from that older child’s body caused a chill to run down his back, and he only felt a tingling coldness.","When the Emperor glanced at him, he nodded, so the old man raised his breath and called out towards the outside.","Pan Ning, who had been waiting outside for a long time, worried that he didn’t know what would happen inside, and after hearing the call for him to go in, he hurriedly went in with quick steps.","“Pan Ning greets the Emperor.” He stepped forward and bowed, glancing out of the corner of his eye towards the several children.","He noticed that Hao’er’s breath was slightly cold, and his little face was also a frosty. While Muchen had his lips pursed and didn’t say anything, and Yue’er lowered her head and played with the corner of her own coat, seeing this, he secretly sighed in relief.","“Pan Ning, This Emperor asks you, are you clear about the origins of these three children?”","The man in the throne narrowed his eyes and inquired. Having been on the throne for a long time, ruling a kingdom and holding power in his hands, he wanted that endless lifespan too much. Thus, even if the other party was the Pan family, one of the prized subordinates under him, he still had to ask for a clarification.","“Forgive me, Your Majesty, I do not know where they came from.” Pan Ning hung his head low and spoke.","“Do you dare vouch with the lives of the entire hundreds of people in your Pan family that you are telling the truth and you’ve not hidden anything from This Emperor?” He asked with a cold face."]},{"number":4492,"title":"Chapter 4492: Not an Immortal","paragraphs":["Chapter 4492: Not an Immortal","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Pan Ning’s heart sank, still hanging down his head respectfully said, “I really don’t know where they came from. Back then, I brought them back, just because I saw that they were in trouble and they were travelling on their own without any adults around, so I brought them back to my home, I, I don’t dare to deceive Your Majesty.”","Seeing this, the Emperor pursed his lips, glanced at him, then turned his gaze to the little girl in the little pink dress, saying, “Earlier, you said that you called Xuanyuan Muyue?”","“Mm Hmm~” Yue’er nodded.","“Then what are your parents’ names?”","Yue’er’s pair of beautiful eyes lit up and there was a twinkle in her eyes as she said with a smile, “My Father’s name is Xuanyuan Mo Ze, and my Mother’s name is Feng Jiu.”","Listening to the little girl’s words, the Emperor eased his expression and asked, “Then where are they now?”","“I don’t know! We forgot how to get home.” Yue’er’s soft and childish voice rang out again with innocence and dismay.","“Then you ...” He was about to ask again, when he saw the eunuch who had previously withdrawn hurry in with an excited face.","“Emperor, great joy, Emperor, great joy!”","When the Emperor, who was originally about to get angry, heard this, he leaned towards the dragon chair and asked nonchalantly, “Where does the joy come from?”","“Reporting back to the Emperor, the Immortal has come into the palace, and is now coming to the side hall, does the Emperor want to see it now? Or ...”","“You said Immortal?”","Originally leaning on the throne, the Emperor’s face rejoiced and violently stood up, his face could not hide his excitement as he asked, “Where is the Immortal now? Quickly, invite him in!” He thought for a moment, suppressed the joy in his heart, sat down again, looked at the several people in the hall, waved his hand and said, “Alright, you all can retreat first. Go outside and wait first, in a moment This Emperor still has something to ask you.”","In his opinion, even if these three children had sought a divination that the Buddha had manifested, it was still not as exciting to him as an Immortal’s visit.","Pan Ning hurriedly answered and led Hao’er’s trio out of the side hall, just at this moment, a man wearing a wide robe with a goatee walking towards him saw Muchen and Muyue and Hao’er’s trio, his eyes lit up, his steps couldn’t help but give a start as he stared at them, his breathing even a little ragged.","The other party’s gaze carried an inexplicable burning heat, making it difficult for Hao’er’s trio not to notice, the three of them looked towards the man, the two younger ones were nothing, they just frowned, their delicate little faces carried unhappiness, while Hao’er’s face turned cold when he saw the man, a hint of murderous intent crossed his eyes.","Because, he detected the aura on the other party, was not some Immortal cultivator, but a demon.","“Hao’er, what’s wrong?” Seeing that he had stopped and his cold gaze had been staring at that Immortal, Pan Ning couldn’t help but ask in a low voice.","Watching the man being led in by the eunuch and disappearing from sight, Hao’er then said, “This is not the place to talk.”","Pan Ning nodded, there were many eyes and ears in this palace, this was definitely not the place to talk, it was just that, the Emperor had asked them to wait outside here, and they couldn’t go far.","“Amitabha, several benefactors.”","The Abbot’s voice came, and when the few people looked, they saw him and Liao Wu standing not far away were looking at them.","Seeing this, Pan Ning led them over, and before he could speak, the Abbot looked apologetically at Hao’er’s trio and said, “Three benefactors, it is we who have brought trouble to the three of you.” He was very sorry in his heart, but it was a pity that at the moment, things had developed to such a state that there was no way to cover it up.","Muchen coldly harrumphed and swept a glance at the two."]},{"number":4493,"title":"Chapter 4493: Pill Enhancer","paragraphs":["Chapter 4493: Pill Enhancer","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Being looked at by a tiny child with such cold eyes, Yu Wu also hung his head down in shame, after all, in this matter, it was they who were wrong in the first place, what’s more, they were still monks, but they caused the three children to be in such a situation, they really shouldn’t be.","“Things have already happened, it’s useless to say more.” Pan Ning said, gently patting Muchen’s shoulder.","Over here, a few people were talking, while there in the side hall, the Emperor looked at the man in the wide robes, his heart somewhat suspicious. Is this person an immortal? Looking at the man, he didn’t look like any of them, was he not a fake?","So, then thought to try him a try.","“Dare to ask the immortal, where is the immortal village? What kind of immortal arts are you practising? I wonder, will I have the honour to see an immortal’s immortal techniques?” He inquired, his gaze falling on the bearded man.","“Hehe, Little Immortal is travelling around, and hearing that the Emperor has the heart to seek immortality, I have come to take a look.” He stroked his beard and laughed, looking at the Emperor sitting above him, he said, “There is nothing wrong with the Emperor wanting to see Little Immortal’s Immortal Technique, after all, the Holy Emperor is the True Dragon Son of Heaven, so what is the harm in taking a look?”","Between words, he smiled with one hand behind his back, one hand behind him, with the breath surging, the whole person will slowly fly up to the ground, under the feet of the place, there is a white cloud cohesion and rise, so that his whole person looks immortal, transcendental.","” Hiss! Immortal ah! It’s really an immortal!”","Even the Emperor could not help but draw in a breath of cold air when he saw this scene, and he stood up in excitement. This is the first time he has seen the legendary immortals, immortals can really fly in the clouds, really extraordinary!","Even the old man who had been standing beside the emperor could not help but shrink his gaze when he saw this scene, apparently, it was also the first time he had seen the legendary Immortal’s means.","“Immortal, dare I ask how I can achieve longevity?” He couldn’t wait to ask.","Hearing this, that Immortal’s heart stirred, his eyes flashed, one hand stroked his beard, and with a flick of his sleeve, a pot of alchemy pill appeared on the side of the hall.","Looking at the huge medicinal pill that appeared out of thin air, the emperor was even more convinced that this was an immortal without a doubt, ask, in addition to the immortal, who else can turn out such a huge thing out of thin air?","“Immortal, this is ...” he asked with some doubt.","He slowly fell down, the white clouds under his feet disappeared, stood with his hands in the air, and said unhurriedly, “This is the alchemy furnace of the Emperor, if the Emperor wants to live forever, he only needs the Emperor to refine a medicinal pill and take it to live forever, it’s just ...”","“Just what?” The emperor asked in a hurry.","That immortal looked at the Emperor and laughed: “Only, this mortal medicine, but not spiritual medicine, can not be used at all, even if this immortal has the heart to help the Emperor to get long life, but also has the heart to not be able to do so.”","Hearing these words, he was stunned and hurriedly asked, “What then? Is there any other way? Immortal, please be sure to help This Emperor achieve his wish for immortality! I can grant you the title of State Master, endless money as well as supreme status!”","He stroked his beard, glanced at him, and said, “If the Emperor really wants to achieve longevity, this Immortal here does have a solution, and, just now, I saw an excellent pill enhancer.”","“What kind of pill enhancer? Immortal please say, whatever it is, I will certainly fetch it.” He spoke urgently.","That Immortal’s eyes flashed and said, “Earlier when I came in, I saw two identical looking children, those two children have extremely pure Spirit Energy in them, if they were refined into a medicinal pill to be consumed by the Emperor, the Emperor would surely be able to achieve longevity.”"]},{"number":4494,"title":"Chapter 4494: Suspicion","paragraphs":["Chapter 4494: Suspicion","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Hearing these words, not to mention the emperor, even the old man who stood without saying anything had his gaze narrowed, clearly in some disbelief.","Refining a child into a medicinal pill? That, how could that be possible?","The emperor was stunned and looked at him, not speaking for half a second. Refining that three or four year old child into a medicinal pill? This kind of thing, was just too bloody and cruel, he had never even thought of such a thing.","Even though he wanted to gain longevity, he was not a dim ruler, such a thing that would cause heavenly fury and human hatred, even if he was an emperor, he would not dare to do it.","“Immortal, you said that refining those two children into medicinal pills and taking them would lead to immortality?” He frowned and looked at the immortal in front of him, saying, “Those are just two better-looking children, how could they have that kind of miraculous effect? What’s more, refining people into medicinal pills, this, this isn’t ... “Evil arts he didn’t dare to say, after all, lest he angered the Immortal in front of him.","“Emperor, even though you are the Nine to Five, you can’t see that, those two children are pregnant with innate Spirit Energy, a great tonic Spirit Foetus, this kind of Spirit Foetus, but meet can’t be sought.” There was a hint of excitement in his eyes, thinking of those two children, he couldn’t help but gulp.","The emperor looked at his complexion, his heart moved, gradually calmed down, the original excitement of the heart also cooled down like splashing a pot of cold water, he smiled and said, “Immortal, let’s do it this way! You all the way over also tired, first go to rest for a while, this matter, to be This Emperor think about it.”","“Good, but, Emperor, those two children, keep an eye on them.” He put away the medicinal pill, uneasily confided, but did not think of anything else, thinking that, when a mortal thinks of gaining longevity, how would he think of anything else?","But I do not want to, his hall of a country emperor, and not a dim king, things will always think again, and will not really follow his words, will be the two children arrested and refined into medicinal pills?","After letting people bring him down, the emperor sat on the dragon chair, slowly exhaled a breath, silent for half a minute, asked: “What do you think?”","The old man thought for a moment and said, “There is something different about this matter, Immortals are supposed to be people of the righteous path, so would they take children to refine medicinal pills? Such a bloody and cruel thing, even those with blood on their hands would not think of it, not to mention, why would it be those two children?”","The old man’s voice paused for a moment, and somewhat hesitantly added: “Moreover, I have been observing that Immortal, and saw that when that Immortal was talking about that child, there was a gleam in his eyes, and there was also a gagging motion, so I’m only afraid that if it was really refined into a medicinal pill, it would be him who would want to eat it, right?”","The emperor nodded and said, “I also feel that this immortal’s demeanour, speech and actions are somewhat not quite the same as the immortals in that immortal rumour, but, he does know immortal magic again.”","“Those three children are also not ordinary people, they were too calm when they saw the Emperor, they were not frightened or panicked, they are not ordinary people, the Emperor might as well ask from them again.” The old man suggested.","Hearing this, the emperor contemplated for a while, and his mind was made up, he called out for someone to go and bring the Pan Ning several people.","Pan Ning, who was speaking with Abbot and the others, heard the summons and then bowed with the two men and walked back with the three children. And after thinking it over, Abbot and Liao Wu also followed.","“Why are you all here as well?” The Emperor glanced at the Abbot and Liao Wu who followed in behind him and raised an eyebrow.","“Amitabha, back to the Emperor, the matter started because of us, we don’t dare to stay out of it.” The Abbot said with his hands folded."]},{"number":4495,"title":"Chapter 4495: Certain","paragraphs":["Chapter 4495: Certain","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The Emperor looked at them askance, then said, ‘since you’re here, then stand aside and listen!” As he said that, he then looked at the three children standing in the middle, his gaze skimming over Hao’er before landing on the two younger ones.","What exactly was so special about these two children? How dare they say that if they were refined into medicinal pills, they could achieve longevity? His heart wondered, thinking that if he really refined these two children into a medicinal pill, would he still be able to swallow that pill?","When the crowd saw him staring at the two small children, they couldn’t help but speculate, what was he thinking? What was on his mind?","For a long time, the Emperor came to his senses, coughed lightly, looked at the three of them and asked: “Just now, did you see that Immortal?”","Hao’er did not say anything, just looked at him.","Yue’er, on the other hand, blinked her eyes and asked curiously, “That one with a goatee is an Immortal?”","“Goatee?” The corners of the Emperor’s mouth twitched slightly, clenching his hand in a fist against the corner of his mouth, then, he said, “Well, yes, that’s him.”","He looked at the three of them, a glint of flashed by his eyes, and said tentatively, “He told This Emperor that by refining you two little ones into medicinal pills and taking them, he could achieve long life.”","When the words fell, he instantly felt that the breath in the side hall chilled, an icy cold breath suddenly filled this air, moreover, there was also a vague pressure that was so oppressive that it made people a little breathless spread out, making his heart startled, his gaze shrunk, and he fiercely looked towards Xuanyuan Hao, who had on a cold face.","This child’s aura was even more regal than him as an Emperor? How could that be?!","At the same time, his heart was shocked, vaguely, he felt the breath in his body tumbling up towards his throat, a trace of blood spread between his mouth, he stifled a grunt, and sprayed a mouthful of blood violently.","“Pfft!”","“Emperor!”","“Your Majesty!”","“Emperor!”","The old man and Pan Ning as well as the Abbot and Liao Wu in the hall were all startled and let out a fierce cry of alarm.","After that cry of alarm, the old man who was guarding the Emperor’s side immediately attacked Hao’er, but he didn’t expect that before he could get close to Hao’er’s body, his entire body was sent flying by Hao’er’s raised hand with a flick of his hand, and with a thud, he crashed heavily into the corner of the hall, spitting out fresh blood from his mouth, and he couldn’t stand up for a half a second.","Pan Ning’s face changed, hurriedly called out, anxiously said, “Hao’er! Calm down a bit!”","“Big Brother.”","Yue’er pulled on his sleeve and softly called out. Children were the most sensitive, and she could clearly feel that this Emperor did not have murderous intent towards them.","“Hmph!”","Hao’er coldly snorted, retracted the pressure released before in an instant and it was as if it had never appeared. However, only the people in the palace knew, just now, it was the Emperor who spat out a mouthful of blood.","The Emperor was also shocked, he only felt a pressure enveloping his head, the breath that pressured him had caused him to gasp for air instantly disappeared, his whole person felt relaxed and he felt alive again. That feeling was too mysterious, so much so that, after he calmed his mind, the gaze which he looked at Hao’er were unusually crystal bright.","At this moment, he could be certain that these three children, were by no means ordinary children, but Immortals!","“Cough!”","He coughed lowly twice, wiping away the blood from the corner of his mouth, and said, “Don’t worry, I don’t have any malicious intent, because This Emperor suspects that the Immortal, is not an Immortal, and so, that’s why he thought to test you all.”","He looked at Hao’er, as well as Muyue and Muchen, his eyes were crystal bright and he said with certainty, “However, he is not an Immortal, you guys, must be!”"]},{"number":4496,"title":"Chapter 4496: Immortal's Abilities","paragraphs":["Chapter 4496: Immortal’s Abilities","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Listening to his words, not only was Pan Ning’s entire forehead drenched in cold sweat, he was so frightened that he could only feel his clothes sticking to his entire back. Lest he was angry, he would take his anger out on the entire Pan family and with this thought echoing in his mind, his body was a little stiff, and did not dare to speak, just hang down his head to force himself to calmly stand there.","If, if his Big Brother was here, he would have known what to do by now ....","Hao’er looked at the Emperor whose eyes were bright as he started with him with fervour. With pursed lips, seeing that there was no one else here, just a few who knew their details, he then said wryly: “We are not Immortals, but, we are cultivators who cultivate towards immortality.”","Upon hearing this, the Emperor’s heart was delighted, and immediately revealed a smile, wanting to ask something, but then he wrinkled his brow, and asked, “What about that Immortal from earlier? Is he the same as you?”","“Who said that that was an Immortal cultivator?” Hao’er gave him a sidelong glance and said, “That’s just a demon.”","“What? Demon!” The Emperor was shocked and couldn’t help but change his face slightly, “There is even that thing in this world?”","Seeing that he had already divulged some information earlier, Hao’er continued, “There are Immortals and there are demons, what’s so strange about that? It’s just that the Spirit Energy of your mortal realm is extremely weak, so there should be fewer things that have been cultivated into demons, so presumably, that demonic creature came from somewhere else.”","“This mortal realm of ours? Could it be that there are other heavens and earths in this world besides this one?” The Emperor asked in a daze, only feeling that previously untouched mysteries were unfolding before him little by little.","“That is natural.”","Hao’er looked at them and said, “There are three thousand worlds in this world, and the mortal realm you are in is only the lowest layer. In this mortal realm, no cultivators who can cultivate Immortality will be born, and unless there is some great chance, otherwise, in your whole life, you won’t even see a cultivator.”","“But This Emperor has seen you all! Hahahahahaha! Does this prove that This Emperor is also someone with great fortune?” A burning intent flickered in his eyes, and a look of excitement faintly appeared on his face.","Hao’er glanced at him, pursed her lips, and thought: This Emperor, his skin was unusually thick!","“Back then, when Pan Hong had been deemed to not live through that night, I think it was also you who saved him, right?” The Emperor didn’t care about his silence, he was still in the midst of excitement at this point, staring at the three of them with a burning gaze, asking, “What immortal skills do you have? Can you perform them for me to see?”","“You haven’t suffered yet?” Hao’er looked at him with a strange expression, secretly thinking: Does this person have a tendency to seek abuse?","“Heh heh heh, This Emperor wants to know if you can move clouds and fog? Whether you can move mountains and seas? Whether you can ...” words did not finish, said Hao’er interrupted.","“Will not.” Hao’er grunted lightly with a cold face.","“Then what do you know?” He asked again in a hurry.","Seeing this, the Abbot who stood aside without saying anything, but was secretly digesting their words, hurriedly stepped forward, and with both hands joining together, recited a Buddhist phrase: “Amitabha, Your Majesty, This Monk feels that right now, we should talk about, the matter of the demon who is in this palace. There is now the presence of that kind of demonic presence, that’s a great threat.”","“Cough!”","The Emperor coughed lightly, at this time also remembered that demon, immediately slowed down his expression, put up the majesty of the Emperor, looked at Hao’er three people, said, ” If that demon hadn’t said that he wanted to eat you guys, This Emperor might not have been suspicious, however, now that we know that he is a demon, what kind of demon is he? And are you all able to deal with it?”"]},{"number":4497,"title":"Chapter 4497: Golden Toad","paragraphs":["Chapter 4497: Golden Toad","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Even if the three people in front of them were children, but, they were Immortals who cultivated the Immortal Arts, what they couldn’t do, didn’t mean they couldn’t do it! Thinking of this, there was a vague hint of anticipation in his heart, if he could see them deal with that demon, it would also be good to see what they were capable of.","Hao’er frowned and was about to speak when an eerie voice came in.","“Hahahahahaha! Is this a discussion to deal with me?”","A strong wind whistled past, and a figure swept in violently, almost without pause, pouncing towards Muchen and Muyue, but, as it pounced towards them, it was violently bounced away by a force.","“Pfffft!”","The figure was violently bounced to the side, and a mouthful of blood was spewed out as well, as he transformed into his human form, his figure landed on his feet and stepped back, narrowing his eerie gaze at the two children.","“There’s even a treasure that protects against evil!”","Pan Ning let out a low cry, only to feel that in the previous moment the whole person was pulled away and pushed aside, only to see that it was Hao’er who pushed him away, otherwise, he would have been hit by the demon.","Everyone was shocked at the same time and could not help but look at the human-like demon, if Hao’er had not said it, how would they identify that this person was actually a demon?","Hao’er looked towards Muchen and Muyue and asked, “Are the two of you alright?”","Precisely because he knew that the two little ones had protective treasures on their bodies given by their father and mother, and were not afraid of the demon getting close to them, he did not pull them away at that moment, just so that the demon could taste the result of the rebound of the demonic power.","“We’re fine.” The two younger ones shook their heads, not a trace of fear apparent on their face.","“Go aside.”","Hao’er signalled, before looking at the demonic creature, his hand moved, a sword glowing with cold light appeared in his hand with a swoosh, the hidden spirit energy in his body spread out with the surge of his strength, the spirit energy that was visible to the naked eye wrapped around him, making his whole person look more and more extraordinary. Seeing this, the Emperor and the old man’s gazes shrunk, with a hidden look of shock in their eyes.","Pan Ning had seen Hao’er kill people, but had never seen him kill a demon. At this time, when he saw his sword that appeared out of thin air again, his heart could not help but jump.","When he saw the sword held in Hao’er’s hand, with the spirit energy permeating out from the sword, the demon disguised as a human was startled and immediately took a step back, staring at him in shock: “Golden Core cultivator! How is that possible!”","How could a child of around ten years old reach the level of a Golden Core cultivator? It was impossible!","“Dare to have ideas on my younger siblings? Hmph! I’ll make sure that your soul will be dispersed and you won’t be able to have any chance to live!” Hao’er snorted coldly, pointing the long sword in his hand towards the ground, his figure swept forward violently, the sword moving at will, slashing towards the demonic creature at a speed that was faster than sound.","“Hiss! Noooooooo!”","He cried out in shock, not caring about his human form, and immediately swooped into his original form in an attempt to flee.","The other people in the hall only saw that the demonic creature, which was in human form one moment, became a huge golden toad leaping on the ground with his leap, avoiding Hao’er’s attack with great speed.","“Swoosh! Bang!”","The ground was cut out a sword mark, a huge explosion resound, startling the guards outside, but, at this time, no one even paid attention to the outside as Hao’er’s second sword attack landed and the golden toad screamed miserably. A leg was lopped off and flew out, green blood splattered all over the ground. Hao’er was just about to deal a finishing blow to it when it suddenly changed its trajectory and pounced towards the Emperor seated on the throne instead."]},{"number":4498,"title":"Chapter 4498: Execute them on the spot","paragraphs":["Chapter 4498: Execute them on the spot","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Your Majesty!”","“Your Majesty!”","The Abbot as well as Pan Ning’s face changed and exclaimed in shock, while the Emperor did not expect that demonic creature to suddenly come towards him. He instinctively shrunk back and wanted to avoid it, but his body couldn’t move as if it was controlled by a force.","At the same time, the old man beside the Emperor swept forward desperately, the sword in his hand slashed at the golden toad, but there was only a clang as the sword in his hand was flicked away at the same time and he was sent flying out.","“Bang!”","The old man flew back and crashed into a corner and when he looked up, he saw that golden toad hugging the Emperor’s body, and in the next moment, letting out an insidious laugh, he suddenly turned into a ray of light and disappeared in front of everyone’s eyes.","“Your Majesty!”","The old man was startled, holding onto the wall and standing up, when he saw the Imperial Guards outside rushing in, and the Commander of the Imperial Guards roared in a deep voice, “Who dares to commit an assassination in the palace! Arrest him!”","“Stop!” Pan Ning shouted sharply, hurriedly blocking Hao’er behind him, facing the Commander of the Imperial Guards, saying, “Misunderstanding, it’s just a misunderstanding!”","“No one has committed an assassination, you all stand down!” The old man wiped away the blood at the corner of his mouth and commanded the Commander of the Imperial Guards.","Seeing that old man speak, the Commander of the Imperial Guards hesitated for a moment and was about to retreat when he heard the Emperor’s voice.","“Heh heh heh heh ...”","That laughter, which was a bit eerie, caused the hearts of the people in the hall to lift inexplicably, especially the few people who had previously seen that demonic creature pounce on the Emperor and disappear into his body, their faces were unusually grave.","“It’s not a misunderstanding, these people are sure that they are trying to assassinate This Emperor, arrest them!” That Emperor who originally had his eyes closed opened his eyes and spoke in a sinister manner, the look on that face carried a few moments of strangeness and excitement, causing Pan Ning, the Abbot as well as that old man’s heart to sink.","Was the Emperor being controlled by a demon?","However, before they could slow down from that unbelievable shock, they heard the Commander of the Imperial Guards behind them respond respectfully, “Yes!”","“Arrest them all!”","With a command, the Imperial Guards surged out and quickly brought Abbot and Liao Wu under control, as they approached Pan Ning, the Imperial Guards were repelled by Pan Ning, and droned in a deep voice, “Things are not as you see them!”","“They won’t listen to you, the only one they’ll listen to will be the Emperor, only, the Emperor is possessed and controlled by that demon.” Hao’er said calmly, his cold little face was indifferent, but he was holding a sword across the body of his siblings, while his mind was rapidly thinking of ways.","“You guys back off!” The old man sank his voice and roared, telling the Imperial Guards to stand down.","The old man was the Emperor’s confidant and usually spoke with heavy weight, but at this moment, the commander of the Imperial Guards hesitated.","“Leave those two little ones alive, the others, execute them on the spot!” The Emperor’s gloomy voice sounded at this moment, undoubtedly making the atmosphere in the hall, which was already tense, more tense with each passing moment.","“Yes!” The Commander of the Imperial Guards no longer hesitated, drawing his sword and attacking towards Pan Ning and the others in the hall.","Even though there were doubts, but, a direct order was an order from the Emperor, they only needed to carry it out, no need to question it!","Seeing the sword coming towards him, Pan Ning drew a breath of cold air, he had no weapon in his hand, at this time he could not resist, he could only retreat, but then bumped into Hao’er behind him.","Hao’er pursed his lips, the sword in his hand swung, a sword qi slashed out and the Imperial Guards were all sent flying back. He turned back, looked towards the Emperor, as he looked at him with mockery and disdain, “Hmph! Do you really think that I can’t kill you if you hide inside?”"]},{"number":4499,"title":"Chapter 4499: Shock","paragraphs":["Chapter 4499: Shock","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Hehe, come and kill me! Hmph! The worst outcome, I’ll just pull this unlucky Emperor’s along if you want to destroy me!” He stared eerily at Hao’er and said, “I don’t know what your origin is, but, you broke my leg and spoiled my good deed, I will definitely have my vengence!”","The door was closed by Pan Ning and the old man, Liao Wu also went to help block it, while the Abbot looked at Hao’er and asked with some concern, “Is there any way to force that demon out of the Emperor’s body? That’s the Emperor, we can’t afford to make a mistake.”","Yue’er’s crafty eyes turned slightly as she took out an object from her body and handed it to her brother, saying, “Big Brother, use this!”","“Don’t take it off!” Hao’er shouted in a hurry, however at the same time, Yue’er had already taken off that body protection magic treasure and in that moment, the aura in the surroundings immediately changed as it turned chilly. They could also hear vague voices that sounded next to their ears.","“Hiss! This ...”","The Abbot was also stunned, forgive him for being the Abbot of the Imperial Temple, but he had never been through such a situation! Where on earth did so many Yin souls come out from? One by one, they were floating in the corners of this hall, as waves of ghostly voices resounded .","Yue’er didn’t expect that just by removing the treasure from her body, so many Yin Spirits had appeared around her, so she hurriedly put it back on.","Hao’er took a deep breath and seriously said to Muchen and Muyue, “Didn’t I tell you to remember my words? The things on your body should not be taken off! Once those Yin souls get close to you, I won’t even know how to save you if father and mother aren’t here!”","“Big Brother, I’m sorry.”","Yue’er lowered her head, she didn’t want to cause trouble, she just wanted to help Big Brother to force out that Golden Toad Demon, after all, if there was a treasure on her body, that Golden Toad Demon would not dare to attach itself to that Emperor’s body.","“You must remember that no one’s life is as valuable as the lives of the two of you, no matter what, you must put your own safety first!” Hao’er chided and after glancing at the two of them, his eyes were fixed on that Emperor, and in the next moment, he attacked with acute precision.","That golden toad did not even think about it, then shot out to resist, but no matter, its strength is really not able to beat the Golden Core cultivator, not to mention it is still such a small perverse genius. Under the panic, it was bound by a rope, and was tied to the throne and couldn’t move.","“What do you want!” He stared at Hao’er in panic as he saw him approach step by step, and at that moment, he shouted loudly, “Someone come! Save This Emperor! Quickly save This Emperor!”","Marquis Qibo had came to the palace to say a few words because Pan Hong was worried that the three children might have an accident and had looked for him to help on this. As he was also curious about the three children and liked them, so after Pan Hong had come to the door to ask for an audience, he agreed to come into the palace to see what was going on.","But never in his wildest dreams would he have expected that when he arrived at the palace, the sight that shocked him silly was a group of guards surrounded the door to the hall and were banging frantically at the door. What made his heart pound in fear was that from inside the hall, there was a frantic cry of help from the Emperor. Seeing all this, his expression turned solemn as he strode forward, and asked in a deep voice: “What happened? Who is bold enough to hold the Emperor hostage?”","“Marquis Qibo!”","The Commander of the Imperial Guards saw him and hurriedly stepped forward, “The Young Master of the Pan family and Abbot are all inside, they are holding the Emperor hostage for some reason and want to use it against him. The door is locked and blocked, and we are afraid that rushing in they will use it against the Emperor, we don’t know what to do at the moment, I still ask you to make a decision!”","When Marquis Qibo heard this, he frowned: “What?! The Abbot and Young Master Pan and the others are all inside? Then how could something like this happen? Is there some kind of misunderstanding?! Step back and let this Marquis ask!”"]},{"number":4500,"title":"Chapter 4500: Appalled","paragraphs":["Chapter 4500: Appalled","Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Upon hearing this, the Commander of the Imperial Guards waved his hand and signalled for the crowd to back away, stepping forward and shouting, “Pan Ning, what the hell is going on with you guys? Hurry and open the door!”","“Marquis, we have no intention of harming the Emperor, it’s just that, right now, this matter can’t be explained in a sentence or two, and in order to prevent the Imperial Guards from coming in and accidentally injuring someone, so we can’t open this door.” Pan Ning replied in haste, looking towards the Emperor who was tied up at the throne he couldn’t help but ask urgently, “Hao’er, how is it?”","Doing such a thing, even if the Emperor was possessed by a demon, it was still a matter of great disrespect, he was taking the entire Pan family’s life on the line here, as well as those ghostly apparitions that were floating between the air, it was really scary as hell.","“Bastard! What can’t be opened? Open the door and let this Marquis Qibo in! Otherwise, if you frighten the Emperor, you won’t be able to take the blame!” Marquis Qibo was shouting with all his might outside, but seeing that no one answered again, his face sank and he took a step back.","“How many people are inside? Do you know?” He asked in a deep voice.","“There aren’t many people, besides the Abbot and Master of the Imperial Temple, there are three children, as well as Tian Du Lao who is also by the Emperor’s side.” The Imperial Guards hurriedly spoke.","Hearing this, he pondered for a while, and commanded the Imperial Guard, “Without my permission, you should not act rashly, I will go in and see what is going on.”","Although they had said that Pan Ning held the Emperor hostage, he did not believe them. The Pan family were deeply trusted by the Emperor, almost can be said to be of the same heart as the Emperor, otherwise, it would not be their turn to hold high positions.","What’s more, there aren’t many people in this hall, saying hostage or something, it’s impossible to do that kind of thing in front of the Abbot of the Imperial Temple and the three children and other people.","“The door to this hall is closed, how is Marquis going to get in?” The commander of the Imperial Guards asked.","Marquis Qibo glanced at him, and his gaze landed on the more than ten metres high roof of the temple, and at that moment, lifting his Qi and leaping, he quietly landed on top of that roof, heading towards a small skylight up there.","He did not alarm them, but leaned over there to look at the situation. However, with a glance, he could not help but be shocked as the expression on his face froze.","With one look, he saw the Emperor was bound in the throne and was struggling. His face red and hideous, in front of him stood that child called Xuanyuan Hao. At this moment, his hands were making all sorts of weird signs as his mouth was chanting some words, as an aura visible to the naked eye swirled along his fingertips pointing to between the Emperor’s brow. The next moment, he saw an apparition of a golden toad vaguely above the Emperor’s head, screaming in anguish.","Hiss! What’s going on here?","His eyes widened in shock, the scene in that hall had long since gone beyond his perception.","“Arghhhhhhh!”","Miserable screams came out from the Emperor’s mouth, and the appearance of a golden toad faintly surfaced on his body, perhaps unable to withstand that pain, that golden toad clinging to the Emperor’s body shrieked, and in the next moment, a ray of light flashed out, fleeing towards the door of the hall in front of him.","“Hmph! Want to escape?!”","Hao’er coldly snorted, a net with silver light in his hand fiercely spread out to catch the golden toad and tightened it. The more the golden toad struggled, the tighter the silver net tightened, as blood streaks appeared.","“Emperor!”","The old man quickly stepped forward to pick up the fainted Emperor, and hurriedly untied the rope on his body, while pinching his accupoint also failed to wake him up.","Marquis Qibo slowed down and hurriedly leapt down from the skylight, only to catch a glimpse of the Yin Souls floating in the corner."]}]);
